}",graphics/icons/industry/battlestation.png,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.impl.OrbitalStation,"A space station, augmented with a heavy bastion and point-defense citadels.

Must be reduced before a bombardment can be attempted.",2020,
