}",graphics/icons/industry/star_fortress.png,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.impl.OrbitalStation,"An up-armored battlestation, featuring Ravelin-class defense drones and an extensive minefield.

Must be reduced before a bombardment can be attempted.",2060,
