}",graphics/icons/industry/orbital_station.png,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.impl.OrbitalStation,"A high-tech space station, featuring heavy rotating shields, a fighter complement, and medium firepower.

Must be reduced before a bombardment can be attempted.",2070,
battlestation_high,Battlestation - High Tech,100,120,,4,orbitalstation_high,starfortress_high,"station, battlestation, unraidable, structure","{
