,,,,,,,,
Trace Organics,organics_trace,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,"$Market is nearly barren of organics reserves, though some extraction is possible.",graphics/icons/markets/organics_trace.png,38
Common Organics,organics_common,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,Economically exploitable reserves of organics can be found on $market.,graphics/icons/markets/organics_common.png,38
Abundant Organics,organics_abundant,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,A river of wealth flows beneath the surface of $market - for those that would find and tap it.,graphics/icons/markets/organics_abundant.png,38
Plentiful Organics,organics_plentiful,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,"Reservoirs of valuable organics burst through the surface of $market in gouts over deep, dark pools that promise oceans of wealth to be found just below.",graphics/icons/markets/organics_plentiful.png,38
