Poor Farmland,farmland_poor,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,Terran plant life grows only stunted and wearily here. It would require farmers with talent equal to their desperation to make these lands bear fruit.,graphics/icons/markets/farmland_poor.png,70
Adequate Farmland,farmland_adequate,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,A robust terran-compatible biosphere allows agricultural cultivation to take place on $market.,graphics/icons/markets/farmland_adequate.png,70
Rich Farmland,farmland_rich,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,The fields of $market promise a rich harvest to reward the farmers that work these fertile lands.,graphics/icons/markets/farmland_rich.png,70
Bountiful Farmland,farmland_bountiful,,TRUE,,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.econ.ResourceDepositsCondition,"$Market is a veritable Eden; flowering, riotous, lush, and luminous with plant life. Branches hang low, laden with fruit; fields of golden grain shimmer in the herbaceous breeze.",graphics/icons/markets/farmland_bountiful.png,70
