# gate interactions,,,,,,"# we can treat $global.gatesActive as ""has working Janus device"" -dgb"
gateOpenDialog,OpenInteractionDialog,$tag:gate,"ShowDefaultVisual
FireAll PopulateGateOptions","A silent ring of adamantine material, derelict of a former age.

The Gate is inert.",,
gateOpenDialogActive,OpenInteractionDialog,"$tag:gate
$global.gatesActive
$gateScanned
$global.playerCanUseGates","ShowDefaultVisual
FireAll PopulateGateOptions","Before you vast and potent hangs an adamantine ring, derelict of a former age.

You have scanned this Gate and discovered the rhythm of the secret heart of the thing, hidden in a slip of space. Using the Janus Device to create a bridge to another Gate requires a massive quantity of fuel. The more distant the target, the more fuel is required.

The Janus Device operates by transferring enormous amounts of peculiarly phased energy via a lead ship's hyperdrive field to stabilize a direct gate-to-gate connection.",,
gateOpenDialogActiveCanNotUse,OpenInteractionDialog,"$tag:gate
$global.gatesActive
$gateScanned
!$global.playerCanUseGates","ShowDefaultVisual
FireAll PopulateGateOptions","Before you vast and potent hangs an adamantine ring, derelict of a former age.

You have scanned this Gate and discovered the rhythm of the secret heart of the thing, hidden in a slip of space. Using the Janus Device to create a bridge to another Gate requires a massive quantity of fuel. The more distant the target, the more fuel is required.

You must integrate the Janus Device into your fleet to use the Gate.",,
