FireBest CheckPlayerHasNoSubstrate","You consult with your technical officer and engineering chief in a small briefing room overlooking a workbay adapted to store and analyze the unusual specimens you've found. They are poring over schematics, deep in an argument over implementation details. You are pleased to note that their disagreement plays out within a foundation built of professional respect.  

They notice you and, in unison, say ""$PlayerSirOrMadam.""

