ShroudedHullmodItemRCMantle2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMM_talk2,,"Engineering is frowning, manipulating a diagram of a ship with abrupt flicks at the interface. ""It'd have to be anchored to the flux grid. Only way to keep it wrapped close enough to the hull geometry.""

""Precisely,"" Tech says. ""To keep the exotic material from diminishing! It will draw energy from incoming projectiles, storing it in the, um... meta-plasma?""

Engineering snorts dismissively.

""Merely a working term,"" Tech says defensively.",ShroudedHMM_talk3:Continue,
ShroudedHullmodItemRCMantle3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMM_talk3,"$option = ShroudedHMM_talk4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""We can't store energy forever in this theoretical, pretend-plasma,"" Engineering says. ""It'll have to go somewhere.""

""Invert the polarity of the flux converters and flicker the drive field. Boom, a gentle bump to local time-space."" Tech looks self-satisfied. ""Um, by which I mean the ship itself.""

""You hope it's a gentle bump."" Engineering frowns, pulling up agrav inertial suppression timing charts. ""If it works.""",,
ShroudedHullmodItemRCMantle4a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMM_talk4,,"""It'll work,"" Tech says.","ShroudedHMM_talk5:""Prove it. I want a full proposal and testing schedule by end-of-shift.""",
ShroudedHullmodItemRCMantle4b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == ShroudedHMM_talk4
$player.didAShroudedHullmodUnlock",,"""It'll work,"" Tech says. ""Remember last time?""","ShroudedHMM_talk5:""Prove it. I want a full proposal and testing schedule by end-of-shift.""",
