ShroudedHullmodItemRCTH2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMTH_talk2,,"Tech is spinning a dazzlingly complex holo-mockup filled with arcing lines and arcane symbols. 

""A cloud of the exotic material could be held within a sort of flickered hyperspace gradient... Theoretically, it would build up charge as outgoing projectiles traverse the 'imbued' field gradient and... theoretically, that extra charge could be sustained then directed at nearby hostiles.""",ShroudedHMTH_talk3:Continue,
ShroudedHullmodItemRCTH3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMTH_talk3,"$player.didAShroudedHullmodUnlock = true
$option = ShroudedHMTH_talk4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Theoretically."" Engineering's arms are crossed below a very skeptical look.

""To operate during combat... hmm. Modifications would have to be made. Shield emitters, drive field, inertial suppression... I'll need to perform some tests.""

Engineering finally notices you observing their talk and stands to attention. ""With your approval, $PlayerSirOrMadam.""",,
ShroudedHullmodItemRCTH4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ShroudedHMTH_talk4,"Highlight ""literally demonic""
DwellerCMD unlockHullmod",You consider the undeniable possibility that the Luddic faith would view any use of this technology as literally demonic. You could be declared a heretical outlaw and hunted by the Knights of Ludd and Luddic Path alike.,"defaultLeave:""Submit a combined report. We'll proceed - theoretically.""",
