TTmarketWeirdModsOutro2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == TTmarket_weirdModsOutro2a,"EndConversation
ShowDefaultVisual","""Ha-ha, that won't be necessary. At all,"" $heOrShe says quickly. ""Thank you captain."" 

""Let me welcome you once again to the port of $marketName, the Tri-Tachyon Corporation will be pleased to enjoy your business partnership during your stay, I'm sure.""

""Keep it in the black, captain.""

$HeOrShe smiles unconvincingly and cuts the link.",cutCommLink:Cut the link,
