CGRmarketWeird1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRmarket_weird1 ,,"The $post looks like they've seen a ghost.

""Captain $playerLastName, by the grace of holy Ludd and all that is blessed, what unholy creation have you brought here? What have you done to your $shipOrFleet?""

The questions are rhetorical, judging by the chimes and pings from your tactical officer's console- targeting alerts from defense batteries.",CGRmarket_weird2:Continue,
CGRmarketWeirdOutro,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRmarket_weird2,"AdjustRep luddic_church HOSTILE -200
AddTextSmall ""Hostility due to use of unusual modifications"" bad
SetShortcut CGRmarket_weirdEnd ""ESCAPE""","""The curates technologia have already passed judgement on your... your unholy combination of human craft and demonic 'technology',"" $heOrShe says.

""Go now from this place and never return! Take your technological abominations and be accursed in the eyes of God and the Church. You are henceforth an abomination to be destroyed on sight!""

$HeOrShe clasps $hisOrHer hands together, mumbling some prayer.",CGRmarket_weirdEnd:Cut the link and take evasive action,
