CGRpatrolWeirdMods0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods0,,"""The blessing of Ludd be upon-"" The $post's eyes go suddenly wide at a red flash from a secondary display.

""By the holy pneuma,"" $heOrShe gasps.","CGRpatrol_weirdMods1:""Is there a problem, $post?""",
CGRpatrolWeirdMods1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods1,,"""What by blessed Ludd's holy right glove have you done to your $shipOrFleet? Is that the cursed work of Moloch my eyes do perceive in your $shipOrFleet?""

$HeOrShe looks over $hisOrHer shoulder, ""Summon the subcurate technologia! For immediate consultation!""

The $post turns back to you. ""You have but a moment to explain what my sensors suggest, captain."" ","CGRpatrol_weirdMods2a:""Is it my... unique modifications you object to?""
CGRpatrol_weirdMods2b:""There seems to be some kind of misunderstanding.""
CGRpatrol_weirdMods2c:""What exactly do your sensors suggest?""",
CGRpatrolWeirdMods2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods2a,,"""Unique mod-"" $HeOrShe sputters.

""It is devilry! You've joined human craft with abomination. It is an unholy thing!""  $HeOrShe makes some kind of hurry-up hand signal over $hisOrHer shoulder.

""You condemn your soul to the abyss. And you condemn yourself as mortal enemy to the Church and accursed in the eyes of God and all who hold faith."" $HisOrHer expression is grim.

The $post turns and exchanges a few words with someone you can't see.",CGRpatrol_weirdMods3:Continue,
CGRpatrolWeirdMods2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods2b,,"""Methinks there is not, $playerSirOrMadam, and you merely dissemble with a devil's tongue to gain advantage."" $HeOrShe makes some kind of hurry-up hand signal over $hisOrHer shoulder.

""Judgement shall be pronounced ere long upon what my heart fears.""

The $post turns and exchanges a few words with someone you can't see.",CGRpatrol_weirdMods3:Continue,
CGRpatrolWeirdMods2c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods2c,,"""Overt devilry. You've combined human craft with abomination."" $HeOrShe makes some kind of hurry-up hand signal over $hisOrHer shoulder.

""By this unholy 'technology' you condemn your soul to the abyss. And you condemn yourself as mortal enemy to the Church, accursed in the eyes of God and all who hold faith!""

The $post turns and exchanges a few words with someone you can't see.",CGRpatrol_weirdMods3:Continue,
CGRpatrolWeirdMods3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == CGRpatrol_weirdMods3,FireAll CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,"""You're certain?"" $heOrShe asks. $HisOrHer face has gone pale, as if $heOrShe has been informed that $heOrShe has been condemned.

The briefest flash of emotions: pain, fear, outrage, sadness, acceptance. The eyes that turn back to the comm-link are that of an enemy across battle-lines.",,
CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpt3a,CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,$player.fcm_faction == luddic_church,,,"CGRpatrol_weirdModsOpt3aSel:""I am commissioned by the Church!""",
CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpt3b,CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,$player.luddicAttitudeFaithful,,,"CGRpatrol_weirdModsOpt3bSel:""Hold your condemnation for a moment, for I share your Faith.""",
CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpt3c,CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,,,,"CGRpatrol_weirdModsOpt3cSel:""Let's discuss this before jumping to conclusions...""",
CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpt3d,CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,,,,"CGRpatrol_weirdModsOpt3dSel:""Perhaps we come to an 'arrangement'? Just name a price...""",
CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpt3e,CGRpatrolWeirdModsOpts,$player.luddicAttitudeCynical,,,"CGRpatrol_weirdModsOpt3eSel:""This is an irrational outburst, $post.""",
