$market.didShrineIntro = true","The receiving hall is empty of pilgrims, and mostly dark. Hand-sewn banners hang limply, their bright colors muted in the gloom. Benches and tables lay empty.

You spot a light through a small doorway. The humble office of the curate sacraria, and within, an old woman asleep behind a pot of tea, still steaming, set out on the desk.","lpp_volturnShrineFirstVisit3a:Cough, scuff your boot; wake her up unobtrusively
lpp_volturnShrineFirstVisit3b:""Hello! I'd like the see the shrine!""
lpp_volturnShrineFirstVisit3c:Pour yourself some tea
lpp_volturnShrineFirstVisit3d:""If the tea is that hot, you can't really be asleep.""",
