SetPersonHidden standfast false
$player.metStandfast = true
FireAll LPPVolturnCurateResponses1","As you step to the desk and pour a cup, she lets her eyes open and withdraws a pistol from her hand-weave. 

This she places in a holster.

""I'll hardly shoot you for being presumptuous over a cup of tea. So yes, do help yourself.""",,
