$saidWalk == true",$player.luddicAttitudeFaithful++,"""They are forgotten,"" he says, ""All forgotten, turned to dust by war. But I will remember that they once were. It is all I have to give.""

The curate's suit helmet bobs at you, ""And you will remember too, now.""

""And then they shall live eternal. You understand?""","lpp_killaWillRememberA:""I think so.""
lpp_killaWillRememberB:""I don't understand.""
lpp_killaWillRememberC:""They will never be forgotten.""
lpp_killaHelpAvenge:""I will fight to avenge them.""",
