$saidThousands == true",,"He stops and fixes you with a suddenly piercing gaze. ""The bodies, the bodies can be counted. Dust and bones.""

""But not the dead. Their love, their life. No number remembers that."" A pause. ""You understand?""","lpp_killaNoNumberA:""I think so.""
lpp_killaNoNumberB:""I don't understand.""
lpp_killaNoNumberC:""Their human experience is unquantifiable.""",
