lppHesperusShrineFirstTime1a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lpp_hesperusVisitFirstTime1a,$global.lpp_didHesperusFirstShrineAttempt = true,"""Affirmative,"" Nav says. A moments pause. ""Captain, I have traffic control on comms.""

Nav patches you into the comm-loop, and a young-looking Luddic Knight, probably an initiate, appears before you.",lpp_hesperusVisitFirstTime2:Continue,
