$global.lpp_hesperusWait
$global.lpp_madeToWaitForHesperus","AdjustRepActivePerson SUSPICIOUS -1
$global.lpp_hesperusWait = true 7","A long pause.

Excubitor Orbis Oak sighs. ""I shall review your request in seven days,"" he says, ""Starting from now.""

He lifts a stylus and scratches something on a sheet of nondigital medium, his gaze now elsewhere. ""Remember that Patience is the child of Humility.""

""Blessings be, captain,"" he finishes.","lpp_hesperusExcubitorAllowEndCutoff:""What about the time I've already waited?""
lpp_hesperusExcubitorAllowEndNice:""And upon you, Excubitor Orbis.""
