AddCredits 25000","""I pray that you do. May a friendly star light your Path.""

Archcurate Jaspis signs off, and a shy novice opens the line to transfer your advance payment. They say a quiet ""Blessed be your day,"" before closing the link.",cutCommLink:Cut the comm link,
