ShowDefaultVisual","""Captain,"" the voice of your comms officer quietly speaks in your ear, ""They've sent some kind of coded signal. Nearby Pather fleets will be alerted to our position.""

You acknowledge the report and turn your attention back to the Pather on the comms link - and find that the connection has been terminated.",lke_chalcedonLookingRecMad2:Cut the comms,
