DoCanAffordCheck 2000 lke_chalcedonBarBribe3k false","The Mammonite laughs, and calls out to you, almost pleading. ""Wait, wait! 2,000 credits. Final offer. It is charity, almost! Very Luddic!""","lke_chalcedonBarBribe2k:""Agreed.""
