lkeChalcedonBarDrinkLots,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_barMammoniteDrink,,"You drink with the Mammonite, who indeed makes for a good drinking partner. He has many stories, and matches you for tales of scrapes with irate Pathers, pirates, and patrols.

The Mammonite raises a hand to summon the proprietor again. Another pot of 'tea'?","lke_barMammoniteDrink2:""Why not?""
