lkeChalcedonBarSedge0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_chalcedonBarSedge0,,"You seat yourself. A simple, steaming tea is placed before you with a subtle hint from the proprietor that you need but ask and something much stronger will arrive in a teapot.

