lkeAskSedgeMurder,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_askSedgeMurder,$saidMurder = true 0,"Sedge's eyes narrow at you. ""You say, to kill a man is not righteous? You don't know that Mammonite. I do. But,"" Sedge grunts, ""I need not explain my path to you. God will judge.""","lke_askSedgeMurderA:Change the subject
lke_askSedgeMurderB:""I expect some worldly authority will judge you, and not well."" 
