SetPersonPortrait bornanew ""jethro_bornanew""","Sedge considers his words for a moment. Sucking spittle through his tooth-gap.

""That man, his faith is true."" Sedge swishes again. ""But he... did not know his Path.""",lke_sedgeShowPic4:Continue,
lkeSedgeShowPic4a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == lke_sedgeShowPic4
$market.talkingOutside",,"Sedge stands back suddenly, looking away down the alley.

""That a man could believe, truly, and not know his Path? I did not like to see that. I told him he had no place with us."" 

He speaks without meeting your eyes, ""I was told he worked for a time, then bought passage to Mazalot.""

""I hope they see what I saw, too. That... he is unfit.""",lke_sedgeEnd1:Continue,
lkeSedgeShowPic4b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == lke_sedgeShowPic4
$market.talkingAtBar",,"Sedge stands, suddenly, a look of concern on his face.

""That a man could believe, truly, and not know his Path? I did not like to see that. I told him, he had no place with us.""

""I was told he worked for a time, then bought passage to Mazalot,"" he says. ""I hope they see what I saw, too. That he is unfit.""",lke_sedgeEnd1:Continue,
