FireBest DialogOptionSelected","$HeOrShe stares hard into your eyes, at least the holo-image of them, then brings $hisOrHer hands together. ""May Providence show me the way; by the stars and the pneuma and the revelation.""

After a moment, $personName opens $hisOrHer eyes. 

""Let me speak plainly now: I shall trust your Path. Wherever it leads you, remember what we fight for.""",,
