FireBest DialogOptionSelected","$PersonName looks disappointed, but says ""I understand, $playerSirOrMadam.""",,
LKEmazQMTryYaribayA3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_mazQMTryYaribayA3,"Highlight ""Nile Virens""","""Everyone knows the Path comes through here. They say, don't touch that crate? You don't touch that crate. Gotta be careful or they make sure you remember who runs things. And who's that? Nile Virens.""",lke_mazQMTryYaribayA3b:Continue,
