LKEvirensRaidJethroLie2c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_virensRaidJethroLie2c,,It might be useful to have a Pather that understands both your power and your mercy.,"lke_virensRaidJethroFreeEnd3:""Guard, take Virens to a shuttle.""
