LKEjethroWhyOptBResp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_jethroWhyOptB,,"He sighs deeply. ""Was it necessary?""","lke_jethroWhyOptBnotImp:""That's not important now. I have a mission to complete.""
lke_jethroWhyOptByes:""Yes. In conflicts between the powerful, that's how it works.""
