FireAll LKEdoFinish","""Captain. You have provided me... closure. You shall receive your compensation. May Providence guide us, may God forgive us.""

She closes the link somewhat abruptly, sending you to a CGR standby mode which is quickly picked up by an aide who arranges the credits transfer, and a flight path for the shuttle to deliver the body.",,
LKEreturnToGileadDeadJaspis5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_returnToGileadDeadJaspis5,$player.ethosTruth++,"After a long, long moment she speaks.

""I understand,"" she says, a wall of ice.

""Was the notion his, or yours?""","lke_returnToGileadDeadJaspis5a:""Mine.""
lke_returnToGileadDeadJaspis5b:""His.""
lke_returnToGileadDeadJaspis5c:""It doesn't matter.""",
