LKEreturnToGileadJaspis2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == lke_returnToGileadJaspis2,,"""Heavens rejoice!"" A ray of unselfconscious joy breaks through the Archcurate's well-tended walls.

""You must bring him here, I must see him,"" she pauses, then laughs at herself. ""You know what I mean. Come now, I shall have the Knights forgo their accustomed rigidity.""",lke_returnToGileadJaspis3:Continue,
