EndConversation NO_CONTINUE","The soft-spoken secretary, Degory, produces an incongruous datapad from her robes and conducts the transfer of the Archcurate's payment to your accounts. She then summons the grim-faced Knight Ailanthus to escort you to your waiting shuttle. 

Your return to orbit is uneventful.",,
