$global.lke_inProgress",BeginConversation jaspis,"You speak first with some kind of secretary who politely persuades you to wait patiently.

After a short time, the image of the Archcurate Jaspis appears. She makes little effort to look toward comms feed as she putters around her office.

""It is good to hear from you, captain,"" she says. ""Have you found Novice Bornanew?""","lke_jaspisTalkNotYet:""Not yet.""
