BFINstart2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start2,"BeginConversation bornanew
SetPersonHidden bornanew false","""Captain $playerName. I do not forget your assistance."" He makes a crooked smile.

The link is poor-quality; his voice is hollowed, lacking the warmth you remember.

""I would ask, beg if I must, for your service once more.""","BFIN_start3:""What do you ask?""",
BFINstart3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start3,,"""What I ask, it is a part of the penance I must serve."" He raises a hand, as if to stop your objections, ""I do also believe it will also serve a spiritual and intrinsic good."" 

""And,"" he clears his throat, ""for your assistance, a substantial reward of credits has been authorized by the Reverend Archcurate Jaspis.""

""The service..."" He releases a breath. ""An object considered holy by some in the mother Church has appeared in the possession of a wealthy collector.""","BFIN_start3a:""There's been a theft?""
BFIN_start3b:""Did this collector not make a large enough tithe?""",
BFINstart3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start3a,,"""No,"" he says, looking up. ""That would have been simple. This object, this 'relic', is by all appearances still untouched on Tartessus, in the archives of the Cathedral of Holy Exodus.""

""The curates of the archive were in some panic at word that they had lost a holy relic. They checked very, very carefully. I too have personally confirmed that it remains in their keeping.""","BFIN_start4a:""So it's a fake. No problem.""
BFIN_start4b:""And this is embarrassing to the Church?""",
BFINstart3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start3b,"$option = BFIN_start3a
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Ah,"" he gives a weary smile. ""The collector is quite secular, and has no relationship with the Church.""",,
BFINstart4a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start4a,,"""But it could be,"" $global.jethroName says hesitantly. ""It raises... questions.""

""And those may become a problem. It is a complex situation and potentially dangerous."" ",BFIN_start5:Continue,
BFINstart4b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start4b,,"""It could be,"" $global.jethroName says. ""This collector has not been silent about his new acquisition.""

""Naturally, the Church does not approve. At the same time, mere disapproval is no reason to cause a diplomatic incident, to say nothing of... well, it is a complex situation. And potentially dangerous."" ",BFIN_start5:Continue,
BFINstart5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFIN_start5,"SetTextHighlights 50,000 50,000
FireAll BFINconvOpts","""If you choose to assist me,"" he says, ""then I shall share with you what, ah, 'intel' I have managed to piece together.""

He looks almost embarrassed for a moment, then forces himself proceed. ""Credits, yes. I have also been instructed to offer a payment of 50,000 credits when - if - you join my investigation, and an additional 50,000 credits upon completion of my quest.""

""If it is possible."" He sighs, ""And that I cannot promise.""",,
#BFINconvOptMoreCredits,BFINconvOpts,"!$didAskCredits
!$global.bfin_saidNotNow",,,"BFIN_askCredits:""50k down, and how much on completion? You didn't say.""",# don't waste time
