BFFImeetMenes4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenes4,AdjustRepActivePerson COOPERATIVE 1,"""Oh!"" Menes claps his hands together in delight. ""That would be just the perfect, perfect thing!""

""Bring your friend,"" a mischievous look grows on his face. ""I have an object in my special collection,"" his eyebrows bounce, ""that'll launch his tabard directly into orbit! You'll see, you'll see. Oh, this is so perfect.""",BFFI_meetMenesEnd:Continue,
