unset $global.bffi_goMeetMenesYaribay","Menes, still grinning and rattling on about his plans, sends you credentials to allow the docking of a shuttle at his private complex on the surface of Olinadu.","BFFI_meetMenesBornanew1:""We'll meet you before long, I'm sure.""",
