$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornanew2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Bornanew's head is lowered as he enters, carrying his paper notebook as well as an off-brand datapad.

The notebook slaps onto the table a little harder than would be considered strictly polite.",,
BFFImeetMenesBornanew2a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornanew2
$player.bffi_saidHardened","$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornanew3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""-I'd hardly describe myself as a 'hardened' criminal, and although technically a Knight of Ludd, I'm merely a novice - and one in poor standing at that.""",,
BFFImeetMenesBornanew2b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornanew2
$player.bffi_saidHideTerrorists","$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornanew3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I think it is uncharitable to the point of slander to describe the people of Mazalot as 'terrorists' so easily. And although it was a remote farming community, I was hardly hermit, to say nothing of-"" He stops mid-rebuttal and looks up.",,
BFFImeetMenesBornanew2c,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornanew2
$player.bffi_saidEpicQuest","$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornanew3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Although technically a Knight of Ludd, I'm merely a novice - and one in poor standing at that. As for this 'epic quest' you describe, it's more of-"" He stops speaking and looks up at you.",,
BFFImeetMenesBornanew3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornanew3,,,"BFFI_meetMenesBornanew4a:""Relax, $global.jethroName. We're just making you more exciting for Menes.""
BFFI_meetMenesBornanew4b:""You knew what this would entail. Think of the good it will accomplish.""",
BFFImeetMenesBornanew4a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornanew4a,"$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornanew5 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Yes,"" he sighs. ""A barefaced ruse, I understand.""",,
