BFFImeetMenesOptInviteHtalkBack,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOptsBack,FireAll BFFImeetMenesBornanewOpts,"Bornanew nods, putting his hand back on his book as if drawing knowledge from it.
OR
""Of course, captain,"" Bornanew says.
OR
Bornanew looks down at his notebook and turns a page, then turns it back. ""Of course, yes.""",,
BFFImeetMenesBornOptInviteHsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOptHorusInvitePropose,$proposedHorusOption = true 0,"Bornanew looks at you for a long moment.

""Do you think Horus Yaribay will help?""","bffi_mmBornOptHorusInvite1:""He wants to appease the Hegemony. And Luddics are a significant demographic...""",
BFFImeetMenesOptInviteHtalk1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOptHorusInvite1,,"He nods as you lay out your reasoning. The Hegemony wants a stable Luddic population. Horus wants a stable Hegemony in order to negotiate a peaceful settlement.

""If Horus intervenes to defuse the situation before a greater conflict is fomented... Horus the peace-maker..."" Bornanew drums his fingers on his notebook.

""Which is exactly what he wants to be, if what you say is true. This could be over quickly. And quietly."" He closes his eyes and holds his hands together as if saying a quiet prayer.","BFFI_mmBornDoInviteHorus:""Then it's decided. I'll speak with Horus first.""
bffi_mmBornOptsBack:""Let's discuss other options.""",
BFFImmBornInviteHorusAgain,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_mmBornOptHorusInvitePropose
$proposedHorusOption",,"""If you can persuade Horus to intervene in the situation before it gets out of hand-"" Bornanew sighs loudly, catching himself. ""Forgive my choice of word; jocularity is not my intent.""

He begins again, ""If Horus sees it in his interest to force Menes to surrender the glove - and its source - then all might be resolved peaceably.""","BFFI_mmBornDoInviteHorus:""Then it's decided. I'll speak with Horus first.""
bffi_mmBornOptsBack:""Let's discuss other options.""",
BFFImmBornOptStealFirst,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornStealOpt,$proposedStealOption = true 0,"You can tell he doesn't like the idea.

""That seems... it would be a blunt approach,"" he says. ""And risky.""","bffi_mmBornOptSteal2a:""I often find the direct approach the most effective.""
bffi_mmBornOptSteal2b:""Don't tell me you've never stolen before, $global.jethroName.""
",
BFFImeetMenesBornOptSteal2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOptSteal2a,,"He looks at you, and you see that he knows he has no argument for you.

Bornanew sighs. ""Nonetheless, theft is a sin. And I did swear a sacred oath that I would never steal again.""","BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal3:""Then I'll steal it. You can just show up and be yourself.""",
BFFImeetMenesBornOptSteal2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOptSteal2b,,"""Yes, I- That's not-""

He exhales sharply. ""Not only is theft a sin. I did also swear a sacred oath that I would never steal again.""","BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal3:""Then I'll steal it. You can just show up and be yourself.""",
BFFImeetMenesBornOptSteal3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal3,,"""But I, I-"" he stutters to a halt. ""I suppose, in the strictest sense this is... captain, I do not like it. Is there no alternative?""","BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal4a:""No one gets hurt. And it's a fake which they stole from your people in the first place.""
BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal4b:""I could send a marine raid in to steal it so we don't have to.""
BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal4c:""I could threaten to bombard the planet until Menes surrenders the relic.""
BFFI_meetMenesBornOptSteal4d:""Fine. Let's think of something else.""",
