$proposedBuyerOption",FireAll BFFImmBornBuyerOptHub,"""If you have the credits,"" Bornanew says, ""Or if you can leverage existing assets and status, perhaps you can simply buy the glove from Menes.""",,
BFFImmBornRaidOptSel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornRaidOpt,,"""Captain, I must remind you that an interfactional incident must be avoided."" He says this more evenly than you might have expected.

Bornanew looks down at this notebook, then up, ""And I myself pray,"" he says in a low and quiet voice, ""that I might avoid the shedding of innocent blood in this, this which is meant to be part of my act of penance.""","BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid2:""Does not a Knight use violence to stop from greater violence?""",
BFFImmBornOptRaid2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid2,,"""Ah,"" Bornanew meets your eyes knowingly. ""I see where the arc of your rhetoric leads, and I cannot deny its endpoint. A Knight of Ludd does employ violence.""

""'To protect the faith, to protect the faithful...'"" He is quoting something - his oath?","BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid3:""Exactly. Like Ludd, righteous with hammer and sword in hand!""",
BFFImmBornOptRaid3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid3,"$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Yes, well. The sword is a symbol, an image, captain. Imagine waving a sword around in this age."" He shakes his head.",,
BFFImmBornOptRaid4a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4
$player.soe_wonDuel","$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4d 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",You think to yourself that this isn't the time to bring up your experience at the Rao compound on Eventide.,,
BFFImmBornOptRaid4b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4
$player.soe_lostDuel ","$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4d 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",You think to yourself that this isn't the time to bring up your experience at the Rao compound on Eventide.,,
BFFImmBornOptRaid4c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4,"$option = BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4d 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImmBornOptRaid4d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_meetMenesBornOptRaid4d,$proposedRaidOption = true 0,"""Nonetheless, if you insist, then I shall be forced to concede,"" Bornanew says.

""If we... if you can execute a raid; if you can do it without implicating the Church; if seizing this fake relic quickly and quietly will lead us to its maker and thereafter to a swift conclusion of the whole matter... then maybe the Church can avoid schism and disaster.""

""If, and only if, it is necessary,"" he concludes.","bffi_mmBornDoRaid:""It is necessary. I shall make the arrangements.""
bffi_mmBornOptsBack:""Let's discuss other options before deciding.""",
BFFImmBornOptRaidAgain,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornRaidOptAgain,,"Bornanew frowns.

""If this raid can be executed without implicating the Church, and if seizing this false relic quickly and quietly will lead us to its maker and a swift conclusion to the whole matter... then it may be a worthwhile path.""","bffi_mmBornDoRaid:""It is necessary. I shall make the arrangements.""
bffi_mmBornOptsBack:""Let's discuss other options before deciding.""",
BFFImmBornDoInviteHorus,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_mmBornDoInviteHorus,"$global.bffi_goTalkToHorus = true
$global.bffi_intendToTalkHorus = true
SetPersonHidden horus_yaribay false
unset $global.bffi_gotPartyInvite
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage
$option = bffi_mmBornOutro 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""To Kazeron."" He smiles easily as he pockets his notebook, then says ""I've never been.""",,# what if player visited Kazeron after picking up Bornanew from Mazalot? Good lord.
# BFFI mm do steal outro,,,,,,
BFFImmBornDoSteal,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoSteal,$global.bffi_intendToSteal = true,"Sometimes acquiring something is as simple as taking it.

Both you and Bornanew - who is unenthusiastic, but professional throughout - are outfitted with an inconspicuous set of tools: a sheet-diamond rated cutter, EM glitcher, lockbreakers.

Bornanew sets aside some of the bulkier accoutrement with a shake of his head.",bffi_mmBornDoSteal2:Continue,
BFFImmBornDoSteal2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoSteal2,,"Your tech officer installs a schematic of Menes' complex and a suite of scramblers on your datapad, a remote interfacer is hidden inside a fashionable stylus.

You perform the operation of various gadgets with your armorer, and review the choreography of the heist with your tactical officer. It is not a perfect plan, but with a combination of initiative, redundancy, and exceptional access...

Bornanew is standing very still, his fist against his jaw.","bffi_mmBornDoSteal3:""Yes? What is it?""",
BFFImmBornDoSteal3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoSteal3,FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,"""It won't work,"" he says.

""With all due respect, your tactician is no thief. And neither are you. It must be me.""",,
BFFImmBornDoStealHubA,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,!$saidDoStealHub4,,,"bffi_mmBornDoSteal4:""Aren't you opposed to theft? You swore an oath.""",
BFFImmBornDoStealHubB,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,!$saidDoStealHub5,,,"
bffi_mmBornDoSteal5:""It's a pretty good plan. And I have the tools.""",
BFFImmBornDoStealHubC,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,"$saidDoStealHub4
$player.luddicAttitudeFaithfulOrPather
!$saidDoStealHubFaith",,,"bffi_mmBornDoStealFaith:""I, too, have my faith. Is that nothing?""",
BFFImmBornDoStealHubD,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,!$saidDoStealHubTell,,,"bffi_mmBornDoStealTell:""Tell me what your plan is.""",
BFFImmBornDoStealHubE,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,!$saidDoStealHubLetGo ,,,"bffi_mmBornDoStealLetGo:""You're not going to let this go, are you.""",
BFFImmBornDoStealHubF,BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts,$saidDoStealHubLetGo ,,,"bffi_mmBornOutro:""If you insist, then.""",
BFFImmBornDoSteal4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoSteal4,"$saidDoStealHub4 = true 0
FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts","""I am. I did,"" he says. ""But more necessary than my conscience is our success. I shall bear my burden.""",,
BFFImmBornDoSteal5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoSteal5,"$saidDoStealHub5 = true 0
FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts","""Why should Menes leave you alone with the relic, or at all?"" He looks over at you. 

""I am a Knight of Ludd, devoted and taciturn. I shall simply... display the power of my faith.""",,
BFFImmBornDoStealSteal,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoStealFaith,"$saidDoStealHubFaith = true 0
FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts","""Pray forgive me, captain; I do no question your faith."" He presses his hands together.

""But Menes Yaribay cannot see into your soul. He will see your uniform, and my robes. That will be enough.""",,
BFFImmBornDoStealTell,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoStealTell,"$saidDoStealHubTell = true 0
FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts","""We attend Menes' party. Be interesting. Be yourself. Get Menes to show off the glove."" 

""I know this trade, captain. Have faith."" He pauses for a moment, acknowledging some irony in his own words. ""It works best if you act natural.""",,
BFFImmBornDoStealLetGo,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoStealLetGo,"$saidDoStealHubLetGo = true 0
FireAll BFFImmBornDoStealHubOpts","He crosses his arms. ""I am not.""",,
# BFFI mm do raid outro,,,,,,
BFFImmBornDoRaid,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoRaid,,"Bornanew bows his head to your words. His expression is grim.

Menes has not been discreet. As a celebration of his first cycle as the new demarch of Olinadu, he invited a holodoc team for a puff-piece interview and viewing of his 'collection'. Your tactical team reviews the holos, constructing schematic of the interior of Menes' complex, inferring layout and defenses from this and other publicly available information.",bffi_mmBornDoRaid2:Continue,
BFFImmBornDoRaid2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoRaid2,"SetTextHighlights ""100 marines"" ""transponder off""","It is estimated that roughly 100 marines will be required to pull off the operation.

Your marines will be equipped with an eclectic mix of equipment to allow them to pose as high-level pirates. They will be secretly infiltrated into Olinadu as, variously, spacer crew on shore-leave, contract technicians, and ne'er-do-wells looking to spend ill-gotten gains somewhere away from heavy law enforcement.

It goes without saying that you shall need to approach Olinadu with your $shipOrFleet's transponder off. Menes' overly charitable outlook on your character and generalized inattention to his official duties should allow you to join his 'party' with little oversight about how you actually got there.",bffi_mmBornDoRaid3:Continue,
BFFImmBornDoRaid3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoRaid3,"$global.bffi_intendToRaid = true
$global.bornanewBadBoy++
$player.ethosRuthless++
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage","To avert suspicion and ensure optimal timing, you and Bornanew will personally attend Menes' party when the raid is executed.

The raid will commence when two of a series of randomly generated time-slots are passed without receiving a stand-down signal. This signal will be, by all appearances, a routine status query to your $shipOrFleet, and appear to be perfectly routine behaviour for a justifiably neurotic independent $shipOrFleet operator.

Bornanew is watchful throughout the planning process, only occasionally advocating for lower-force protocols when a particularly bloodthirsty marine squad leader expresses more enthusiasm than strictly required for certain tactical details.",bffi_mmBornOutro:Continue,
,,,,,,
# BFFI mm outros,,,,,,
,,,,,,
BFFImmBornDoBuyer,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornDoBuyer,"AdjustRepActivePerson COOPERATIVE 2
$global.bffi_intendToBeBuyer = true
$option = bffi_mmBornOutro 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Bornanew bows his head in thanks, his relief palpable, his hands clasped together.",,
BFFImmBornOutro,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mmBornOutro,"unset $global.bffi_preproposedBuyerOption
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage
ShowDefaultVisual
EndConversation
FireAll PopulateOptions","Later, in the briefing room, you find Bornanew standing over a detailed schematic of Menes' complex. It rotates slowly in the shared display volume, gradually shadowing and illuminating his face.

It takes a moment, but you see that his eyes are closed and his lips are moving.

A prayer, you suspect.",,
,,,,,,
# BFFI talk to Horus before party,,,,,,
BFFItalkHorusParty,PopulateOptions,"$id == horus_yaribay
Call $global.bffi_ref updateData
$bffi_stage == TALK_TO_HORUS
$bffi_talkToHorusAboutMenesParty",,,"bffi_talkHorusParty1:""I'd like to discuss a matter involving Menes Yaribay.""",
BFFItalkHorusParty1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusParty1,FireAll BFFItalkHorusPartyOpts,"""Cousin Menes,"" he says, and sighs.

""What is it he's done this time?""",,
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptA,BFFItalkHorusPartyOpts,,,,"bffi_talkHorusPartyOptA:""He might spark a religious conflict that could tear the Sector apart.""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptB,BFFItalkHorusPartyOpts,,,,"bffi_talkHorusPartyOptB:""He bought a sacred Luddic relic for his personal collection.""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptC,BFFItalkHorusPartyOpts,,,,"bffi_talkHorusPartyOptC:""How do you get on with Menes? Not well?""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptAsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyOptA,RemoveOption bffi_talkHorusPartyOptA,"Horus blinks, and turns his head aside as if he didn't hear you correctly. His eyes snap back to yours through the comm-link.

""Elaborate upon your statement, if you would be so kind.""

A harsh note enters his tone, despite ostensibly polite words.",,
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptBsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyOptB,,"Horus takes this in, looking into the middle distance, processing for a moment. He takes a slow breath.

""You are certain? Do the Luddics know about it?""","bffi_talkHorusPartyTheyKnow:""Oh, they know. They hired me to... handle it.""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyOptCsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyOptC,RemoveOption bffi_talkHorusPartyOptC,"""He is family."" Horus gives you a flinty look. ""State your meaning.""",,
BFFItalkHorusPartyTheyKnow,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyTheyKnow,,"He closes his eyes and rubs his temples. After a moment, a mutter emerges, ""Good grief.""

He takes several more long breaths.","bffi_talkHorusPartyInvite:""Menes invited me to some kind of party to view this relic.""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyInvite,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyInvite,,"""He did,"" Horus stares at you.

""It appears as though I am going to have to become involved,"" he says. ""Personally.""

""Again."" His jaw is clenched. It looks uncomfortable.","bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd:Say nothing.
bffi_talkHorusPartyEndA:""Again?""
bffi_talkHorusPartyEndB:""You need to keep better track of your cousin's schemes, huh.""",
BFFItalkHorusPartyEndA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyEndA,,"""The past matters of my gens do not oblige discussion with outsiders, $playerSirOrMadam,"" he says stiffly.

""However. I do appreciate your... consideration in bringing the current matter to my attention.""",bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd:Continue,
BFFItalkHorusPartyEndB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyEndB,"$player.ethosSarcastic++ 
AdjustRepActivePerson HOSTILE -1","""Thank-you captain, that is fabulous advice,"" Horus says in a tone demonstrating very little appreciation for your input.",bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd:Continue,
BFFItalkHorusPartyAttendEnd,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd,"$global.bffi_horusToParty = true
$global.bffi_gotPartyInvite = true
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage","""I shall make my own way to Olinadu, thank you. Have your people coordinate with my people.""

""We'll sort out Menes' indiscretion and set things right with the Church,"" he says brusquely, then turns away.

""After all I've done for that ungrateful-"" 

The comms cut.",bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd2:Cut the comms,
BFFItalkHorusPartyAttendEnd2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_talkHorusPartyEnd2,"EndConversation
ShowDefaultVisual",Now you have a party to attend - with an uninvited guest of honor.,,
,,,,,,
# BFFI Attend a party (w/o Horus),,,,,,
BFFIattendPartyStartOption,PopulateOptions,"$market.id == olinadu
$menuState == main
!$global.bffi_horusToParty
Call $global.bffi_ref updateData
$bffi_stage == ATTEND_A_PARTY",FireAll BFFIapStartOptionRaidCheck,,3:bffi_attendPartyIntro1:Accept Menes Yaribay's invitation and shuttle to his complex,
BFFIapStartOptionRaidCheck1,BFFIapStartOptionRaidCheck,"$global.bffi_intendToRaid
$player.transponderOn","SetEnabled bffi_attendPartyIntro1 false
SetTooltip bffi_attendPartyIntro1 ""You must approach Olinadu with your transponder off in order to sneak marines into position.""",,,
BFFIapStartOptionRaidCheck2,BFFIapStartOptionRaidCheck,"$global.bffi_intendToRaid
$player.marines < 100","SetEnabled bffi_attendPartyIntro1 false
SetTooltip bffi_attendPartyIntro1 ""You need at least 100 marines in order to execute the raid on Menes Yaribay's compound.""
SetTooltipHighlights 100",,,
BFFIattendPartyIntro1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyIntro1,ShowLargePlanet,"Menes' invitation provides you with a flight path and Demarch-level traffic control override codes.

It's probably a violation of Persean League ethical guidelines for you to be using these to attend a personal party, but from what you can overhear of the pilot's comms, the locals have a casual attitude toward the arrangement.",bffi_attendPartyIntro2:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyIntro1raid,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyIntro1,ShowLargePlanet,"You and Bornanew make an 'undocumented' arrival on Olinadu then transfer to a private shuttle service in order to attend Menes' party.

Your hired pilot gives a shrug as she shows you a flight path blocked out with red DENIED tags - until you apply the key attached to your invitation, which turns out to be a Demarch-level override code.

It's probably a violation of Persean League ethical guidelines for you to be using these to attend a personal party, but the pilot simply smiles and proceeds. This sort of thing isn't unusual under Menes' administration, it appears.",bffi_attendPartyIntro2:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyIntro2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyIntro2,,"Menes Yaribay's compound is a scrubbed-looking slab of trendy architecture set on a bluff overlooking Olinadu's primary habitation cluster.

A smattering of outbuildings and hangars, attached by fat trunks of conduit and glowing walktubes, sprawl across the less-fashionable view-angles of the compound toward the refineries and holding tanks of the planet's industrial center.",bffi_attendPartyIntro3:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyIntro3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyIntro3,,"One set of hangar bay doors dutifully open, and your shuttle descends through the glowing atmo-field. Such gadgetry is an ostentatious addition to a personal residence, but it avoids the bother of visitors (and their shuttles) having to undergo pressure-cycling.

An enthusiastic Menes is already approaching your shuttle's access ramp as it sets itself down and signals the all-clear.

Bornanew exchanges a look with you, then rises to disembark.",bffi_attendParty1:Meet Menes Yaribay,
BFFIattendParty1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendParty1,BeginConversation menes_yaribay,"""Captain $playerName,"" Menes crosses his chest with one arm, hand on heart, the other held behind, giving a small bow. ""Allow me to welcome you to my home.""

""And you've brought your fascinating friend!"" he exclaims, as if it was a surprise. ""This must be...?""","BFFI_attendParty3a:""This is $global.jethroName.""
BFFI_attendParty3b:""Jethro Bornanew, a novice of the Knights of Ludd.""",
BFFIattendParty3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendParty3a,"$option = BFFI_attendParty3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Jethro Bornanew,"" he adds quickly. ""Novice Bornanew of the Knights of Ludd, at your service. May this day be blessed by Providence.""",,
BFFIattendParty3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendParty3b,"$option = BFFI_attendParty3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""May this day be blessed by Providence,"" he says.",,
BFFIattendParty3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendParty3,ShowSecondPerson bornanew,"Bornanew nods, not quite a bow, with his hands held together. Perhaps to avoid Menes' much-ringed hands from grabbing his. You are not so lucky, and must endure an overlong handshake.

Menes is delighted at all of this, eyes flashing with something akin to greed.",BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro1:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro1,,"Menes leads you past gilded statues posed to guard the portal to the main complex; the forms are evocative of splashes of molten gold frozen by happenstance into sensual humanoid figures.

You endure a rolling barrage of patter from Menes about the expense of renovations, the acquisition of artworks, the exclusivity of access to particular artists and engineering firms who have contributed to his home, his manor, and its collection.

Occasionally a robotic or human servitor appears to offer drinks or nibbles, and you've a growing feeling that Menes has picked up a glass from one only to place it back on the tray of another without ever taking a sip between the two.

A fresh glass in hand, delicate amber liquid fizzing away, Menes leads you into what can only be his prize entertaining space.",BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro2:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro2,ShowThirdPerson ulmus_pond,"The space is at once cavernous and intimate; the sightlines and carved, wrought, and woven details calculated to replicate the appearance of cozy warmth like the den of some thoughtful patron of art, history, and literature.

A double handful of well-dressed remoras mill about, interrupting their conversations to smile and lift a glass as Menes enters. They look to be a collection of industrialists, financiers, distant gens-relatives, and at least one officer from atop the local military detachment who appears a little worse for his drink. Most nod to you and Bornanew, eyes not lingering to the point of impoliteness.

One skinny man in a finely embroidered suit has no such compunction, and rushes to greet your party, eyes agog at the newest additions to Menes' collection.",BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro3:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro3,,"He nearly trips over himself to speak. ""The great Captain $playerName! If half of what Menes has said is true... why, half the Sector must tremble at the appearance of your $shipOrFleet!""

""We'll have to ask Navarch Atreus over there what he thinks of your combat record,"" the man grins wickedly, ""If he hasn't had too many of these, of course; with all thanks to our kind host, a true gentleman and scholar."" He lifts his glass approvingly at Menes, and you see his eyes slide toward Bornanew.

""And Jethro Bornanew, I believe? A Knight of Ludd?""",BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro4:Continue,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == BFFI_attendPartyHub1Intro4,,"""I don't recall an introduction,"" Bornanew says, his hands still held piously together, allowing him to deniably reject both drink and the touch of the present company.","bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro4a:""Pleased to meet you...?""
bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro5b:Say nothing
bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro5c:""No need to be prickly, $global.jethroName, the man is being friendly.""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro4b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro5b,"$option = bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro4a 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro4c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro5c,"AdjustRepPerson menes_yaribay FRIENDLY 1
$option = bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro4a 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Bornanew forces out the equivalent of a smile.

""Of course, captain."" He turns to the man. ""Pray forgive me, sir, my forgotten manners,"" he says.",,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Intro5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_attendPartyHub1Intro4a,FireAll BFFIattendPartyHub1,"Menes laughs heartily.

""Let me introduce Ulmus Pond,"" he says. ""Now he'll claim to be a mere commodities trader,"" Menes winks as if you are in on a shared joke, ""but I daresay he knows everyone of any importance in the Kumari Kandam system. And if you need anything."" He lowers his voice, ""Anything at all. He's your man.""

Pond, grinning widely, makes a brushing-off gesture as if to dismiss Menes' words - but not so assertively as to deny them.",,
BFFIattendPartyHub1optA,BFFIattendPartyHub1,,,,"bffi_apHub1optA:""Charmed, I'm sure.""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1optB,BFFIattendPartyHub1,,,,"bffi_apHub1optB:""Everyone, you say? Does that include the Luddic Path?""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1optC,BFFIattendPartyHub1,,,,"bffi_apHub1optC:""So, Ulmus was it? How do you know $global.jethroName?""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1optD,BFFIattendPartyHub1,,,,"bffi_apHub1optD:""Anything, you say? We'll have to talk later, Mister Pond.""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1optE,BFFIattendPartyHub1,,,,"bffi_apHub1optE:""Menes, I believe you had something special to show me?""",
BFFIattendPartyHub1optF,BFFIattendPartyHub1,$global.bffi_intendToRaid,,,"bffi_apHub1optF:""I'm certain this party will be absolutely unforgettable.""",
BFFIapHub1optA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optA,"AdjustRepPerson ulmus_pond FRIENDLY 1
$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond grins wider, and begins to speak. ""The feeling, I'm sure-""",,
BFFIapHub1optB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optB,"$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond laughs too loudly. ""Dear Menes, where did you find such a fantastic character? Without you, I'm certain we'd all die of boredom out here.""",,
BFFIapHub1optC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optC,"$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond laughs a little too loudly. ""Of course we've just met, but dear Menes spoke of a Knight from some unseemly background, and it's a tale which can't but seize the imagination, am I wrong?""",,
BFFIapHub1optD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optD,"AdjustRepPerson ulmus_pond FRIENDLY 2
$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond's grin widens. ""My thoughts are the same, and you know what they say about great-""",,
BFFIapHub1optE,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optE,"AdjustRepPerson ulmus_pond SUSPICIOUS -1
$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond's grin hardens ever so slightly. ""I'm sure I'd be delighted to speak more later about-""",,
BFFIapHub1optF,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1optF,"$option = bffi_apHub1Out1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Pond laughs too loudly. ""How odd! Dear Menes, where did you find such a fantastic character? I, for one, cannot wait to discover what this evening has in store.""",,
BFFIattendPartyHub1Out1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1Out1,,"Menes slaps a hand on Pond's shoulder, causing him to nearly spill his drink.

""Ulmus, Ulmus! You'll have plenty of time to speak with the good captain later. I did promise a surprise, a private showing for $playerHimOrHer and $playerHisOrHer noble Knight. You might know the piece, my friend,"" he winks again, this time to Pond.

""Come along, come along!"" Menes says, grabbing your arm. Ulmus Pond's eyes follow you, fawning oozingly.",bffi_apHub1Out2:Allow Menes to pull you along,# stop winking dude 
BFFIattendPartyHub1Out2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_apHub1Out2,HideThirdPerson,"Menes leads you and Bornanew to his inner sanctum, flashing a grin as he operates a series of obtrusive biometric checks.

The air cools by a degree, perhaps two, the armored mass of the walls felt as a dullness through your feet. The subdued lighting, drapery, and framing of the space suggest the interior of a bank vault or a shrine, though not to the praise of any Luddic virtue.

Quite the contrary, depending on one's outlook.",bffi_mpEnterVault:Enter the vault,
,,,,,,
# BFFI Menes party steal/heist sequence,,,,,,
BFFImpStealStart,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_mpEnterVault
$global.bffi_intendToSteal",,"On a pedestal of carved wood, in a spot of light like holy revelation, a single glove is upthrust. It's fingers appear frozen in the midst of just starting to curl back toward a relaxed state after giving you a little wave.",bffi_mpSteal3:Continue,
BFFImenesPartySteal3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal3,,"""Do you know what this is?"" Menes whispers to you. 

""The Right-Hand Glove of Blessed Ludd,"" Bornanew answers, stepping forward, voice filled with trembling reverence.

""Removed by the Blessed Ludd, whereupon that prophet fell to the sacred Earth of Gilead to kiss that holy ground. Blessings be upon Ludd; Good is the Word; By the Holy Pneuma; By the Divine Light which illuminates the righteous Path through the Garden of Temptation...""",bffi_mpSteal4:Continue,# Jeff spends a story point
BFFImenesPartySteal4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal4,,"Bornanew himself falls to his knees, half-whispering, half-sobbing in prayer, rocking back and forth, his eyes wide and focus vague. 

This is a display you have never seen from $global.jethroName, completely at odds with his usual air of reserve.

Menes steps back with you, looking somehow appalled and delighted at the same time. He stares at Bornanew like a voyeur.","bffi_mpSteal6:Wait a bit
bffi_mpSteal5:""He's overwhelmed... you must understand, Menes.""",
BFFImenesPartySteal5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal5,"$option = bffi_mpSteal6 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Yes, yes,"" he replies under his breath.",,
BFFImenesPartySteal6,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal6,,"Bornanew keeps at it, absolutely rapt upon his prayer toward the glove, tears and phlegm running down his face. It is, truly, a pathetic and uncomfortably intimate sight.

Menes keeps staring, an open half-smile on his lips.","bffi_mpSteal7:""Menes. We should let him be for a moment, don't you think? Menes?""",
BFFImenesPartySteal7,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal7,,"""Hmm? Oh. Oh yes. Of course, captain,"" he says, still watching.",bffi_mpSteal8:Gently pull Menes' away and ask about other items in the collection,
BFFImenesPartySteal8,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal8,HideSecondPerson,"It takes a slightly more than polite tug to overcome Menes' inertia, but finally he's dislodged from Bornanew's spectacle toward another of the handful of chambers making up this 'inner sanctum'.

Menes keeps glancing back toward Bornanew as he explains the story of one or another object: A captain's uniform of the Fourteenth Battlegroup, sword and all, from the period of the Cold Passage; a bottle of spirits from some core Domain star system near Old Earth; a pistol once owned by the Warlord Leonis; the crystalline xenocoral of a species extinct for half a billion years collected by the Exploraria.","bffi_mpSteal9a:""Astounding. Makes one think how we would handle the Cold Passage. Menes?""
bffi_mpSteal9b:""Incredible. What would it take to persuade you to hold a tasting? Menes?""
bffi_mpSteal9c:""Fascinating. Do you think Leonis shot anyone with this, Menes?""
bffi_mpSteal9d:""Intriguing. I wonder if I might find more such xenolife on the fringe. Menes?""",
BFFImenesPartySteal9a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal9a,,"""Huh? Oh yes, naturally I've ruminated often upon how my own character might be tested by such hardship. I admit, my life has been one of relative ease, but I like to think that I identify with certain qualities of those early heroic figures whose steadfastness effected the...""",bffi_mpSteal10:Smile and nod,
BFFImenesPartySteal9b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal9b,,"""Ah? Oh yes, I cannot deny the temptation to open it for some appropriate event, given an appropriately appreciative audience- my dear cousin Horus for instance; I considered his marriage to Asherah, but I thought- no, not yet. I wonder at times if the delight of it is held by the anticipation, the thought...""",bffi_mpSteal10:Smile and nod,
BFFImenesPartySteal9c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal9c,,"""Oh? Oh, well, I do have a story for you! During negotiations with the buyer I thought, let us have a firearms expert examine this, and wouldn't you know that I happened to be hosting a wealthy financier who's done some work with Tri-Tachyon - and say what you will for the Company, they are good at what they do - and she happened to have a brother with an interest in a firm...""",bffi_mpSteal10:Smile and nod,
BFFImenesPartySteal9d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal9d,,"""Eh? Ah! Well I daresay, it is you who might answer that question fully, though I've always considered myself something of a naturalist, or xeno-naturalist if you will ha-ha, and so what if I were to finance an expedition of discovery of sorts? 'Menes Yaribay, patron of knowledge'; I like the sound of that. Imagine, to explore new worlds, encounter unknown lifeforms, seek out and explore the far fringes...""",bffi_mpSteal10:Smile and nod,
BFFImenesPartySteal10,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal10,AdjustRepPerson menes_yaribay FRIENDLY 1,"He rambles, and you make a good show of asking for additional details, drawing his attention toward the object at hand and away from whatever in Ludd's name Bornanew is doing.

A piercing alarm interrupts Menes mid-thought. His eyes go wide and snap toward the central atrium which holds the glove- and Bornanew. He takes off at a run.",bffi_mpSteal11:Follow Menes,
BFFImenesPartySteal11,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal11,ShowSecondPerson bornanew,"You both find Bornanew, still on his knees, with one hand stretched out to touch the glove - one finger upon it - lips still moving, eyes still blankly huge as if overcome by religious mania.

Menes gives out a wordless cry of alarm, and begins lifting his cuff to call security.

Your off-hand instinctively curls around a control interface for one of the clever little thieves-tools you have hidden about your uniform.","bffi_mpSteal12a:""$global.jethroName! Restrain yourself, man!""
bffi_mpSteal12b:""He's only touched it, no need for-""",
BFFImenesPartySteal12a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal12a,"$option = bffi_mpSteal12b 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImenesPartySteal12b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal12b,,"Menes hesitates as you speak, then barks a codeword into his comms.

You freeze, understanding what this sort of protocol looks like. The lights flare into harsh illumination and a trio of gun turrets pop from subtle cupolas - one each tracks instantly to you and Bornanew while the third spins in a slow covering pattern.

The human guards arrive a moment later, uniforms bright-white, boots squeaking on the floor. Menes breathes heavily, watching the security net tighten.

Bornanew, meanwhile, has not moved but to turn his head toward you and Menes.",bffi_mpSteal13:Continue,
BFFImenesPartySteal13,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal13,,"""Menes, Yaribay sir. I pray your forgiveness. I- I was overcome by... I had to..."" Bornanew trails off, pathetically.","bffi_mpSteal14a:Say nothing
bffi_mpSteal14b:(whisper) ""This'll make a great story.""",
BFFImenesPartySteal14a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal14b,"$saidGreatStory = true 0
$option = bffi_mpSteal14a 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImenesPartySteal14b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal14a,,"It takes a second, but Menes starts to laugh.

And laugh, and laugh deep in his belly, almost a shout. He suddenly throws an arm over your shoulder, putting you off balance, as he struggles to contain himself.",bffi_mpSteal15:Try to remain standing,
BFFImenesPartySteal15a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_mpSteal15
$saidGreatStory","unset $saidGreatStory
$option = bffi_mpSteal15 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""You're right!"" he shouts, ""Captain, by the stars, you are right.""",,
BFFImenesPartySteal15,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_mpSteal15
!$saidGreatStory",,"""You there,"" Menes calls out, ""Knight $global.jethroName, get yourself off the floor. Come wash your face, you look absolutely disgusting. Back to the party! Drinks are on me, ha-ha!""

As almost an afterthought he calls to the security team, ""You lot, clean this up and get out of here... ruining the mood.""",bffi_mpSteal16:Continue,
BFFImenesPartySteal16,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal16,"HideSecondPerson
EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
ShowDefaultVisual
BeginConversation Bornanew","You and Bornanew, he given a basin and washcloth by a servitor, are hauled back into the party, and the entire crowd regaled with the story of Bornanew being overcome with awe at the relic and then caught setting off the security alarm.

Menes seems to find it more hilarious with every telling - and each additional round of drinks. His dutiful entourage joins in the laughter each time. The skinny man, Ulmus Pond, has a particularly manic, piercing laugh.

It is some time before you are able to get a quiet word in with $global.jethroName.","bffi_mpSteal17a:""What in Ludd's seven hells was that?""
bffi_mpSteal17b:""What went wrong?""",
BFFImenesPartySteal17a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal17a,"$option = bffi_mpSteal17c 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I beg pardon for your blasphemy, captain,"" Bornanew says with a hint of strain in his voice. ""Ludd's conception of hell was, so much as the Word reveals, a description of mortal torment in a Domain without God.""

""But I do have the glove. What remains is-"" an almost malicious smile briefly appears, ""a fake.""",,
BFFImenesPartySteal17b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal17b,"$option = bffi_mpSteal17c 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Little, but for the monotony of my humiliation, however justly earned,"" Bornanew says with a hint of strain in his voice. ""But I do have the glove. What remains is a-"" an almost malicious smile very briefly appears, ""fake.""",,
BFFImenesPartySteal17c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal17c,"AddTextSmall ""Acquired the false relic"" highlight","He lifts a finger to his lips, and with his other hand pats a fold in his Knight's robes.","bffi_mpSteal18d:""You had a fake glove? This whole time?""
bffi_mpSteal18a:""Good work, $global.jethroName. Great work, in fact.""
bffi_mpSteal18b:""Next time, be sure to let me in on your plan.""
bffi_mpSteal18c:""... Praise Ludd.""",
BFFImenesPartySteal18a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal18a,"$option = bffi_mpSteal19 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImenesPartySteal18b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal18b,"$option = bffi_mpSteal19 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImenesPartySteal18c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal18c,"$option = bffi_mpSteal19 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFImenesPartySteal18d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal18d,RemoveOption bffi_mpSteal18d,"His eyes keep watch on Menes as he replies.

""It's just a glove, captain. The color matches. I didn't think Menes would notice."" His mouth quirks. ""He didn't.""

""He will notice eventually, however. We should... become distant from this place.""",,
BFFImenesPartySteal19,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpSteal19,"IncreaseSmugglingSuspicion 0.9
EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
ShowDefaultVisual","* * *

It is a feat of diplomacy that you manage to extract yourself and Bornanew as quickly as you are able.

A faked containment failure alert from your chief engineer merely opens the door. Passing through requires shaking everyone's hand, exchanging pleasant words, and going through the motions of good-byes several times over - then each time the ritual is interrupted by some tangent or anecdote from Menes, he ensures that it is begun again from the start.

At last you find yourself back in your shuttle, a half-full glass still in your hand.",bffi_partyOutro1:Continue,
,,,,,,
# BFFI buyer sequence during Menes party,,,,,,
BFFImpBuyerStart,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_mpEnterVault
$global.bffi_intendToBeBuyer",,"On a pedestal of carved wood, in a spot of light like holy revelation, a single glove is upthrust. It's fingers appear frozen in the midst of just starting to curl back toward a relaxed state after giving you a little wave.",bffi_mpBuyer0:Continue,
BFFImpBuyer0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer0,,"""Do you know what this is?"" Menes whispers to you. 

""It looks like a glove, demarch,"" Bornanew answers in feigned misunderstanding, stepping forward.",bffi_mpBuyer1:Continue,
BFFImpBuyer1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer1,,"""Not any glove,"" Menes says with more than a hint of vexation.

He begins again in a reverent whisper, ""The glove worn by Ludd upon stepping upon the sacred Earth of Gilead. Ludd removed the glove and kissed the ground, according to the Luddic religion. Isn't that right, sir Knight? And this... is it.""

Bornanew looks at you, his eyebrows rising slightly as if to give a cue. ""This would be a most impressive find,"" he says. ""If it is as you say.""","bffi_mpBuyer2:""Well I'm impressed, Menes. A relic from a pivotal moment of the Sector's history!""",
BFFImpBuyer2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer2,,"""Thank-you captain!"" Menes says, relieved and more than a little pleased that someone appreciates his trinket.

""Setting aside its purely religious significance,"" he gives an annoyed glance at Bornanew, ""it represents a, a heralding of the changing tide of history! The ebbing influence of the Domain-era megacorporations, the rising of what some call - not my words of course, sir Knight - an atavistic populism. Truly, it is this small piece of the vastness of the story of Humanity which called to me when it was first described to me...""","bffi_mpBuyer3:""I, too, feel its call. Would you consider selling the piece?""",
BFFImpBuyer3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer3,,"""Oh, captain."" Menes chuckles approvingly. ""I couldn't possibly sell this, the prize of my collection. Nothing can compare!""

""-Although,"" he quibbles with himself, ""I do possess a captain's uniform of the Fourteenth Battlegroup in excellent condition, and indeed a pistol once owned by the Warlord Leonis which I believe was used to execute prisoners at... well, you understand my point of course.""",bffi_mpBuyer3b:Continue,
BFFImpBuyer3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer3b,,"""Of course,"" Bornanew says from behind Menes, who has fully turned his back to the Knight. ""If it is indeed the real glove of Ludd.""

You maintain your composure while watching the look that crosses Menes' face.","bffi_mpBuyer4:""The Knight has a point, Menes. I couldn't make an offer without verification.""",
BFFImpBuyer4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyer4,FireAll BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,"Menes laugh is more than a little strained.

""Now now, captain, I have not said I was offering the glove for any kind of sale. And,"" he glances back at Bornanew, ""a lesser man than I might take offense at your implications, sir. My source has impeccable standards, and I assure you the provenance of the piece is most distinguished.""",,
BFFImpBuyerHubOptA,BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,"!$didVeracity
!$madeOffer",,,"bffi_mpBuyerVeracity:""Let's discuss veracity. I need... reassurance."" ",
BFFImpBuyerHubOptAagain,BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,"$didVeracity
$madeOffer",,,"bffi_mpBuyerVeracity:""Considering my offer, I require full confidence in the item.""",
BFFImpBuyerHubOptB,BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,!$offered500k,,,"bffi_mpBuyerCredits500k:""Let's discuss credits. Would a half-million open the question of a sale?""",
BFFImpBuyerHubOptC,BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,,,,"bffi_mpBuyerCredits700k:""Let's discuss credits. Would 700k open the question of a sale?""",
BFFImpBuyerHubOptD,BFFImpBuyerHubOpts,,,,"bffi_mpBuyerCredits1m:""Let's not waste time. One million credits.""",
