FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Menes sighs dramatically, ""I suppose - and this is because I'm feeling charitable - I would entertain the notion of a mere 900,000 credits."" He looks at you sharply, ""And that's only because you're a fellow demarch.""","bffi_mpBuyerCredits800kJeffReact:""You're practically a saint. Now the matter of veracity...""",
