""I suppose,"" he muses, ""I suppose I'm in an oddly generous mood to even be discussing this.""","bffi_mpBuyerCredits800kJeffReact:""You're practically a saint. Now the matter of veracity...""",
BFFImpBuyerOffer800kJeffReact,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_mpBuyerCredits800kJeffReact,$offered800k = true 0,"You think you hear a snort from Bornanew, but perhaps he just scuffed the floor.",bffi_mpBuyerVeracity2:Continue,
