# BFFI Menes' Party outros,,,,,,
BFFIpartyOutro1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_partyOutro1,BeginConversation bornanew,"Bornanew places the glove carefully into a clear-sided containment vessel, the kind used by salvors to take biological samples. Illuminated by the vessel's interior glowstrips, the glove seems to be held in a reliquary shining with holy light.

""Mere evidence,"" Bornanew says, seeing your look. ""Now the question is, where did this come from?""","bffi_partyOutro2b:""What did you make of that Ulmus Pond?""
bffi_partyOutro2a:""I don't suppose we could ask Menes.""",
BFFIpartyOutro1buyer,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_partyOutro1
$global.bffi_intendToBeBuyer","unset $global.bffi_intendToBeBuyer
$player.bffi_boughtRelic = true
AddTextSmall ""Acquired the false relic"" highlight
BeginConversation bornanew
FireBest BFFIpartyOutro1buyerCheck","At last you find yourself back in your shuttle.

Bornanew sets a drinking bulb of cold water in your hand, then places a clear-sided containment vessel, the kind used by salvors to take biological samples, in the seat next to you. Illuminated by the vessel's interior embedded glowstrips, the glove seems to be held in a reliquary shining with holy light.

""Physical evidence,"" Bornanew says, seeing your look. ""Nothing more.""","bffi_partyOutro2c:""Thanks. What did you make of that Ulmus Pond?""
bffi_partyOutro3:Continue",
