$global.bffi_intendToTalkHorus",,"You place the glove into a clear-sided containment vessel, the kind used by salvors to take biological samples. Illuminated by the vessel's interior embedded glowstrips, the glove seems to be held in a reliquary shining with holy light.

""Mere evidence,"" Bornanew says, seeing your look. ""Now the question is, where did this come from?""","bffi_partyOutro2b:""What did you make of that Ulmus Pond?""
bffi_partyOutro2a:""I don't suppose we could ask Menes.""",
BFFIpartyOutro1horus2,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_partyOutro1
$global.bffi_intendToTalkHorus
$gaveGloveToBonranew",,"Bornanew places the glove carefully into a clear-sided containment vessel, the kind used by salvors to take biological samples. Illuminated by the vessel's interior embedded glowstrips, the glove seems to be held in a reliquary shining with holy light.

""Mere evidence,"" Bornanew says, seeing your look. ""Now the question is, where did this come from?""","bffi_partyOutro2b:""What did you make of that Ulmus Pond?""
bffi_partyOutro2a:""I don't suppose we could ask Menes.""",
BFFIpartyOutro2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_partyOutro2a,,"Bornanew raises an eyebrow at you. ""I wouldn't suppose, no.""

He looks back to the glove in its containment vessel. ""The glove might answer our questions, however.""",bffi_partyOutro3:Continue,
BFFIpartyOutro2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_partyOutro2b,$global.bffi_jethroCalledOutPond = true,"""He's a Pather agent,"" Bornanew says as if it were the most obvious thing in the world. He meets your look.

""We spoke briefly,"" he explains. ""The circumstantial evidence is convincing enough, but it was his heretical understanding of theology which I found truly damning.""

""He may be connected, but first we should ask the glove."" He looks back down at the glove in its containment vessel.",bffi_partyOutro3:Continue,
BFFIpartyOutro2c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_partyOutro2c,$global.bffi_jethroCalledOutPond = true,"""He's a Pather agent,"" Bornanew says as if it were the most obvious thing in the world. He meets your look.

""We spoke briefly,"" he explains. ""The circumstantial evidence is convincing enough, but it was his heretical understanding of theology which I found truly damning.""

""He's also a liar. So."" He looks down at the glove once more.",bffi_partyOutro3:Continue,# buyer version
