Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage","""A nanoforge engineer could tell us where this came from,"" he says. ""Who made it. When, and where. By that truth, we can judge the answers we receive from those we... interview."" His last word is muted by the shuttle's maneuverings.

""The Church operates a nanoforge on the planet Asher, in the Canaan system. The engineers there will cooperate with the authority I bear, and despite mostly being nonbelievers, their discretion is already paid for by the Church. Our inquiry will be safe.""

He pauses, and looks away. ""So far as anything is, in the Church.""","bffi_partyOutro4:""I feel like we've worn out our welcome here anyway.""",
