$global.bornanewBadBoy++","Bornanew sighs deeply, dropping his previous countenance, and looks at you with almost a sadness in his eyes. ""This is not as we agreed. I ask now that you stand aside and allow me to complete this unsavory task.""

With that, his face goes blank and he turns, seizing Pond by the neck with one hand and lifting him off the cot with a choked sound.","bffi_ulmusTalkPcWrong2:""Um, $global.jethroName?""
bffi_ulmusTalkPcWrong2a:""$global.jethroName! What are you doing?""",
BFFIulmusTalkPcWrong2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_ulmusTalkPcWrong2a,"$option = bffi_ulmusTalkPcWrong2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""What, it seems, I must,"" he says flatly.",,
BFFIulmusTalkPcWrong2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_ulmusTalkPcWrong2,$global.bornanewChokedPond = true,"""Ulmus,"" he growls and, with his other hand Bornanew lifts his cheap datapad to within reach of Pond's flailing arms. The screen is already set to a map of the greater Persean Sector.

""Show us where the glove came from. Then you may breathe.""",bffi_ulmusTalkSedgeCheck:Continue,
BFFIulmusTalkPcWrong3a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_ulmusTalkSedgeCheck
!$player.shotSedge
$global.bornanewChokedPond",,"Bornanew's datapad trembles in Pond's hands. He cannot designate a star system until Bornanew concedes by lowering him back onto the cot.

Gasping and choking, Pond marks a system. It is difficult to make out his words. Something about ""pather"".

""This Pather, Ulmus,"" Bornanew says, glancing at the datapad then placing it in his satchel. ""Tell us his name.""

Tears stream down Ulmus' face; the man looks deflated, and absolutely defeated. Then he looks up and his eyes go wide.

""Sedge!"" he rasps.","bffi_ulmusTalkSedge1:Turn around, slowly",
BFFIulmusTalkPcWrong3b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_ulmusTalkSedgeCheck
$player.shotSedge
$global.bornanewChokedPond",,"Bornanew's datapad trembles in Pond's hands. He cannot designate a star system until Bornanew concedes by lowering him back onto the cot.

Gasping and choking, Pond marks a system. It is difficult to make out his words. Something about ""pather"".

""This Pather, Ulmus,"" Bornanew says, glancing at the datapad then placing it in his satchel. ""Tell us his name.""

Tears stream down Ponds' face; the man looks deflated, and absolutely defeated. ""Sedge,"" he rasps, finally.

Bornanew shoots a look at you.","bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro1a:""Wrestling Sedge. But he's dead.""
bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro1b:""I recall handling that problem already.""",
