!$player.shotSedge",,"Bornanew's datapad trembles in Pond's hands. He cannot designate a star system until Bornanew holds the pad steady for him.

""This Pather, Ulmus,"" Bornanew says, glancing at the datapad then placing it in his satchel. The threat retreats from his voice. ""Tell us his name.""

Tears stream down Ulmus' face; the man looks deflated, and absolutely defeated. Then he looks up and his eyes go wide.

""Sedge!""","bffi_ulmusTalkSedge1:Turn around, slowly",
BFFIulmusSedge1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_ulmusTalkSedge1,ShowThirdPerson sedge,"Wrestling Sedge shows you his broken smile.

""Captain $playerFirstName, again. And again the man with too much faith, Bornanew. Jethro Bornanew. See?""

Sedge's pistol is unwavering.

""This time I remember for you.""","bffi_ulmusTalkSedge2a:Subvocalize a call to your security team
bffi_ulmusTalkSedge2b:""We were just having a chat with Mister Pond here.""
bffi_ulmusTalkSedge2c:""Sedge. I should have shot you when I had the chance.""
