$player.sdtu_weaponWire","AddTextSmall ""Killed Wrestling Sedge"" highlight
EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
HideVisual","In one smooth motion you draw the false fingertip of the monomolecular wire and throw it in an arc which intersects Sedge's neck. There is no resistance.

With a wet sigh, his body slides back against the wall, his head askew. His eyes blink once at you, expression caught in a look of dumb surprise.",bffi_ulmusSedge6:Check on Bornanew,
