$player.toldBornanewHeIsGoodGuy","$option = bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro2opts 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""This was before,"" Pond says. ""His people are still... they're everywhere. They'll kill me.""

He looks at Bornanew hopefully. ""You said you'd keep me safe. As a Knight.""

$global.jethroName closes his eyes and sighs.",,
