$global.bornanewChokedPond score:2","$option = bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro2opts 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""This,"" Pond coughs violently, holding his throat, ""-before. Pathers... everywhere. Kill me.""

He looks at you fearfully after a glance at Bornanew. ""... help me.""",,
