BFFIpondNoSedgeOutro2dealA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro2deal,,"Bornanew looks at you, then to Pond. His expression softens, just a little.

""Captain,"" he says. ""They will kill him for his failure. And not well. Let me turn him over to the Knights. They will offer him a path to redemption, harsh though it may be.""","bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro2knights:""As you like, $global.jethroName. Pond is your responsibility.""
bffi_pondNoSedgeOutro2deal2:""No. Pond earned his own fate and I'll have it no other way.""","# just following your lead, negajeff++"
