BFFIulmusNoSedgeOutro2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut2,HideSecondPerson,"Pond nods, tears streaming down his face. He seems not to know what to do, and simply sits there slumped like a ragdoll, his mouth half-open.

You leave him in his cheap apartment, stepping over the ruined door. Bornanew pauses a moment to lean it against the hollow door frame like an insufficient apology.",bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut3:Continue,
BFFIulmusNoSedgeOutro2menes,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut2menes
$player.bffi_pondFateMenes",HideSecondPerson,"Pond nods, tears streaming down his face. He sits slumped like a ragdoll, mouth half-open, until Bornanew pulls him to his feet.

""Move, walker."" Bornanew's voice is his own again. ""The path of redemption is not easy, but it is as Ludd would ask.""

You follow Pond from his cheap apartment, stepping over the ruined door. He gives you and Bornanew one last look, his face drained of emotion, then disappears down one of the labyrinthine alleyways of the settlement.",bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut3:Continue,
BFFIulmusNoSedgeOutro2knights,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut2knights
$player.bffi_pondFateKnights",HideSecondPerson,"Pond nods, tears streaming down his face. He sits slumped like a ragdoll, mouth half-open, until Bornanew pulls him to his feet.

""Move, walker."" Bornanew's voice is his own again. ""The path of redemption is not easy, but it is as Ludd would ask.""

You follow Pond from his cheap apartment, stepping over the ruined door. Bornanew makes a brief comms request, and soon a pair of furtive, hooded figures collect Pond from your custody.",bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut3b:Continue,
BFFIulmusNoSedgeOutro3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut3,"
$option = bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Bornanew watches him go, then stands with you for a quiet moment. Water drips, and the wind moans a low keen through the top of the settlement. 

He taps at his datapad, and yours pings with incoming coordinates.

""I suspect this sect of the Path will not surrender their secrets without a fight,"" he says. ""They have invested much in this conspiracy.""",,
