ShowLargePlanet","""I pray we find our answers,"" Bornanew says as you return to the shuttle. ""And I fear now that the Pathers know that we know their aims.""

You secure yourself in your seat as the access hatch seals itself. The shuttle begins to lift toward orbit.","bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut6a:""Fear not, $global.jethroName. My $shipOrFleet will be ready.""
bffi_ulmusTalkNoSedgeOut6b:""When I end this, $global.jethroName, it is the Path that shall fear me.""",
