BFFIpsApproachConsultStartC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psConsultStartA,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"""Captain,"" he says. ""We are here to find out who gave the Luddic Path a detailed scan of the original glove."" He nods toward the display of the station, ""There will be comms buffers and, somewhere, a datacore of the glove scan - with metadata."" The display bristles with weapons emplacements highlighted by tactical overlays.

""And we are here to eliminate their ability to produce another false relic."" He looks distant, and speaks ""'Hammer in one hand, sword in the other, I pray to see it done.'""",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptA0,BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,!$didStep1,,,"bffi_psaConHubRespA1:""So, how do you think we should approach this one?""",
BFFIpsaConHubOptA1,BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,!$didStep1,,,"bffi_psaConHubRespA2:""Shall we ask nicely how they did it?""",
BFFIpsaConHubOptA2,BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,!$didStep1,,,"bffi_psaConHubRespA3:""These are fanatics. They'd sooner die than talk.""",
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA1,"$didStep1 = true 0
$saidCarefully = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""Carefully,"" Bornanew says, turning to you. ""As ever. Violence is among the tools of the Knight, but it must be that: a tool, not an end unto itself, 'lest it fill my heart with wrath, my soul with hate, to thereafter leave no home for love of the Creator, nor the Word.'""

Is that part of a credo of the Knights of Ludd? It isn't one you've heard before.",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA1bb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA1
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$didStep1 = true 0
$saidDecisively = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""Decisively,"" Bornanew says, turning to you. ""You have taught me that much. Violence is among a Knight's tools, and I must not cower from its use.""

""A marine raid to seize datastores, comms buffers, and prisoners. Then the nanoforge and all of its support equipment should be destroyed.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA2bb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA2
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$didStep1 = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","Bornanew gives you a weary look.

""You may jest, and I understand your need."" He turns back to the tactical display. ""However I shan't close my eyes to the nature of my duty; you have taught me that much. Violence is among a Knight's tools, and I must not cower from its use.""

""Consider: a marine raid to seize datastores, comms buffers, and prisoners. Then, you have demolitions experts? The nanoforge and all of its support equipment must be destroyed."" ",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA2,"$didStep1 = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""You cannot truly know until you ask,"" says Bornanew, choosing to entertain your presumed levity. ""The Creator gave even the Path free will, and I would accept peaceable surrender if given.""

He turns to you. ""And violence is among the tools of a Knight, but it must be that: a tool, not an end unto itself, 'lest it fill my heart with wrath, my soul with hate, to thereafter leave no home for love of the Creator, nor the Word.'""

""Consider: a marine raid to seize datastores and comms buffers. Then,"" he examines the tactical display, ""you have demolitions experts? The nanoforge and all of its support equipment must be destroyed.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA3,"$didStep1 = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""Perhaps,"" says Bornanew. ""But do not let the fearsome reputation sown by the Luddic Path blind you to what they truly are - human. Fearful and fallible as you or I.""

""They might be convinced to reveal something. Or if you can acquire comms buffers, they may prove illuminating."" He looks at you, ""I believe there is a mole, an agent loyal to the Path within the Holy Cathedral of Exodus with access to the vaults. I need to narrow down my list of suspects.""

""To say nothing of destroying this nanoforge and any data on the glove held in datacores."" He considers a moment, then says ""Metadata from the scan of the glove may be useful, also.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptRespA3bb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespA3
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$didStep1 = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""Of that I admit I have little doubt."" Bornanew gives you a weary look.

He turns back to the tactical display. ""I shan't close my eyes to the nature of my duty; you have taught me that much. Violence is among a Knight's tools, and I must not cower from its use.""

""Consider: a marine raid to seize datastores, comms buffers, and prisoners. Then... you have demolitions experts? The nanoforge and all of its support equipment must be destroyed.""",,
