!$saidBlast",,,"bffi_psaConHubRespBlast:""We could simply blast this station apart and sift the wreckage for datastores and prisoners.""",
BFFIpsaConHubRespCarefully,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespCarefully,"$saidCarefully2 = true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""I apologize for dissembling,"" he looks down for a moment, then back to you. ""Talk? Perhaps,"" he says.

""Don't let the fearsome reputation of the Luddic Path blind you to what they are - as human and fallible as you or I. We were given free will, and I would accept peaceable surrender if it were given.""

""That is unlikely, however. Consider: a marine raid to seize datastores and comms buffers. Then... you have demolitions experts? The nanoforge itself must be destroyed."" ",,
BFFIpsaConHubTalk,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespTalk,"$saidPerhapsTalk= true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","He thinks for a moment.

""I pray it is so. It would require some exceptional ruse or the charisma of a pr- no, let me not blaspheme by saying it. But you understand that it is, as I believe spacers say, 'a long shot'.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubTalkB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespTalk
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 1","$saidPerhapsTalk= true 0
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","He thinks for a moment, a dark look threatening to grow.

""I pray it is so. But these are heretics, poisoned by a false Word and a dark Path. It would require some exceptional ruse or the charisma of a pr- no, let me not blaspheme by saying it. But you understand that it is, as I believe spacers say, 'a long shot'.""

He contemplates the tactical display for a moment. ""As well, there is something to be said for the element of surprise.""",,
#BFFIpsaConHubTalkSuggestA,,$player.luddicFaithfulOrChurchCom,,"""You walk the Path as one of the faithful. Appeal to common ground - this scheme would tear the Faith apart. Will all those of the Church simply turn to the Path at a push? Will other factions sit idly by as sectarian war rages, or will they seek advantage?""",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlast,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlast,$saidBlast = true 0,"Bornanew lets out a breath.

""You must not,"" he looks worried. ""Setting aside... objections of the heart, complete destruction would almost certainly destroy the evidence required to identify the agent of the Path who has infiltrated the Cathedral of Holy Exodus.""","bffi_psaConHubRespBlastA:""You've given me a lot to think about.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastB:""You suggest that leniency will prompt cooperation? From Pathers?""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCa:""Archcurate Jaspis seems less forgiving of Pathers than you.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastC:""If I do not prove absolute domination of my enemy, they will not fear me.""",
BFFIpsaConHubBlastbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlast
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2",$saidBlast = true 0,"Bornanew takes a long breath. His eyes are dark, reflecting red pinpoints from the display.

""Doubtless such destruction would send an uncompromising message to these heretics who attempt to sew schism in the fields of the Mother Church. But."" He raises his hand as if to grasp at his argument. ""Total obliteration poses a serious risk of destroying the evidence needed to track down the agent of the Path who has infiltrated the Cathedral of Holy Exodus. We need those data stores.""

He pauses, then turns to you. ""Find the data first, through a marine raid, or some subterfuge. Then destroy the station. All would be served justice thus.""","bffi_psaConHubRespBlastA:""I shall consider this.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBBlen:""I expected more talk of leniency from you, $global.jethroName.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBBjasp:""I believe that Archcurate Jaspis would approve of this 'message'.""",
BFFIpsaConHubBlastLen,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBBlen,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"""Did you?"" he asks.

""You have made virtue of using a swift and strong hand in such matters. A Knight must learn to harden his heart when the situation calls for such... efficacy.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastBBjasp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBBjasp,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"""Indeed."" He casts his gaze up and far away. ""I thought her harsh, before. Cynicism of age. But I see now with the eyes of a man.""

""And I, for my part, made the choice to trust you."" He looks to you.

""So, captain, the path is yours. I shall follow."" He clasps his hands together, bowing his head slightly.",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastA,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"He raises an eyebrow at your noncommittal response, but nods acceptance, hands clasped.",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastB,,"""I do,"" he says. ""They are merely human, as are we all. Despite a history written in blood, I do not find that our species thrives on hatred.""","bffi_psaConHubRespBlastA:""You've given me a lot to think about.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBa:""I shall do as you ask - so far as is possible.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCc:""If they force me to, I will do what is necessary.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCa:""Archcurate Jaspis seems less forgiving of Pathers than you.""",
BFFIpsaConHubBlastBa,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastBa,"AdjustRepActivePerson COOPERATIVE 1
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","He nods acceptance, thankful, with hands clasped.",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastC,$player.ethosRuthless++,"""Perhaps. Though alongside their fear, you will earn their hate, and confirm in their minds all they say of you,"" he says. ""You may well leave eternal enemies in your wake.""

""Or corpses, I suppose,"" he adds grimly.","bffi_psaConHubRespBlastA:""You've given me a lot to think about.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCa:""Archcurate Jaspis seems less forgiving of Pathers than you.""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCb:""I'll just win the battle without hurting anyone, is that what you want?""
bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCc:""If they force me to, I will do what is necessary.""",
BFFIpsaConHubBlastCa,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCa,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"""Indeed."" He casts his gaze up and far away. ""Let not the sins of our mothers..."" he says quietly, then looks back to you.

""Take my words not as judgment, but as a personal... a prayer, I suppose. Whatever her words, whatever her actions, she did choose to entrust her support to me in this, my task. And I, for my part, chose to trust you.""

""So, captain, the path is yours."" He drops his gaze and clasps his hands together.",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastCb,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCb,"$player.ethosSarcastic++
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","He raises a skeptical eyebrow at you, but nods, hands clasped.

""I'd like nothing more, captain. Truly.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastCb-bb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCb
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$player.ethosSarcastic++
FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts","""In truth, it is not,"" he says. ""I shan't ask the impossible."" 

He clasps his hands together. ""I trust you will achieve what you must, how you must.""",,
BFFIpsaConHubBlastCc,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespBlastCc,FireAll BFFIpsaConsultHubOpts,"He raises a skeptical eyebrow at you, but nods, hands clasped.",,
BFFIpsaConHubOptEResp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psaConHubRespE,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
FireBest MarketPostDock
ShowDefaultVisual","Bornanew lowers his head for just a moment, mumbling a short prayer to himself, then leaves the bridge to you and your officers.",,
,,,,,,
# BFFI - INVESTIGATE_PATHER_STATION intro consult in medbay,,,,,,
BFFIpsApproachBornMedbay,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psConsultFork
$global.bornanewShotDuringBFFI",,"Bornanew is conscious, you are told. You chief medical officer warns you against unnecessary stress; the healing process is fragile.","bffi_stationMedConsult0:Consult with $global.jethroName
bffi_psApproachYourself:Handle this one yourself",
BFFIpsApproachYourself,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psApproachYourself,FireBest MarketPostDock,"You decide to let Bornanew rest. You've got this.

All you need to do is beg, trick, or force the Pathers to reveal the source of their scan of the original glove. That glove has somehow remained, presumably untouched, in the vault of the Holy Cathedral of Exodus back on Tartessus this whole time.

Pathers are not known for keeping good digital records, but to nanoforge a copy of the glove, they would have had to. There may be metadata still in the computer systems connected to the nanoforge.

Or someone who simply knows the answers which you seek.",,
BFFIstationMedConsultStart,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConsult0,"BeginConversation bornanew
FireAll BFFIstationMedConsultOpts","The attending medtech gives you a stern look as you step into the medbay despite the fact that you are the captain of the $shipOrFleet.

Bornanew's face is pale and bloated. His abdomen is covered in bandages and trailing tubes connected to a suite of murmuring autodocs.

""$playerFirstName,"" he says. ""I appear to live."" He takes a breath. ""And to you I owe thanks. Captain, I mean. Apologies.""",bffi_psApproachMedConsult1:TODO continue,
BFFIstationMedConsultOptA,BFFIstationMedConsultOpts,!$saidPain,,,"bffi_stationMedConBrave:""$global.jethroName. That was a brave thing you did on Chalcedon.""",
BFFIstationMedConsultOptB,BFFIstationMedConsultOpts,!$saidPain,,,"bffi_stationMedConStupid:""$global.jethroName. That was a stupid thing you did on Chalcedon.""",
BFFIstationMedConsultOptC,BFFIstationMedConsultOpts,!$saidThank,,,"bffi_stationMedConThank:""You should thank the medical team, they're the ones that saved you.""",
BFFIstationMedConsultOptD,BFFIstationMedConsultOpts,,,,"bffi_stationMedConWhatDo1:""We're in the $bffi_patherStationSystem. There's a Pather base.""",
BFFIstationMedConBrave,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConBrave,"$option = bffi_stationMedConPain 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFIstationMedConStupid,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConStupid,"$option = bffi_stationMedConPain 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
BFFIstationMedConPain,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConPain,"$saidPain = true 0
FireAll BFFIstationMedConsultOpts","It looks like he tries to shrug, and fails.

""It was... it was..."" he trails off, and closes his eyes. ""I was terrified, captain. A coward. And yet, what else could be done?""

He opens his eyes. ""It may be that is enough for a Knight."" He shifts slightly, under the bandages and tubes. ""The machines, drugs. They take the pain away. It still hurts.""",,
BFFIstationMedConThank,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConThank,"$saidThank = true 0
FireAll BFFIstationMedConsultOpts","""I have,"" he says. ""And shall again, 'til they tire of it.""",,
BFFIstationMedConWhatDo1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConWhatDo1,,"""Ah. Then Ulmus told us true."" A flicker of a smile crosses Bornanew's face.

""We must... destroy the nanoforge. And find out who the mole is, in the cathedral. Tartessus."" He closes his eyes and takes a slow breath.","bffi_stationMedConIntendA:""I intend to negotiate with the Pather in charge here.""
bffi_stationMedConIntendB:""I intend to send a marine raid. Seize datastores, destroy the forge.""
bffi_stationMedConIntendC:""I intend to attack directly. Destroy the station.""",
BFFIstationMedConIntendA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConIntendA,"$option = bffi_stationMedConOutro1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""They are... as human and fallible as any of us. To convince them, would be a miracle."" He looks at you skeptically.

""If... that fails. Acquire hard data. The scan of the original glove, the metadata may tell us. Comms buffers. Archives. All useful."" He looks at you, ""I have a list of suspects. A mole in the Holy Cathedral of Exodus. Need evidence. Who to... put to inquisition."" 

Defensive, he adds, ""The rumors... slander. Mostly."" His eyes are closed, his breathing shallow. ""And... destroy the forge. Must be destroyed.""",,
BFFIstationMedConIntendB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConIntendB,"$option = bffi_stationMedConOutro1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""The Pathers' reputation... they are as human as any. Not all heretical zealots. Fallible, fearful."" He looks at you skeptically.

""I have a list of suspects. A mole in the Holy Cathedral of Exodus. Need evidence. Who to... put to inquisition. Acquire hard data. The scan of the original glove, the metadata may tell us. Comms buffers. Archives. All useful."" 

He looks at you. ""Inquisition... the rumors. Slander. Mostly."" His eyes are closed, his breathing shallow. ""And... destroy the forge. Must be destroyed.""",,
BFFIstationMedConIntendC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConIntendC,"$option = bffi_stationMedConOutro1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""No!"" He speaks a little too forcefully; a blinking light turns yellow.

""Risky... need acquire hard data. Scan of the original glove, the metadata. Comms buffers. Archives."" He takes a deep breath then looks at you, ""I have a list of suspects. A mole in the Holy Cathedral of Exodus. Need evidence. Who to... put to inquisition."" 

He pauses, then says, ""Inquisitors. The rumors... slander. Mostly."" His eyes are closed, his breathing shallow. ""And... destroy the forge. Must be destroyed.""",,
BFFIstationMedConOutro1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConOutro1,,"""$PlayerSirOrMadam."" Your chief medical officer appears behind you. ""The patient needs rest. I must insist.""","bffi_stationMedConOutro2a:""Of course.""
bffi_stationMedConOutro2b:""I will decide when he needs rest, doctor.""",
BFFIstationMedConOutro2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConOutro2a,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
ShowDefaultVisual","Your med chief's face is crossed by a network of fine wrinkles, evidence of many cycles of service. They say nothing, but turn their head at a small and precise angle.

Bornanew's breathing is slow, regular. His eyes closed. Unconscious.",bffi_stationMedConsultOut:Continue,
BFFIstationMedConOutro2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConOutro2b,"$player.ethosRuthless++
EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
ShowDefaultVisual","The expression on your med chief's face doesn't change, but the network of fine wrinkles tells of sufficient cycles of service such that they will stand firm against your overstep of authority.

""Nonetheless,"" your chief medical officer says, turning their head a small and precise angle.

Bornanew's breathing is slow, regular. His eyes closed. Unconscious.",bffi_stationMedConsultOut:Continue,
BFFIstationMedConsultOut,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_stationMedConsultOut,"
FireBest MarketPostDock",You leave Bornanew to the stern care of your chief medical officer.,,
