BFFIpsTalkFailStart,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_psTalkFailStart
!$global.bornanewShotDuringBFFI",BeginConversation bornanew,"""Well,"" Bornanew says from beside you. ""Let it not be said that you did not attempt diplomacy.""","bffi_psTalkFail:Say nothing
