# BFFI Pather Station Ruses,,,,,,
BFFIpsRuseOpenNice,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psRuseOpenNice,$reasons = 0,"You explain that you will require comms buffers and datastores pertaining to Sedge's scheme. You will need the datastores of the nanoforge, and must be given access in order to destroy it.

No one need be hurt; it can be done quickly, without bloodshed, and without compromising $hisOrHer leadership status if $heOrShe secretly gives you their primary security codes. Blame it on the injection of a semi-sentient computer virus, a 'daemon' of the sort Molochians conjure in their AI-labs.","bffi_psRuseOpenNice2:""Accept my terms. It is the Path of least harm for all.""",
BFFIpsRuseOpenNice2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_psRuseOpenNice2,FireAll BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts,"""Why should I trust you to keep your word?"" $HeOrShe is clearly unhappy with your terms. ""You're no servant of Providence following the holy Word passed to us by Ludd. How can there be light in your heart?""",,
BFFIpsRuseOpenNiceAlmost,BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts,$reasons == 2,,"$HeOrShe looks upon you, face now more open than before, as if almost convinced...",,
BFFIpsRuseOpenNiceDone,BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts,"$reasons >= 3
!$saidAccept",$saidAccept = true,"""Cease, I beg you."" $HeOrShe puts $hisOrHer head in $hisOrHer hands. ""I pray this is the correct Path, that you are not the monster you appear.""

""I must accept your terms,"" $heOrShe says, ""I shall pray for forgiveness. And may any hellfire of this world or the next fall upon myself first and not those I seek to protect.""",,
BFFIpsRuseNiceOption,BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts,$reasons >= 3,"SetStoryOption bffi_stationTalkRuseNice 1 bffi_patherStationRuse general ""Convinced leader of Pather station to give up nanoforge and data on their mole on Tartessus""",,bffi_stationTalkRuseNice:Carry out the ruse to seize datastores and destroy the nanoforge,
