$reasons++
FireAll BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts","""I admit, I have heard word of the one with whom this deal was struck."" $HisOrHer brow furrows. ""I cannot say I fully understand it, but we are... requested not to harm you, if it is so possible.""

The Pather looks up and away for a moment. ""This is a strange Path I find myself walking,"" $heOrShe says, as if to some greater power. ""I pray that its truth may be revealed before long...""",,
