BFFIpsRuseNiceOutA,BFFIpsRuseNiceOpts,!$player.luddicAttitudeFaithfulOrPather,,,"bffi_stationTalkOutA:""My patience is spent. There can be no deal, and that's on you."" (cut comms)",
