$global.bornanewWasShotBySedge
!$didInjuredTalk",$didInjuredTalk = true 0,"Bornanew halts for a moment, his breathing heavy.

""I beg you spare a moment, captain,"" he says self-consciously. ""It... has taken much of me.""",bffi_idolTalkTrouble:Continue,
