BFFIidolTalkOpposition,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOpposition,,,"bffi_arrestOppoA:""So you're just going to walk in, unarmed, and make an arrest?""
bffi_arrestOppoB:""You mention this now? We should have prepared.""
bffi_arrestOppoC:""Opposition? Shall I call in a squad of marines?""
bffi_arrestOppoD:""Not to worry. I'm prepared."" (pat your weapon)",
BFFIidolTalkOppositionInjured,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOpposition
$global.bornanewWasShotBySedge",,,"bffi_arrestOppoE:""With your injury... you're sure you want to do this?""
bffi_arrestOppoA:""So you're just going to walk in, unarmed, to arrest a curate?""
bffi_arrestOppoC:""Opposition? Shall I call in a squad of marines?""
bffi_arrestOppoD:""Not to worry. I'm prepared."" (pat your weapon)",
BFFIarrestOppoA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppoA,"$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I suppose I am,"" he says, turning to smile and give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands and heart.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoAbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOppoA
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I am,"" he says, turning give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree. ""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands.""

""Besides,"" he adds with a wry smile, ""you've seen fit to remain armed.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppoB,"$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I am prepared,"" he says, turning to smile and give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands and heart.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoBbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOppoB
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I am prepared,"" he says, turning to give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree. ""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands.""

""Besides,"" he adds with a wry smile, ""you've seen fit to remain armed.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppoC,"$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""That will not be necessary,"" he says, turning to smile and give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""In fact, that is the worst thing we could do. This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands and heart.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoCbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOppoC
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""That will not be necessary,"" he says, turning to give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""My fellow Knights guard the Cathedral. I do trust that, whatever minor heresy they might be steeped in, they would not injure their brother without very good reason. This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands.""

""Besides,"" he adds with a wry smile, ""you've seen fit to remain armed.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppoD,"$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""That will not be necessary,"" he says, turning to smile and give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""I urge you to maintain a restrained composure, captain. Even possessing a weapon in the cathedral is generally forbidden, though I have claimed your presence under the authority of the Reverend Archcurate Jaspis."" He gives you a quick look to make sure he's getting through.

""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands and heart.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoDbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOppoD
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""'...With hammer and sword'"" he says, turning to give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims resting under a tree.

""Possessing a weapon in the cathedral is generally forbidden, though I have claimed your presence under the authority of the Reverend Archcurate Jaspis."" He gives you a quick look to make sure he's getting through.

""This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands. But,"" he adds with a wry smile, ""Ludd was not impractical when it served Providence, I think.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoE,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppoE,"$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""It is necessary that I do this,"" he says, then turns to smile and give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims who are walking past him.

""The spirit is willing. This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands and heart.""",,
BFFIarrestOppoEbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_arrestOppoE
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","$option = bffi_arrestOppo2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""It is necessary,"" he says, then turns to give a bow, hands together, to a group of elderly pilgrims who are walking past. ""My spirit is willing. This must be done as Ludd would, with open hands.""

""Besides,"" he adds with a wry smile, ""you've seen fit to remain armed. Even Ludd was not impractical when it served Providence, I think.""",,
BFFIarrestOppo2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppo2,,,"bffi_arrestOppo3a:""I'll, um, follow your lead.""
bffi_arrestOppo3d:""Must it? You're putting a lot of faith in others choosing to cooperate.""
bffi_arrestOppo3b:""I'll protect the two of us, then. If it comes to it.""
bffi_arrestOppo3c:""I mean no offense, but you're a bit crazy, you know that?""",
BFFIarrestOppo2bb,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppo2,,,"bffi_arrestOppo3a:""I'll follow your lead.""
bffi_arrestOppo3b:""I'll protect the two of us, then.""
bffi_arrestOppo3c:""I mean no offense, but you're a bit crazy, you know that?""",
BFFIarrestOppo3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_arrestOppo3a,"$option = bffi_arrestEnter 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Your trust is ever a welcome gift,"" he says, quite earnest.",,
