BFFIdeliverToOakJustBody,BFFIdeliverToOakMore,$global.bffi_returnBornanewBody,,"The simple spacer's coffin holding Bornanew's body is loaded onto the shuttle. One of the spacers briefly puts their hands together, head bowed, after setting it down. A small sign of Luddic devotion.",,
