FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Keepfaith inhales as if she might speak, some righteous outburst, but falters. Her eyes fall back toward the ground.

The Excubitor Orbis takes in your comment, his face impassive as the stone this hangar was blasted from. His clerk's eyes are downcast.",,
