$global.bffi_arrestedKeepfaith","$option = bffi_deliverToOakBody2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Is that a twitch of impatience on the impassive face of the Excubitor Orbis? But truly, the read is in his clerk; she almost cringes at the insufficiency of your answer.

