$global.bffi_keepfaithEscaped
!$global.bffi_returnBornanewBody",,"The Excubitor Orbis had never stopped watching you. ""Your theory. Tartessus,"" he prompts $global.jethroName.

Bornanew takes a step forward. ""Excubitor Orbis. We tracked the source of the false relic to a nanoforge operated by heretics of the so-called Luddic Path. A station on the far fringe, in the $bffi_patherStationSystem.""",bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2:Continue,"# she escaped when Bornanew was shot
# bornanew alive
# keepfaith escaped"
BFFIdeliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2,,"He glances at you. ""Captain $playerName procured datastores from the station, and the forge, before destroying both. I found communications involving the Subcurate Cedra Keepfaith in the Cathedral of Holy Exodus. I confronted her directly. She interfered with Knight-Captain Larix's weapon and I... was shot.""

Oak's eyes narrow, which is enough to prompt silence. Oak's clerk looks between him and Bornanew curiously, but she also holds her tongue.

""Keepfaith fled and has not been found,"" Bornanew continues. ""The Reverend Archcurate Bywater, of the Cathedral of Holy Exodus, saw fit to strip her of the station of Subcurate in absentia.""",bffi_deliverGloveCheck:Continue,
BFFIdeliverToOakKeepfaithCheckCbb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_deliverKeepfaithCheck
$global.bffi_keepfaithEscaped
!$global.bffi_returnBornanewBody
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2",,"The Excubitor Orbis had never stopped watching you. ""Your theory. Tartessus,"" he prompts $global.jethroName.

Bornanew steps forward. ""I tracked the source of the false relic to a nanoforge operated by Pather heretics. A godless hive of a station on the far fringe, in the $bffi_patherStationSystem.""",bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2bb:Continue,
BFFIdeliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2bb,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2bb,,"He doesn't look at you, but speaks directly. ""Captain $playerName seized datastores from the station, and the forge, before destroying both. I discovered communications involving a traitor, the Subcurate Cedra Keepfaith of the Cathedral of Holy Exodus. I confronted her directly with her crime. She interfered with Knight-Captain Larix's weapon and shot me.""

Oak's eyes narrow. Oak's clerk looks between him and Bornanew curiously, but she also holds her tongue.",bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped3bb:Continue,
BFFIdeliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped2bb2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverKeepfaithExplainEscaped3bb,,"""The traitor fled and the Knights posted to Tartessus have not found her,"" Bornanew continues, criticism obvious in his tone. ""The Reverend Archcurate Bywater, of the Cathedral of Holy Exodus, saw fit to strip Keepfaith of the station of Subcurate in absentia. Nonetheless, she has thus far escaped punishment. If you simply order the Inquisitors to-""

Gideon Oak raises a hand, almost a parody of the gesture frozen in the glove that started this all. Bornanew silences himself with obvious reluctance.",bffi_deliverGloveCheck:Continue,
