BFFIdeliverGloveCheck1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverGloveCheck1,,"Oak turns his head ever so slightly. ""Destroy it,"" he rumbles.

The clerk mutters into her cuff.",bffi_deliverGloveCheck2:Watch,
BFFIdeliverGloveCheck2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverGloveCheck2,"AddTextSmall ""False relic destroyed"" highlight","Oak is content to remain silent as technicians of the Knights wheel out a heavy crucible of sorts, festooned with tubes and patterned heat-dispersal tiles. They halt it several meters from you, then scurry over to retrieve the glove - still in its open sample case - and place the whole lot carefully into the blackened interior. They slowly lower and then seal the heavy top-cover then adjust some knobs and switches. The lead tech looks to the Excubitor Orbis.

He gives a tiny nod.

A dull roar sounds from the device, like a torrential waterfall behind a hardened airlock. Indentations in the tiled carapace begin to glow; you can feel the radiated heat on your exposed skin.",bffi_deliverProblemCheck:Continue,
,,,,,,
# BFFI problem check,,,,,,
BFFIproblemCheckNone,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_deliverProblemCheck,"$option = bffi_problemCheckOut 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","The clerk shuffles nervously, flipping open a notebook, pausing a moment, then flipping it closed. She looks at the Excubitor Orbis.

He nods at her, then looks back to you.",,
BFFIproblemCheckFundingLie,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_deliverProblemCheck
$player.BFFImadeBornanewBackChurchFundingLie","$thereWasAProblem = true 0
AdjustRepActivePerson -1","The clerk clears her throat.

""Excubitor Orbis,"" her eyes dart at you and Bornanew. ""$playerSirOrMadam. Novice.""

""There is a matter of the Demarch of Olinadu. A Menes Yaribay? He claims he was promised payments for the, um, purchase of a relic.""

You hadn't thought Oak could look any more displeased.",bffi_problemCheckFundingLie2:Continue,
BFFIproblemCheckFundingLie2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_problemCheckFundingLie2,"$option = bffi_problemCheckOut 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","The clerk coughs, ""We, ah,"" she flips a page on a paper notebook.

""While the Church does not recognize the purchase of,  um,"" her eyes flicker to the crucible, which has stopped glowing, but ticks away as it cools. ""The object in question. However, due to the promise made by a... representative,"" she looks quickly at Bornanew, then away. ""It was proposed that a... polite settlement with Mister Yaribay be made using the reward credits originally authorized by the Reverend Archcurate Jaspis...""

""Do it,"" says the Excubitor Orbis.

You can't quite see if Bornanew is blushing, because his head is bowed toward Oak.",,
