BFFIproblemCheckOut,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_problemCheckOut,,,"bffi_outro1a:""We've delivered the false relic and destroyed its source.""
bffi_outro1b:""I believe this fulfills Novice Bornanew's 'quest' of penance.""
bffi_outro1c:""$global.jethroName. We done here?""",
BFFIproblemCheckOutDead,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_problemCheckOut
$global.bffi_returnBornanewBody","$global.bffi_completed = true
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage","""I t-think that's everything,"" the clerk says, looking between you and Oak.

Excubitor Orbis Gideon Oak exhales, meeting your gaze. Then, without a word, he turns away and begins walking back to the far doorway casting its long wedge of light into the armored hangar.

After a respectful pause, the clerk and guards rush to follow.",bffi_outro3:Turn and leave,
,,,,,,
BFFIoutro1a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_outro1a,,"Oak ignores you.

""The novice still wears a crown of pride,"" Oak says toward Bornanew. ""Still he has much to repent.""

Bornanew turns slightly aside, keeping his eyes toward the Excubitor Orbis. ""I shall be staying here a while, I think,"" he says softly.",bffi_outro2:Continue,
BFFIoutro1aBB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_outro1a
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2",,"Oak ignores you.

""The novice still wears a crown of pride,"" Oak says toward Bornanew. ""Still he has much to repent.""

Bornanew's look hardens. He matches the remorseless gaze of the Excubitor Orbis with his own. ""If it be so by Providence,"" he says.",bffi_outro2:Continue,
BFFIoutro1b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_outro1b,,"""No,"" says Oak. ""The novice still wears a crown of pride. He has much to repent.""

Bornanew turns aside and says quietly to you, ""I shall be staying here a while, I think.""",bffi_outro2:Continue,
BFFIoutro1bBB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_outro1b
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2",,"""No,"" says Oak. ""The novice still wears a crown of pride. He has much to repent.""

Bornanew does not turn aside from Gideon Oak, matching his remorseless look with his own. ""The Excubitor Orbis believes there is much sin for which I must pay. I shall be staying here, as it pleases him.""

Oak, for his part, looks very much less than pleased at Bornanew's commentary. His clerk looks mortified.",bffi_outro2:Continue,
BFFIoutro1c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_outro1c,,"""Yes,"" says Bornanew, still caught in a staring-contest with Oak. ""You are. I shall be staying here a while, I think.""

The world's smallest smile makes a new crease on the Excubitor Orbis' face as he turns to you.

""Novice Bornanew owes you much. But still he wears a crown of pride. Still he must repent.""",bffi_outro2:Continue,
BFFIoutro2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == bffi_outro2,"Call $global.bffi_ref doCleanup
$global.bffi_completed = true
Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage
AddStoryPoints 1","""But I have a feeling that our paths shall cross again,"" $global.jethroName says, pulling his simple bundle of possessions onto his shoulder.

Bornanew follows his fellow Knights to the doorway casting its long wedge of light into the armored hangar.",bffi_outro3:Turn and leave,
BFFIoutro2BB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == bffi_outro2
$global.bornanewBadBoy > 2","Call $global.bffi_ref doCleanup
