Call $global.bffi_ref updateStage
AddStoryPoints 1","""Our paths shall cross again,"" $global.jethroName says, eyes in shadow. He pulls his simple bundle of possessions onto his shoulder. ""Hammer in one hand, sword in the other.""

Oak, ever displeased, turns his back without further comment and begins marching to the far end of the hangar. After a moment, the other Knights, and Bornanew, follow.

They shrink to silhouettes in the long wedge of light cast into the armored hangar, then disappear.",bffi_outro3:Turn and leave,
