ShowDefaultVisual
FireBest SalvageCheckHostile","Your $shipOrFleet approaches $entityName.

The sensors are having difficulty evaluating the tenuous megastructure enveloping its entire surface. Your sensors officer takes the initiative and applies some exotic parameters to the interferometer feed; inputs go green and a few seconds later the sub-AI tentatively identifies a stable planetary-scale energy field with highly unusual properties.",,
psi_defenderDesc,TriggerAutomatedDefenses,$psi_planet score:1000,SalvageDefenderInteraction,"As your $shipOrFleet moves in closer, sensors detect multiple contacts rising up from the murky red depths.",,
