$player.fcm_faction == persean",,,"gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptPLcom:""I bear a commission of the Persean League. I believe that falls under 'military'.""",
gaFCFikenhildBotherVIPoptC,gaFCfikenhildBotherVIPopts,,,,"gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptCsel:""I understand your position and won't trouble you further.""",
gaFCFikenhildBotherVIPoptD,gaFCfikenhildBotherVIPopts,,,,"gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptDsel:""You don't sound very delighted, $post.""",
gaFCFikenhildBotherVIPoptAsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptAsel1,,"$HeOrShe blinks, taken aback. ""$PlayerSirOrMadam."" 

You hear the tap of keys and a quick glance aside.

""My apologies. I was... your admittance to the League is quite recent. My congratulations.""

$HisOrHer voice doesn't quite have the warmth of enthusiasm $hisOrHer words would require to stand on their own.",gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptAsel2:Continue,
gaFCfikenhildBotherVIPoptAsel2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptAsel2,,"""As I'm sure you know, demarchon, there are certain procedures we have to follow. This is a League citizen on a League world? No outstanding warrant, no Fleet orders, no Council authorization?""

""If the King had given an order, I'd know about it. So."" $HeOrShe spreads $hisOrHer hands. ""I want to help you, but my office cannot do so unless we follow correct procedure. I'm sorry.""

The $post looks aside. ""Unless...""","gaFC_fikenhildBotherC3:""Unless?""",
gaFCFikenhildBotherVIPoptA3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaFC_fikenhildBotherC3,$market.askedVIPaboutCoureuse = true,"""Fleet Intelligence has more leeway in these matters. Post-Mairaath reforms and all that. I'm not saying it should be done lightly, but...""

$HeOrShe looks at you. ""Is it important?""","gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptA4:""Yes.""
gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptA4lie:""Yes."" (lie)
gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptA4no:""Not quite so important as that. Thank you.""",
gaFCFikenhildBotherVIPoptA4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptA4,"$option = gaFC_fikenhildBotherVIPoptA4yes 0
