$option = gaFC_fikenhildSiyavongCoureuseIsirah 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","Siyavong studies his TriPad. ""Fascinating,"" he says, then looks up, setting it aside.",,
GAFCSiyavongMeLeague,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaFC_fikenhildSiyavongLeague,,"Agent Siyavong blinks, frowning at your directness

""You are forthright, captain. I'm afraid, with apologies, that the report heirarchy doesn't quite work like that. You may, of course, submit an official request to the FIS through proper channels. Though I hear there's something of a backlog.""

His smirk is almost deniable. He lets you wait for just a moment before this would register as insolence, then continues.

""Nonetheless, as I'm sure you're aware, we in the League pride ourselves on a certain spirit of dynamism and cooperation which sets us apart from, say, the Hegemony.""","gaFC_fikenhildSiyavongLeague2a:""And that's what makes the League great. Do go on.""
gaFC_fikenhildSiyavongLeague2b:""That's the right attitude. So where's Coureuse?""",
