FireAll PopulateGateOptions","After the scan is completed you order your comms officer to transmit a copy of the data to the nearby Hegemony fleet using the operational frequency provided. 

With only one good data set, it's not like they'll have a major leg-up on Gate research compared to the Galatia Academy. Or Tri-Tachyon, for that matter.",,
