AddAbility gravitic_scan","Sebestyen jumps as if he just realized something.

""Captain! You might, ah, I've been authorized to provide you with a Neutrino Detector for the mission. Um, a technical crew is transferring the necessary equipment to your flagship, and,"" he taps his datapad, ""I've sent your sensors officer the documentation.""

""We've found the Neutrino Detector very helpful for pinpointing interesting, um, all sorts of things while surveying distant systems. Power sources show up especially well, though sometimes you get a false signal. Oh, and one more thing! We haven't figured out a way to quite close the regenerative loop on the plasma reflector uh... and just be sure to stock extra volatiles in your cargo bay to keep the detector running.""",aseb_accept:Continue,
