AddCommodity credits $entity.pwi_credits
MakeOtherFleetNonHostile true
MakeOtherFleetAvoidContact true","Your stare bores into the pirate like twin tachyon lances, and you say ""No. It belongs to Warlord Kanta.""

The blood drains from the pirate captain's face. ""She... but... stars and blood. Captain, please accept my apologies. I would never impede our, our patron and better and- please, accept a token of $entity.pwi_credits credits for the delay.""

$HeOrShe is almost pleading now, ""And, and perhaps there's no need to mention this little incident, yes?""","pwi_bluff1:""We'll see.""",
pwiBluff1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pwi_bluff1,,"The pirate nods grimly, staring into the middle distance as if contemplating some horror that will be performed upon $himOrHer for crossing the will of Kanta. You take this cue to terminate the comms and roll your eyes at the whole obsequious performance.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
