MakeOtherFleetGoAway true
FireBest $entity.pwi_missionFailTrigger","The Pirate captain looks more than a little surprised that you accepted $hisOrHer terms. $HeOrShe confirms that you have ejected the technology package via a battered datapad, and looks a bit- let down, perhaps. But also a little relieved.

""Well. So you're just giving it to me? I guess- good, uh... "" $HeOrShe seems unsure of what to say at this point, and just goes with the first thing that comes to mind. ""So let that be a lesson to ya. Don't no one can mess with the fearsome pirate $personName!"" 

The comms snap off. You roll your eyes and consider your next move.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
