You lead a classic Luddic prayer without missing a word, then dismiss the Pather captain from the comms-line. After you close the channel, you stop a moment to find your bridge crew looking at you with a combination of awe and confusion.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
pwi2_accept,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pwi2_accept,,"The Pather captain looks more than a little surprised that you accepted $hisOrHer terms. $HeOrShe confirms that you have ejected the technology package via a battered datapad, and looks a bit- let down, perhaps. But also relieved.

""Now,"" $heOrShe intones, ""together we pray.""

The Pather captain leads you through a classic Luddic prayer, begging forgiveness and doing least-harm to holy Creation. You make a show of mumbling along because it seems to make the Pather happy. $HeOrShe seems content with your effort.",pwi2_accept1:Continue,
