ttwiOpenComm,OpenCommLink,$entity.ttwi_wantsItem score:1000,Highlight $entity.ttwi_credits,"The comms-link plays a catchy Tri-Tachyon jingle before the logo fades to show the finely-dressed Tri-Tachyon captain before you.

""Greetings, star-farer. Might I interest you in a little business proposal?"" $HeOrShe holds up a hand covered in tastefully minimalist yet glittering rings, ""Now I know you are carrying a very particular technological device in your cargo hold. Who's to say if it went missing before you even got here?"" 

$HeOrShe smiles, perfectly.  

""Let me offer you $entity.ttwi_credits credits to transfer it to my ship, and we'll all go home enriched.""","ttwi_accept:Accept the deal
ttwi_decline:Decline the deal",
