soe_danceEscape1:""No. I'm going to leave now.""",
soeDanceStarting2cYes,DialogOptionSelected,$option == soe_danceStarting2cYes,$player.nerieneStartedDance = true 0,"""Then I'll show you,"" she says, taking your hand. You find yourself pulled toward the center of the dance floor with the inevitability of a singularity's gravity well. ",soe_danceRound1:Continue,
