# commodity procurement,,,,,,
proComBlurb,proCom_blurb,,,"""I need to procure a quantity of $proCom_commodityName.""
OR
""I require delivery of a cargo of $proCom_commodityName.""
OR
""I need a shipment of $proCom_commodityName.""",,
proComBlurbAristo,proCom_blurb,$voice == aristo,,"""The family decided that I must 'demonstrate initiative' by procuring a cargo of $proCom_commodityName. Perhaps I could pay you to solve this little conundrum.""",,
proComOfferOption,proCom_option,,,,proCom_start:Ask about the $proCom_commodityName procurement,
