DoCanAffordCheck $hmdf_price contact_acceptBar false","The spacer taps a few buttons on a greasy TriPad so you can see the freighter's schematics. 

""Got a few light-years on 'er, for sure. But it'll burn bright and true,"" $heOrShe says wistfully.","contact_acceptBar:Buy the freighter for $hmdf_price credits
contact_declineBarNoContinue:Decline",
