""I was thinking to augment the engines and install black market safety overrides to compel some utterly thrilling burn speeds. Don't tell father my plan, he'd be simply wroth.""","contact_accept:Buy the freighter for $hmdf_price credits
contact_decline:Decline",
hmdfLookAtFreighter,DialogOptionSelected,$option == hmdf_look,"Call $hmdf_ref showShip
