""My tacticians' analysis suggests that $dcom_marines marines would be sufficient."" $HeOrShe pauses a moment, then adds ""And I would suggest going in quietly; this is $dcom_marketFactionArticle $dcom_marketFaction logistics zone and my intent is to send a message, not a broadcast.""","contact_accept:Accept
contact_decline:Decline",
