DoCanAffordCheck 0 cpc_pickPlayerBP false","""The slots are valid for up to $cpc_maxCapacity credits worth of industrial production capacity, and I'll let you use them for a very reasonable $cpc_costPercent of base cost. You would have to provide your own blueprints, of course.""

$HeOrShe gives you a million-credit smile and says, ""It's a good opportunity, captain.""","cpc_pickPlayerBP:Make a selection from your own blueprints
