# custom underworld bounty,,,,,,
ucbBlurb,ucb_blurb,,,"""I've got a list of targets that need killing,"" $personName says nonchalantly. ""You could earn yourself some good credits with one of these jobs.""",,
ucbOfferOption,ucb_option,,,,ucb_start:Ask about taking on one of the bounty jobs,
ucbBlurbBar,ucb_blurbBar,,,"A $ucb_manOrWoman occupies a booth on the back wall, a pair of goons hidden in shadow but for the glow of their augmented eyes. You watch an obvious merc-slash-pirate approach for an exchange of words and tap of datapads. Farming out underworld hits?",,
ucbOfferOptionBar,ucb_optionBar,,,,ucb_startBar:Approach the $ucb_manOrWoman contracting out underworld bounties,
