unset $entity.locr_pirate
EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
FireAll PopulateOptions","The pirate leader is justifiably defeated-looking, ashamed at being taken so easily despite the circumstances.

The pirates are removed to the $shipOrFleet brigs, packed closer than even the minimal comforts of the lowest crewmember's berth.",,
LOCRPraidCancel,LOCRPraidCancel,,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
FireAll PopulateOptions
#ShowPersonVisual
#FireAll LOCRPhubOptions","You call for a halt to the raid and consider your options.

