FireAll PopulateOptions","A small community of heretical Luddics was rescued from a remote village on the surface of $name.

Rescuers describe the Luddics as repentant and half-starved, their agricultural efforts having failed due to poor preparation. They now seem intent upon rejoining the Church of Galactic Redemption. Given basic necessities by your administration, they have been released to haunt the landing facilities, seeking work as crew or charity transport back to the core worlds.

Colonial MuniSec will monitor the group for radical Pather activity.",,
