$player.crew > 198
!$player.locrlf_liedAboutFateOfHeretics",,"Now, of course, there's the matter of the heretics.","locrlf_returnHereticsChurch:""Also, the heretics are on board my $shipOrFleet. I intend to return them to the Church.""",
