AddCommodity marines $motr_numberOfMarines
MiscCMD addMarineXP $motr_numberOfMarines
Call $motr_ref repSuccess
#Call $motr_ref addContacts",,,
MOTRdeclineDrink,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_declineDrink,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
BarCMD leaveBar","You wake up the next day in a small room above the bar with no particular memory of how you got there. How many more rounds was it with the mercs, one? Three?",,
MOTRstartPlayerColony,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == motr_textBar1
$faction.id == player","$missionId = motr
Highlight motr_numberOfMarines $motr_priceText
FireAll MOTRplayerColonyOpts","You prove yourself worthy of association by partaking in a round of 'Atmo Drops', a drink centered around consuming eye-watering liquor as quickly as possible.

The mercs are drunk, for sure, but maintain their composure enough to speak around the details of why they're being investigated by local authorities - your local authorities.

After a couple of the mercs head up to order a round of 'Orbital Bombardments' their leader pulls you aside and sketches out a proposal. ""We've got $motr_numberOfMarines suits, experienced operators. Be a shame if we couldn't see action, instead got locked up.""

""I'll offer our contract for $motr_priceText credits. Practically charity, isn't it? Put us to work, or sell it off elsewhere, doesn't matter to me. After all,"" $heOrShe winks, ""You're the boss around here, yeah? You can get us out of this fix.""","



",
MOTRplayerColonyOptA,MOTRplayerColonyOpts,,DoCanAffordCheck $motr_price motr_playerColonyAccept false,,"motr_playerColonyAccept:Buy the contract. You're the boss, after all.",
MOTRplayerColonyOptB,MOTRplayerColonyOpts,,,,"motr_playerColonyAskWhy:""I have a duty here. I'm going to need to know why you're in trouble.""",
MOTRplayerColonyOptC,MOTRplayerColonyOpts,,,,motr_playerColonyNarc:Call security to have the mercs locked up.,
MOTRplayerColonyOptD,MOTRplayerColonyOpts,,,,"motr_playerColonyDrink:Decline the proposal, but stay for an 'Orbital Bombardment' to soften the blow""",
MOTRplayerColonyAskWhy,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyAskWhy,RemoveOption motr_playerColonyAskWhy,"$HeOrShe gives a wary smile.

""I can't do that, boss. I look after my squad, one and all, and they look after me. S'how it works.""

$HisOrHer hand picks up an empty glass, as if to drink, pauses, then sets it back down.

""If you feel like you have to call MuniSec, then call MuniSec. Won't hold it against you.""",,
MOTRplayerColonyNarc,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyNarc,FireAll MOTRethosOrder,"You give the order through your personal comms unit. A security squad will be there soon. 

The merc leader sighs, looking remarkably accepting of $hisOrHer fate.

""Let us have this one last round?""","motr_playerColonyNarcAllow:Allow it
motr_playerColonyNarcNo:Don't allow it",
MOTRplayerColonyNarcAllow,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyNarcAllow,"FireAll MOTRethosGenerous
$market.arrestedMercs = true 30","The band of rogue marines perform their last 'orbital drop' and are still cheering as security officers file into the bar.

There are alarmed looks, and hands reach toward hidden weapons, but they are stayed with a small motion from the merc leader.

""End of the line, my hardies. Go easy. We had a good run, and maybe we'll get out there once more.""",motr_playerColonyLeave:Leave,
MOTRplayerColonyNarcNo,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyNarcNo,"Call $motr_ref repFailure
$market.arrestedMercs = true 30","Security officers file into the bar. There are alarmed looks exchanged between the mercs, and scarred hands reach toward hidden weapons. 

They are stayed with a small motion from the merc leader, who gives you one last sad look.

""End of the line, my hardies. Go easy; we had a good run.""",motr_playerColonyLeave:Leave,
MOTRplayerColonyDrink,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyDrink,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
BarCMD leaveBar","You wake up the next day in the break room of the local security post, the lights dimmed for your benefit. You have no particular memory of how you got there. How many more rounds was it with the mercs, one? Three?

A senior munisec officer stands at stiff attention as you stumble out the door mumbling into your comms to arrange pickup.",,
MOTRplayerColonyLeave,DialogOptionSelected,$option == motr_playerColonyLeave,"EndConversation DO_NOT_FIRE
