OR
A converted surface-to-orbit passenger transport pulls alongside your $shipOrFleet's orbit after you give the planned signal. The cargo of $smug_commodityName is quickly transferred by robot drones running without nav transponders, then the transport pulls away.",marketCmd_checkDebtContinue:Continue,
