SetStoryOption fwt_bluffPirate general ""Bluffed pirate to keep $entity.fwt_thing""
$fwt_piratePayment = 10,000 0","The display flickers with holo-snow before resolving into a swaggering pirate captain.

""Ah look at you there, what a fine $shipOrFleet. A little birdie told me you have $fwt_thingDesc and come next shift I'm going to be the one a-holding $fwt_itOrThem. Do you see my meaning, captain? It'd be a crying shame if anything happened to your fine $shipOrFleet.""

$HeOrShe pretends to be pondering deeply, ""Now, 'way I see this going, are you gonna make the smart choice and hand $fwt_itOrThem over all peaceful-like, or are you gonna be sucking vacuum after I blow your $shipOrFleet out of orbit? Think, now, think.""","cutCommLink:Decline, close comms, and power up weapons
fwt_bluffPirate:Bluff to get rid of the pirate
