FireAll PopulateOptions","You speak first with some kind of secretary who politely persuades you to wait patiently.

After a short time, the image of the Archcurate Jaspis appears. She makes little effort to look toward comms feed as she putters around her office.

""We are blessed by the day,"" she says.",0:cutCommLinkPolite:Cut the comm link,
,,,,,,
