$global.metOrcusRao = true","After a short wait spent watching propaganda blurbs scroll past the crest of the Hegemony navy, the comm-link connects you with the office of Admiral Rao.

""So,"" the hero of the Siege of Raesvelg looks you over. ""What's a freelancer doing at this backwater outpost?""",,
