# pulled a fast one in his name,,,,,,
raoGreetingFastOne,PickGreeting,"$id == rao score:1000
$player.gaKAbluffedViaOrcusRao
!$didFastOneGreeting
!$ignorePlayerCommRequests","ShowPersonVisual
$global.metOrcusRao = true","The link opens with a surprisingly brief wait for an officer of Rao's rank. He appears with the hint of an amused smile.

""$PlayerName! I see you've carried out my orders to the letter. Great work,"" he says, seemingly earnest.

""Perhaps I should award you a medal for your service?""","rao_fastOneA:""What in the worlds are you talking about?""
rao_fastOneB:""Yes, I think a medal would be in order.""",
raoFastOneA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneA,,"His eyes glitter frostily.

""I'm talking about a liar."" His finger flicks to point at you.

""The one with the gall to open a comm link to my face after I received a most fascinating report from one of our fleet commanders about an encounter during an emergency intercept near Tse Franchise Station.""","rao_fastOneCa:""Oh, I remember now.""
rao_fastOneCb:""That must have been a different $playerName.""",
raoFastOneB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneB,,"""No."" His amused tone has grown a touch of frost.

He looks aside as he speaks. ""I think not. They don't give medals for lying in the Hegemony...""

Then he holds a finger to his lips, thoughtfully. ""No, that's not true. Not at all. They don't give medals for lying TO the Hegemony.""

He smiles again, turning back to you.","rao_fastOneB2a:""When did I ever lie to the Hegemony?"" (feign innocence)
rao_fastOneB2b:""Is this about that fleet looking for Gargoyle after I left Tse Franchise Station?""",
raoFastOneB2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneB2a,,"He breaks out in a hearty laugh, taking a moment before he rubs his eyes. 

""Yes, yes, very good."" Rao lets his hands fall deliberately to his console.

""You lied when you encountered the absolute oaf in command of the fleet ordered to intercept you, transporting a hacker wanted by the Hegemony, away from Tse Franchise Station.""","rao_fastOneCa:""Oh, I remember now.""
rao_fastOneCb:""That must have been a different $playerName.""",
raoFastOneB2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneB2b,,"""It is, yes,"" he says. ""And the absolute oaf in command who believed your ruse.""","rao_fastOneCd:Withhold comment
rao_fastOneCe:""Well. Sorry.""
rao_fastOneCc:""Don't blame them too much, I can be pretty convincing when I want to be.""",
raoFastOneCd,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCd,,"He waves the thought away, then takes in a deep breath, quiet now, and drums his fingers on his console. Staring at you. Assessing.

""Let us speak plainly,"" he says.",rao_fastOneSpeak:Continue,
raoFastOneCe,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCe,,"""Don't apologize for winning,"" he says. ""It's unbecoming.""

Rao takes in a deep breath, quiet now, and drums his fingers on his console. Staring at you. Assessing.

""Let us speak plainly,"" he says.",rao_fastOneSpeak:Continue,
raoFastOneCc,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCc,$player.ethosCocky++,"He snorts at that.

Rao takes a quiet moment then drums his fingers on his console. Staring at you. Assessing.

""Let us speak plainly,"" he says.",rao_fastOneSpeak:Continue,
raoFastOneCa,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCa,,"""I'm glad to hear it, captain,"" he says. ""Now we may speak plainly.""

""From captain to... what have they made me, an $rank? My, it makes you wonder who's in charge, doesn't it.""","rao_fastOneSpeak:Let him get to his point, whatever it is
rao_fastOneCa2:""That'd be the High Hegemon, Baikal Daud.""",
raoFastOneCa2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCa2,,"""One should think,"" he says pointedly. ""But never mind- what I mean to say is that you played the ruse well.""

""Better than a puffed-up uniform of the sort Eventide seems to spawn each cycle would. You remind me a bit of myself when I was younger and didn't have to sit at a desk.""",rao_fastOneSpeak:Continue,
raoFastOneCb,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneCb,,"Rao laughs, though there's more of an edge...

You take a moment to try to form a judgement - if he really thinks this is funny, he can't be too angry, right? Or is he one of those officers that keeps others off guard with calculated shifts in mood? From what you know - mostly holodocs - Rao has a cunning streak and a bit of a mixed reputation among the more respectable segments of the Hegemony.

Rao takes in a deep breath, quiet now, and drums his fingers on his console. Staring at you. Assessing.

""Let us speak plainly,"" he says.",rao_fastOneSpeak:Continue,
raoFastOneSpeak,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_fastOneSpeak,"$gotAnOpening = true
$didFastOneGreeting = true","""You played it well,"" he says.

""Outsmarted a puffed-up uniform of the sort Eventide seems to spawn more of each cycle. You remind me a bit of myself when I was younger and didn't have to sit at a desk.""

He pauses a moment, studying you. ""I had the thought...""","rao_pitchTest:""Yes?""",
,,,,,,
# talk about Neriene ,,"$player.metNeriene
$global.raoTalkAboutNeriene",,,,
raoMetNeriene,PopulateOptions,"$id == rao score:1000
$player.metNeriene
!$player.talkedToOrcusAboutNeriene",,,"rao_metNeriene2:""I met your... niece. Grandniece? Neriene Rao. On Eventide.""",
raoMetNeriene2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_metNeriene2,"$option = rao_metNeriene3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""She's a promising young woman."" His voice fills with pride. ""She's got the talent, I think."" ",,
raoMetNeriene3Lost,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == rao_metNeriene3
$player.soe_lostDuel",FireAll raoNerieneOpts,"He pauses. 

""I trust you weren't hurt too badly? The night of the ball.""",,
raoMetNeriene3Won,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == rao_metNeriene3
$player.soe_wonDuel",FireAll raoNerieneOpts,"""You made some enemies that night with your display during the ball, I think.""",,
raoMetNeriene3Left,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_metNeriene3,FireAll raoNerieneOpts,"""You avoided a bit of trouble that night of the ball, I think. Mostly.""",,
raoNerieneOptsWonBlade,raoNerieneOpts,"$player.soe_wonDuel
$player.bladeSkill",,,"rao_nerieneSelWonD:""And easily. Those brutes did not realize that I had studied the blade.""",
raoNerieneOptsLostBlade,raoNerieneOpts,"$player.soe_lostDuel
$player.bladeSkill",,,"rao_nerieneSelLostBlade:""It was a shame to lose... for I have studied the blade.""",
raoNerieneOptsLostB,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_lostDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelLostB:""No. I've had worse.""",
raoNerieneOptsLostA,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_lostDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelLostA:""No. I've had worse."" (lie)",
raoNerieneOptsLostC,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_lostDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelLostC:""Just my pride, perhaps. But don't worry, it's more than recovered.""",
raoNerieneOptsLostD,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_lostDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelLostD:""What matters is I stood to their insults and fought. My honor is intact.""",
raoNerieneOptsWonA,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_wonDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelWonA:""They chose to make me their enemy long before that night.""",
raoNerieneOptsWonB,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_wonDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelWonB:""I simply defended my honor against some thugs.""",
raoNerieneOptsWonC,raoNerieneOpts,$player.soe_wonDuel,,,"rao_nerieneSelWonC:""Someone had to put those aristocratic bullies in their place.""",
raoNerieneOptsLeftA,raoNerieneOpts,"!$player.soe_wonDuel
!$player.soe_lostDuel",,,"rao_nerieneSelLeftA:""I did not go to House Rao to start a brawl, sir.""",
raoNerieneOptsLeftB,raoNerieneOpts,"!$player.soe_wonDuel
!$player.soe_lostDuel",,,"rao_nerieneSelLeftB:""Did I? It was a cowardly exit.""",
raoNerieneOptsLeftC,raoNerieneOpts,"!$player.soe_wonDuel
!$player.soe_lostDuel",,,"rao_nerieneSelLeftC:""It was looked upon poorly, but I had to think of Neriene.""",
raoNerieneOptsLeftD,raoNerieneOpts,"!$player.soe_wonDuel
!$player.soe_lostDuel",,,"rao_nerieneSelLeftD:""It's a stupid tradition anyway. Who fights with oversized knives in this age?""",
raoNerieneSelLostA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLostA,$player.ethosLiar++,"He raises an eyebrow.

""Well. It's a mark on the Rao name that it came to that. Augusta let things get out of hand.""

Orcus Rao sighs, and looking distant, says ""I cannot apologize for her, as she's never sought my council in the matter of 'her' house.""",rao_nerieneSelWonA2:Continue,
raoNerieneSelLostB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLostB,,"""I do believe Augusta let things get out of hand, but she never sought my council in the matters of 'her' house. So I can't very well apologize for her- it's a mark on the Rao name.""",rao_nerieneSelWonA2:Continue,
raoNerieneSelLostC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLostC,$player.ethosCocky++,"A smile appears. ""I am glad to hear it.""

The smile fades. ""But it is a mark on the Rao name that it came to that. Augusta let things get out of hand.""

Orcus Rao sighs, and looking distant, says ""I cannot apologize for her, as she's never sought my council in the matter of 'her' house.""",rao_nerieneSelWonA2:Continue,
raoNerieneSelLostD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLostD,$player.ethosHonorable++,"""That you did,"" he says approvingly. ""Some would say you were foolish, but it was an act of bravery to face a blooding as you did.""

He looks aside, troubled. ""Still, it is a mark on the Rao name that it came to that. Augusta let things get out of hand. I cannot apologize for her, as she's never sought my council in the matter of 'her' house...""",rao_nerieneSelWonA2:Continue,
raoNerieneSelWonA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonA,,"""Mm. I suppose the fact that it wasn't truly a personal matter is little consolation for the provocation which Augusta allowed in 'our' family home.""

Orcus Rao sighs, and looks distant for a moment. ""But I won't apologize for her. She's never sought my council in the matters of 'her' house...""",rao_nerieneSelWonA2:Continue,
raoNerieneSelWonA2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonA2,"$option = rao_nerieneSelLeftA2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Regardless,"" he claps his hands together. ""The seasonal ball is a lovely time to visit Eventide, and I recall such occasions at House Rao fondly. Setting aside the unpleasantness, I'm sure there was some proper revelry.""",,
raoNerieneSelWonB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonB,"$player.ethosHonorable++
$option = rao_nerieneSelWonC 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
raoNerieneSelWonC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC,,"""And impressively so, I hear. Not from Neriene, of course."" He smirks. Though there's a touch of... sadness? He speaks before you're certain.

""Though mind, captain, those were no mere 'thugs'. The Cardonas hold a grudge, and one of their own sits on the Strategic Assembly.""","rao_nerieneSelWonC2a:""The Strategic Assembly of the Hegemony? That could be inconvenient.""
rao_nerieneSelWonC2b:""I'm not worried about the Strategic Assembly.""",
raoNerieneSelWonC2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC2a,,"""It could,"" Rao concedes. ""Though they're a faction known to have little favor from Baikal."" His eyes dart to you, ""The High Hegemon of course. Nonetheless, he must make concessions from time to time...""

He pauses, thoughtful. ""Say what you will of Baikal. He won't do it lightly, but he knows when to sacrifice a pawn.""","rao_nerieneSelWonC2a2a:""I'll keep that in mind.""
rao_nerieneSelWonC2a2b:""What's a 'pawn'?""",
raoNerieneSelWonC2a2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC2a2a,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonC3b 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He waits a moment, his look grim. As if he might say more. But he holds back, quite deliberately.",,
raoNerieneSelWonC2a2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC2a2b,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonC3b 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Someone easily spent when the cost is dear,"" he says. ""They are not generally aware of their status.""

He waits out the moment, his look grim. As if he might say more. But he holds back, quite deliberately.",,
raoNerieneSelWonC2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC2b,$player.ethosCocky++,"Rao seems to examine you. ""I have always found that putting an enemy out of mind is like walking into an ambush of your own making.""

He shrugs, ""But perhaps you'll be lucky."" He gets a sly look. ""I was.""","rao_nerieneSelWonC3a:""I'll watch my back.""
rao_nerieneSelWonC3b:""I'll be sure to decline the next invitation to House Rao's seasonal ball.""
rao_nerieneSelWonC3c:""'Perhaps'? I'm counting on it!""",
raoNerieneSelWonC3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC3a,"$option = rao_nerieneSelLeftA2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He nods. ""To be true, it was Augusta who should never have allowed that to happen. The seasonal ball is a lovely time to visit Eventide, and I recall such occasions at House Rao fondly. Setting aside the unpleasantness, I'm sure there was some proper revelry.""",,
raoNerieneSelWonC3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC3b,"$option = rao_nerieneSelLeftA2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He laughs. ""Even with Augusta doing her best to spoil it, I recall such times at House Rao fondly. Setting aside the unpleasantness, I'm sure there was some proper revelry.""",,
raoNerieneSelWonC3c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonC3c,"$player.talkedToOrcusAboutNeriene = true
FireAll PopulateOptions","Orcus Rao shakes his head. ""It's clear you're of your own mind. So let us speak of other matters.""",,
raoNerieneSelLostBlade,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLostBlade,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonD 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
raoNerieneSelWonD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonD,,"""You have? Neriene made no mention."" He leans forward. ""How interesting. It is something of a lost art outside of the more traditional families of Eventide.""

""Tell me, do you prefer the Hadi-style hilt or the Andreas?","rao_nerieneSelWonDa:""Hadi, naturally. I'm a little old-school that way.""
rao_nerieneSelWonDb:""Andreas, of course. The flexibility is paramount.""
rao_nerieneSelWonDc:""The Jung-Sook, actually. I believe it's been unfairly discounted.""",
raoNerieneSelWonDa,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonDa,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonD2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""The Hadi is a fine choice, and my own in fact,"" he says, pleased. ""Now let me tell you...""",,
raoNerieneSelWonDb,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonDb,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonD2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He gives a laugh. ""I daresay, $playerSirOrMadam, I am not the least bit surprised to hear you say that. Let me tell you...""",,
raoNerieneSelWonDc,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonDc,"$option = rao_nerieneSelWonD2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""How unusual!"" He looks perplexed, and intrigued.

""I've only ever met one, maybe two, who shared your preference, but let me tell you..."" ",,
raoNerieneSelWonD2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonD2,"AdjustRepPerson rao FRIENDLY 10
$player.talkedSwordsWithOrcus = true","* * *

You proceed to have a lengthy discussion on the finer points of hardware and technique with Orcus Rao.

He is more than an enthusiast, showing great depths of knowledge and obvious practical experience on the subject. Your own perspective is a worthy match for his, and you find that you have more to agree than disagree about. 

It is satisfying to meet a mind as sharp as Rao's on a favored subject. The feeling is mutual, you can tell. ",rao_nerieneSelWonD3:Continue,
raoNerieneSelWonD3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonD3,,"After some time, your talk lulls. Admiral Rao speaks, idly, ""How ever did we get here?""","rao_nerieneSelWonD4:""The duel.""",
raoNerieneSelWonD4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelWonD4,"$option = rao_nerieneConvOut4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Of course,"" he says with a sigh.",,
