FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He half-shrugs, his expression charitable despite the fact that he appears to agree with your words.

""I heard that certain young men were keen to provoke you to a confrontation. It is a mark upon the House of Rao that it was allowed to go as far as it did.""",rao_nerieneConvOut4:Continue,
raoNerieneSelLeftC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLeftC,,"""Oh, I assure you it was a wasted gesture. Neriene Rao can handle herself- with the blade, or without."" He looks away, smiling. It quickly fades.",rao_nerieneConvOut4:Continue,
raoNerieneSelLeftD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_nerieneSelLeftD,,"""We do."" Wrinkles form at his eyes as Orcus Rao doesn't quite smile.

""Such traditions are necessarily arbitrary. The question falls to whether one chooses to excel within its terms... or without. The swordplay of Eventide is no different.""",rao_nerieneConvOut4:Continue,
