$askedAboutDiktatMerc = true","""Is that so,"" he says, nonchalant. ""I wonder why they would have said that.""","rao_askDiktatMerc3:""I think they were working for you. And under orders not to say so.""","# btw to get this the player has, or had, a Heg commission"
raoAskDiktatMerc3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_askDiktatMerc3,"SetTooltip rao_askDiktatMerc4c ""It's all about the money.""","He raises an eyebrow, his affect still casual.

""If I had hired this mercenary, I imagine I'd be pretty upset at how easily they gave up the identity of their employer. It's a good thing the Hegemony has an official policy forbidding the employ of mercs.""","rao_askDiktatMerc4a:""What? The Hegemony regularly employs mercenaries.""
rao_askDiktatMerc4b:""If it's a fight against the Diktat, I want to be a part of it.""
rao_askDiktatMerc4c:""Looks like someone is losing their bonus. Anyway, I want in.""
rao_askDiktatMerc4d:""Clearly you don't take this very seriously.""",
raoAskDiktatMerc4a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_askDiktatMerc4a,RemoveOption rao_askDiktatMerc4a,"""Really?"" Admiral Rao, leaning forward, puts on a look of concern.

He speaks officiously. ""As a patriotic citizen, I'm sure you'll have reported all such lapses of policy so that official action may be taken.""

The pose holds for a moment, then half a smile cracks through.",,
raoAskDiktatMerc4d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_askDiktatMerc4d,,"He shrugs, holding his ironic half-smile in place. Behind it his eyes are cold, very cold.","rao_askDiktatMerc4b:""If it's a fight against the Diktat, I want to be a part of it.""
rao_askDiktatMerc4c:""Looks like someone is losing their bonus. Anyway, I want in.""
rao_askDiktatMerc4out:""Right. I don't have time for this.""",
