$gotAnOpening = true","""Is your loyalty so contingent? I suppose that is true for many, perhaps most- and almost all are loathe to admit it. How brave, then, to admit it."" His tone is rhetorical, and rather more sardonic than earnest.

Rao looks to you again. ""Nonetheless, I agree with your assessment of the enemy.""",rao_pitchTest:Continue,
