#raoAskDiktatHyder,,,,,"rao_askDiktatHyder2:""Oxana Hyder. Think she'd come back?""",#Oxana Hyder TODO  ... later. Need to be able to do payoff.
#raoAskDiktatHyder2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_askDiktatHyder2,,"""Maybe,"" Rao grunts. His look is uncharitable. ""What you must ask is, does the Hegemony want her back? Yes- in an isolation cell. To begin with.""

""We don't look well upon mutiny in the Hegemony, captain. Especially not mutinies that last for over 20 cycles.""",,
