$player.fcm_faction == persean score:2","$pitchNope = true 0
FireAll PopulateOptions","""As you bear the commission of the Persean League..."" He makes a half-shrug. ""I can't have you in a position of divided loyalty.""

""Let us speak again on the matter if your situation changes.""

His tone makes it clear that the issue is settled. For now.",,
