RaoPitchLeagueHannanBprot,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchHannanBprot,,"Rao holds a finger to his cheek for a moment, thinking.

""It could be earned,"" he says. ""But that's up to you.""",rao_pitchNopeFirm:Continue,
RaoPitchLeagueHannanC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchHannanC,,"""What admirable loyalty! How Reynard earns it, I've never understood. I must study his leadership closely, for I obviously have much to learn."" The sarcasm runs thick.

Rao sits back, face falling into shadow.",rao_pitchNopeFirm:Continue,
