RaoPitchOptRespect,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptRespect,"$saidRespect = true 0
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","""The truth makes few friends."" Rao produces a wry smile.

""I never could stand a fool, especially when they're members of the Strategic Assembly. So,"" he holds his hand out to indicate his surroundings, Ragnar Complex.

""It's not so bad.""",,
RaoPitchOptWhatNeed,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptWhatNeed,,"""A proper officer of the Hegemony is taught to leap toward the enemy, blazing guns. Once the noise quiets down, they'll wait, slack-jawed, for the medals to get pinned to their uniforms."" 

""Such is the way of the Domain, which we must uphold.""

He half-raises a finger, a quirk on his lips. ""Officially,"" he concludes.",rao_pitchOptWhatNeed2:Continue,
RaoPitchOptWhatNeed2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptWhatNeed2,"$saidWhatNeed = true
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","""Baikal was kind enough to find me a place where I could get important work done. I deal with... let us call them 'unique circumstances'. And for this I find it necessary to have energetic freelancers available.""

""I'll ensure you're paid promptly for a roster of small merc jobs.""

""Then, perhaps something big will come up. When it does, I want to know I can count on you.""",,
RaoPitchOptTakeCircumstances,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptCircumstances,"$saidCircumstances = true
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","""I'm offering you the chance to be the grit that throws history off its axis.""

He lets a sly smile fade. ""There are many bodies of power turning just now. Slowly grinding away, warships and bombings and riots and resources.""

""The Persean Sector needs change, or it will grind what's left of us to dust.""",,
RaoPitchOptTakeDiktat,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptTakeDiktat,"$saidTakeDiktat = true
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","A cold, quick expression passes over his face.

""Let us say that I'd be as satisfied as any Hegemony officer to cut down that pompous traitor. Setting aside even the matter of honor, I have a personal dislike of the man.""",,
RaoPitchOptPersonal,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptPersonal,"$saidPersonal = true
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","Rao lets out a slow breath. ""That's talk for old comrades, over drink.""

He leans back, not quite committing to a frown.

""Patience, captain.""",,
RaoPitchOptCourtMartial,DialogOptionSelected,$option == rao_pitchOptCourtMartial,"$saidCourtMartial = true
FireAll RaoPitchHubOpts","""There's rules to break when you need to win, and there's betrayal. These are very different things, fundamentally so, captain. He and I have done the former, but he threw away his honor with the latter.""

""We are not. the. same."" Rao's words come out slow, and cold. 
",,
