FireAll DardanKatoAskImoinuOpts","Dardan lets out a sigh.

""I already know about her little crusade. I'd thank you not to mention her- unless she's finally decided to do the right thing and return to the Gens?""

He barely waits before he says ""Didn't think so.""",,
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptsA,DardanKatoAskImoinuOpts,,,,"dardanKato_askImoinuOptA:""My impression was that she wishes to stay where she is.""",
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptsB,DardanKatoAskImoinuOpts,,,,"dardanKato_askImoinuOptB:""I gave her material support for the ARC. She seems capable of looking after herself.""",
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptsC,DardanKatoAskImoinuOpts,,,,"dardanKato_askImoinuOptC:""Let's talk about something else.""",
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == dardanKato_askImoinuOptA,RemoveOption dardanKato_askImoinuOptA,"""Like I said,"" he says, his tone of voice making it clear he is quite finished with this conversation.",,
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == dardanKato_askImoinuOptB,FireAll PopulateOptions,"He gives you a wretched look. ""Tell me you didn't.""

""No,"" he holds up a hand. ""Don't tell me at all. I don't want to know. Drop it. We're not talking about this.""",,
DardanKatoAskImoinuOptC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == dardanKato_askImoinuOptC,FireAll PopulateOptions,"""By the bloody stars, please and thank-you,"" he mutters under his breath,",,
