RemoveOption RHannan_msgDoYouEven","""Captain."" Reynard gives you a pitying look.

His message is clear: You should know better than to ask. And in asking, you've wasted both his time and your own.

But more importantly, his.",,
RHannanMsgFollowJoinLeague,DialogOptionSelected,$option == RHannan_msgFollowJoinLeague,"$followedUpOnAnyMessage = true
$option = rh_joinLeague 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Did you,"" he says rather than asks, making it clear that he did not receive any message. And if he did, he wouldn't have troubled to remember it.",,
