$global.foundZGRabyssMercs
!$player.metZGR","$option = arroyo_askAboutZGR2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He glares at you for a moment. Then sighs, looking away.",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGRoptEresp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGRoptEresp,$toldAboutMercs = true 0,"""Of course!"" Arroyo says with a laugh. ""Oh, that's our Zunya alright.""

He takes a deep breath and rubs his forehead, suddenly somber. ""Let me tell you about her.""",arroyo_askAboutZGR2:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGRoptBresp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGRoptBresp,,"""She would,"" he says.

""What I know is that business is about people. Business is deals, and people make deals. I'm a people person. That's why I'm looking out for you, $playerFirstName. Remember that.""

Then makes an exasperated sigh.

""Now. Glamor-Rotanev,"" he frowns and puts his hands together.",arroyo_askAboutZGR2:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGRoptCresp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGRoptCresp,"$option = arroyo_askAboutZGR2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He glares at you for a moment. Then sighs, exasperated.",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGRoptDresp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGRoptDresp,,"""No, you can't just back out of this,"" he says with a glare. ""You need to know who you're dealing with.""

He pauses for moment, considering you.

Then sighs, exasperated.",arroyo_askAboutZGR2:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR2,FireAll ArroyoAskAboutZGR2opts,"""What she believes is that if she makes a show of how much she doesn't care about anything, anyone, it'll look like she's the most ruthless and focused executive in the Company. Just see how much she's willing to destroy to succeed! There must be something to it, right?""

He sits back, fists clenched. ""It's a waste of capital! Human resources, too. Do you know how expensive it is to train good techs, competent management? Of course loyalty can be bought, but then her performance gets attached to the Company brand and makes buying it more expensive for the rest of us. So now I'm paying higher labor premiums? To boost HER career?""",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR2optC,ArroyoAskAboutZGR2opts,"$global.foundZGRabyssMercs
!$player.metZGR
$toldAboutMercs",,,"arroyo_askAboutZGR3c:""So her plan was to get those mercs killed?""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR2optA,ArroyoAskAboutZGR2opts,,,,"arroyo_askAboutZGR3a:""I had no idea you were such a humanitarian.""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR2optD,ArroyoAskAboutZGR2opts,,,,"arroyo_askAboutZGR3d:""Surely you can use this against her.""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR2optB,ArroyoAskAboutZGR2opts,!$global.foundZGRabyssMercs,,,"arroyo_askAboutZGR3b:""So her plan is to get me killed?""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR3a,,"He gives you a look.

""Don't even start.""",arroyo_askAboutZGR4:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR3b,,"""Probably not."" He gives you a look.

""But she'll use your death if she finds a way to make it useful. And she will.""",arroyo_askAboutZGR4:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR3c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR3c,,"""Probably not."" He gives you a look.

""But she'll use their death if she finds a way to make it useful to her. And she will.""",arroyo_askAboutZGR4:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR3d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR3d,,"He gives you a look.

""We'll see.""",arroyo_askAboutZGR4:Continue,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR4,$player.askedArroyoAboutZGR = true,"""My advice is, if you get involved? Watch your back. Mind yourself. Don't trust her.""

He looks away, thinking. His hands held together in front of his mouth, not quite the form of Luddic prayer.

""Seen a few fleet operators fall right off the map. She's looking for something. Big risk. I'd bet if I knew what it was I'd say it wasn't worth it.""","arroyo_askAboutZGR5a:""We'll just have to find out.""
arroyo_askAboutZGR5b:""Thank you for your warning.""
arroyo_askAboutZGR5c:""She wants me to find something called the 'Threat'.""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR4b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR4
$global.foundZGRabyssMercs
!$player.metZGR",$player.askedArroyoAboutZGR = true,"""My advice is don't get involved. And you're not going to listen, are you.""

He looks away, thinking. His hands held together in front of his mouth, not quite the form of Luddic prayer.

""Seen a few fleet operators fall right off the map. She's looking for something. Big risk. I'd bet if I knew what it was I'd say it wasn't worth it.""","arroyo_askAboutZGR5c:""I'm going to find out.""
arroyo_askAboutZGR6c:""I'll stay away."" (lie)
arroyo_askAboutZGR6d:""...Thanks for the warning.""",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR5a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR5a,FireAll PopulateOptions,"His eyes meet yours through the link.

""We won't. I'm going to be rich, get richer, and enjoy my splendid home. You can go do something very stupid if you have to. Just hope it doesn't get us all killed.""",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR5b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR5b-a,FireAll PopulateOptions,"His eyes meet yours through the link.

""I'm going to be rich, get richer, and enjoy my splendid home. You should do the same.""

He looks away again, presumably at achingly beautiful mountain vistas. ""But you won't.""",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR5c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR5c,,"His eyes meet yours through the link.

""That sounds like the third worst idea I've ever heard.""","arroyo_askAboutZGR6b:""What are the first two?""
arroyo_askAboutZGR6a:Let it go",
ArroyoAskAboutZGR6a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR6a,FireAll PopulateOptions,,,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR6b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR6b,FireAll PopulateOptions,"He falls back in his chair with an unhappy sound.

""Not now.""",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR6c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR6c,FireAll PopulateOptions,"He leans back in his chair.

""Sure.""",,
ArroyoAskAboutZGR6d,DialogOptionSelected,$option == arroyo_askAboutZGR6d,FireAll PopulateOptions,"He leans back in his chair.

""Sure.""",,
# Rayan Arroyo on AI ,,,,"Replace us all with AI cores - hah! Do that, and they'll zip off into their own hole in hyperspace and make 11-dimensional art or some Ludd-damned thing or other. The smarter those things are, the more unreliable they get. No mind for business, take my word for it.""",,"# cut from elsewhere, where to roll it back in?"
# ArroyoAskAboutAI TODO,DialogOptionSelected,,,"He gives you a look.

""Don't get clever, inspector."" He speaks the word with ironic emphasis. ""My legal team is more than happy to let you know or anyone else just how hypothetical my statements are.""",,
