ZGRpostGADHOconfrontStart,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_postGADHOconfront1,,"The Director's face creates a smile. ""He wasn't supposed to tell anyone. But this is Cornelius Elek, so I cannot be surprised.""

Her face, and tone, go blank again.

""You have something more to say about Elek. Proceed.""","ZGR_postGADHOimply1:""He was looking into an old sensor array. It found the Onslaught Mk.I.""",
ZGRpostGADHOimplyStart,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_postGADHOimply1,,"""Oh?"" The Director's face is immobile.","ZGR_postGADHOimply2:""Yes. I thought you might be involved.""",
