$player.itemValueSoldToZGRJustNowMonster > $player.itemValueSoldToZGRJustNowThreat",FireAll PopulateOptions,"""More fascinating specimens."" Her voice is dark.

""Our results have already proven to be most stimulating.""
OR
""Breathtaking,"" the Director of Special Acquisitions says softly.

Her eyes twitch inhumanly.",,
