ZGRacknowledgeGA1,ZGRbigUps,"!$didGA1
$global.gaFC_missionCompleted
!$global.gaATG_missionCompleted","$didGA1 = true
$didUps++","""You're proving useful to Provost Baird - an admirable figure generally - yet one who stubbornly ties herself to the Hegemony bureaucracy.""

""If it weren't for Kallichore's blundering..."" Her eyes grow distant - more distant - for a moment, then return to their usual unblinking detachment.

""Here at Tri-Tachyon, we put the highest value in unrestrained R&D. Especially its dividends."" She smiles coyly. ""So, I think, do you.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# GA in-progress
ZGRacknowledgeGA2,ZGRbigUps,"!$didGA2
$global.gaATG_missionCompleted","$didGA2 = true
$didUps++","""You've proven useful to Provost Baird. And your accomplishment with the Gates...""

She puts her hands together, not quite a single clap for all you've done. Her politely mechanical smile contains some bitterness, you sense.

""I admire Baird, truly I do. Her ability to overcome Hegemony stone-walling, and herding those academics with their notions... sadly, though, it appears as though her grip was too tight. Pity to lose top talent.""

The bitterness, you see, has left Glamor-Rotanev's smile to be replaced with something more carnivorous.

""Our R&D is cutting-edge, eminently practical, and there's very little risk of runaways. Our results might match your ambitions, I think."" ",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# GA completed
