ZGRackChurchOptHumanist,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_ackChurchOptHumanist,"$player.ethosHumanitarian++
FireBest ZGRbigUps","""How admirable,"" she says with no attempt to inject sincerity into her words. It is a dismissal; she pauses for but a moment then proceeds.",,
ZGRackChurchOptMercenary,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_ackChurchOptMercenary,$player.ethosMercenary++,"""How unexpected,"" she says, curious.

""I suppose one must concede that the Church is not without some wealth and not without need for services unclouded by... fanatic enthusiasm. I suppose you've found something of a niche market for yourself. However limited.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRackChurchOptAbsurdLie,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_ackChurchOptAbsurdLie,$player.liedToZGRaboutLuddicFaith = true,"""Of course."" A cool smile. ""I wanted to hear you say it.""

Her eyes seem suddenly more engaged - focused and examining you intently, distantly. Like you're a lab experiment pinned to a dissection table.",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRackChurchOptAbsurd,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_ackChurchOptAbsurd,FireBest ZGRbigUps,"A cool smile. ""Of course. I just wanted to hear you say it."" She pauses for a moment, then proceeds.",,
ZGRackChurchOptDontThink,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ZGR_ackChurchOptDontThink,,"""I see,"" she says as if she quite distinctly doesn't.

Her head tilts very slightly, perplexed.",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeDiktat,ZGRbigUps,"!$didDiktat
$player.fcm_faction == sindrian_diktat","$didDiktat = true 0
$didUps++","""We've noticed that Mr. Macario - apologies,"" she laughs like a wind chime, ""'The Chief High Inspector' has taken you for one of his pawns.""

""You and I both know you're more and better than that. I believe your innovative perspective could be worth more than his entire tin-pot slum-bully's secret budget of bribes and favors.""

Her eyebrows lift precisely. ""Do you?""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# finished SDTU .. or Diktat com?
ZGRacknowledgeDiktatB,ZGRbigUps,"!$didDiktat
$player.fcm_faction == sindrian_diktat
$player.sdtu_gotExecutorFromMacario","$didDiktat = true 0
$didUps++","""We've noticed that Mr. Macario - apologies,"" she laughs like a wind chime, ""'The Chief High Inspector' has taken you for one of his pawns.""

""You and I both know you're more than that. Better than that. And I believe your innovative perspective could be worth more than his entire tin-pot slum-bully's secret budget of bribes and favors. That silly little battleship he gave you? A child's toy compared to what I offer.""

She brushes one hand off with the other. ",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeHegemony,ZGRbigUps,"!$didHeg
$player.fcm_faction == hegemony score:3","$didHeg = true 0
$didUps++","""I must applaud your patriotism - the Hegemony, the restoration of the Domain!

She makes as if to clap, daintily, but stops her hands before they meet. Then turns her expression toward something far more cynical.

""You may earn the favor of that stubborn 'Old Man Daud'. But is that enough? Surely you tire of that paltry government stipend, the endless regulation? It must stifle your ambition. You must yearn for a truly dynamic enterprise. One in which someone like yourself can change the Sector...""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# Hegemony commission
ZGRacknowledgeLeague,ZGRbigUps,"!$didLeague
$player.fcm_faction == persean
!$player.isLeagueMember
!$player.payingHouseHannan","$didLeague = true 0
$didUps++","""You've a League commission. They see value in you, but not so much that they've invited you to share power as a member,"" she says. 

""Why play the mercenary for below-market rates? You're better than that, I think.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# League member
ZGRacknowledgeLeagueB,ZGRbigUps,"!$didLeague
$player.fcm_faction == persean
$player.numColonies > 0 score:2
!$player.isLeagueMember","$didLeague = true 0
$didUps++","""You've a League commission. They see value in you,"" she looks down, and aside, placing a hand on the empty expanse of her enormous desk.

""But not enough to invite you to become a full member of the League, despite your colonial enterprise."" She makes a small sound, halfways between pity and disappointment.

""Consider what you will gain from being a partner rather than a subject.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeLeagueC,ZGRbigUps,"!$didLeague
$player.isLeagueMember score:3
!$player.payingHouseHannan","$didLeague = true 0
$didUps++","""You're a member of the League. A junior member, however. Perhaps not in name, but... tell me, do the gens respect you as a peer?""

""Or are you just another vassal to their little empire? Consider your future, captain, and how you might truly achieve greatness.""

Her eyes narrow. ""As a partner rather than a subject.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeLeagueD,ZGRbigUps,"!$didLeague
$player.isLeagueMember 
$player.payingHouseHannan score:4","$didLeague = true 0
$didUps++","""Tell me the truth, are you content to be a mere lackey of our mutual friend Reynard Hannan? He drains you like a leech from atop his so-called League. Let me give you a taste of real business, of real credits.""

Her eyes narrow. ""As a partner rather than a subject.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeArroyo,ZGRbigUps,"!$didArroyo
$global.metArroyo
TT_CMD isArroyoContact score:2","$didArroyo = true 0
$global.ZGRcommentedOnArroyo = true
$didUps++","""Tell me, how is Rayan Arroyo? I've always admired his entrepreneurial spirit, but."" She forms a little smile that might have been apologetic if it weren't so condescending.

""He doesn't have the killer instinct required for senior leadership. Isn't that funny? But we do need people like him.""

""And we need people like you. Go-getters, achievers; builders and destroyers. And what we need, we at Tri-Tachyon pay for. Only the best.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# Arroyo contact
ZGRacknowledgeTTDeal,ZGRbigUps,"!$didTTdeal
$player.hasTriTachDeal
!$player.brokeTriTachDeal","$didTTdeal = true 0
$didUps++","""You cut a deal with the Company after some... assertive negotiations. To our mutual benefit. I applaud your audacity.""

Her teeth glisten.

""Such fierce initiative is exactly what Tri-Tachyon needs.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# made TT deal
ZGRacknowledgeTTcom,ZGRbigUps,"!$didTTcom
$player.fcm_faction == tritachyon","$didTTcom = true 0
$didUps++","""You've had a taste of working for the Company. A mundane commission, mercenary fare. Boilerplate. Busywork. We'd have automated all that sort of thing long ago, of course, if not for-"" 

She pulls her gaze back down, ""Well, I digress. I believe you're capable of more, so much more. Think of this as the next step.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,
ZGRacknowledgeColony,ZGRbigUps,"!$didColony
$player.numColonies > 0","$didColony = true 0
$didUps++","""You're not only an explorer, you're a builder - founding a new colony!""

""It is bold of you to strike out despite the anti-innovation measures sure to fall upon you from the major factions,"" she says. ""I suspect you'll benefit from an injection of capital. For the builder must also ensure that their prosperity cannot be simply seized by the small-minded takers.""",ZGR_acknowledgeContinue:Continue,# has a colony
ZGRacknowledgeDone,ZGRbigUps,$didUps > 0,"$option = zgr_makePitch0 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I believe that's enough of that, captain,"" she says stonily.",,
ZGRacknowledgeDoneNone,ZGRbigUps,#$didUps == 0,,"Her expression is blank for a moment.

""On second thought, I feel no need to justify myself,"" she says stonily.",zgr_makePitch0:Continue,
#ZGRacknowledgeDoneFew,ZGRbigUps,,,,,
ZGRstartPitch0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch0,"$option = zgr_makePitch1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Now allow me to explain the shape of our partnership.""",,
ZGRstartPitch0OMKI,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch0
$global.foundOneslaught","Highlight ""Onslaught Mk.I""
$option = zgr_makePitch0OKMIout 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Whatever your other, lesser accomplishments, there is one in particular which is why you are here. You found something very old in the Abyss. Something known to history as the Onslaught Mk.I, which is of interest to me.""",,
ZGRstartPitch0OMKIb,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch0
$global.foundOneslaught
PlayerFleetHasShipWithBaseHull onslaught_mk1","Highlight ""Onslaught Mk.I""
$option = zgr_makePitch0OKMIout 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Whatever your other, lesser accomplishments, there is one in particular which is why you are here. The ship is in your fleet - what is known to history as the Onslaught Mk.I, which is of interest to me.""",,
ZGRstartPitch0OMKIout,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch0OKMIout,$askedAboutOMKIalready = true 0,"She pauses a moment, eyes black.

""I shall make my proposal shortly. First, allow me to elaborate on a shape for our partnership.""","zgr_makePitch1:""I'm listening.""",
# Step 2: make the pitch,,,,,,
ZGRstartPitch1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch1,$doingPitch = true 0,"""You know my title. I take a portion of surplus capital from the Company and invest it in what we like to call 'black sky initiatives'.""",zgr_makePitch1b:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch1b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch1b,,"""There are unimaginable possibilities out there."" She raises an arm, hand extended, fingers like rays into the far, dark corners of the cavernous office.

You sense the lights dim slightly - a dramatic effect triggered by her cybernetic implants, no doubt.",zgr_makePitch2:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch2,"$option = zgr_makePitch2opts 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""I take the very long shots. There are things,"" she stresses the word oddly, ""Such things out there, captain. Technologies and phenomena the Human Domain hid away, and from. They locked such wonders and treasures up in red-tape concocted by fearful, jealous little minds. They suffocated these opportunities, blinded themselves to unimaginable possibilities.""

""The returns from exploitation would be... astronomical. Or perhaps,"" her eyes glint in the filtered starlight, ""They may prove to be of value well beyond that of mere stars.""",,
ZGRstartPitch2optsA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch2opts,,,"zgr_makePitch3a:""Returns, you say. That sounds like a lot of credits.""
zgr_makePitch3b:""Exploration and new technology are of interest to me.""
zgr_makePitch3c:""You speak of meddling in things which should be left alone.""",
ZGRstartPitch2optsB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch2opts
$global.foundZGRabyssMercs",,,"zgr_makePitch3z:""I found some mercs in the Abyss who appeared to regret their deal with you.""
zgr_makePitch3a:""Returns, you say. That sounds like a lot of credits.""
zgr_makePitch3b:""Exploration and new technology is of interest to me.""
zgr_makePitch3c:""You speak of meddling in things which should be left alone.""",
ZGRstartPitch3z,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3z,,"Her head gives a small twitch.

""Regret, you say.""","zgr_makePitch3zA:""They used rather stronger language to express the sentiment.""
zgr_makePitch3zB:""They came to a poor end. I should like to avoid that for myself.""",
ZGRstartPitch3zA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3zA,,"""I see,"" she says.

""You found them. In the Abyss. And returned."" The Director pauses a moment. ""This simply proves your fitness for the operation.""","zgr_makePitch4z:""That's one way of looking at it.""
zgr_makePitch3c:""It's dangerous out there. Very dangerous.""",
ZGRstartPitch3zB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3zB,,"""Evidently, you already have,"" she says.

""This simply proves your fitness for the operation.""","zgr_makePitch4z:""That's one way of looking at it.""
zgr_makePitch3c:""It's dangerous out there. Very dangerous.""",
ZGRstartPitch3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3a,$player.ethosMercenary++,"""It is,"" she smiles, teeth jewel-like. ""And I'll ensure that you receive your share.""",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3b,$player.ethosKnowledge++,"""Then I think we shall work well together,"" she says.",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch3c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3c,,"""Yes. Does that frighten you?"" she asks.","zgr_makePitch3cNo:""No.""
zgr_makePitch3cNoLie:""No."" (lie)
zgr_makePitch3cFool:""Yes. I'd be a fool if I did not fear what's out there.""
zgr_makePitch3cComp:""Yes. Which is why I require adequate compensation.""",
ZGRstartPitch3cNo,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3cNo,$player.ethosCocky++,"She pauses a moment, making no outward reaction to your bravado.

""I see,"" she allows, finally.",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch3cNoLie,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3cNoLie,$player.ethosLiar++,"She pauses a moment, making no outward reaction to your pretense of bravado.

""I see,"" she allows, finally.",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch3cFool,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3cFool,$player.ethosTruth++,"""I see,"" she says after a moment.

""I trust that you shall ensure your executive judgment is merely tempered, not impaired, by such sentiment."" ",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch3cComp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch3cComp,$player.ethosMercenary++,"""Of course,"" she says, allowing a trace of amusement to enter her voice.",zgr_makePitch4:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch4zz,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch4z,"$option = zgr_makePitch4 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","She makes no outward reaction to your implication, simply proceeding as if you'd said nothing at all.",,
ZGRstartPitch4z,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch4
$global.foundZGRabyssMercs","$option = zgr_makePitch4b 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""The Perseus-Orion Abyss is a melodramatic name. I find spacers are a superstitious lot, present company excepted. Self-limiting mythology is best discarded if one means to ascend to the fullest of human potential."" She looks away for a moment, making a dismissive flick with her flingers.",,
ZGRstartPitch4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch4,"$option = zgr_makePitch4b 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""You know of the Perseus-Orion Abyss? A melodramatic name. I find spacers are a superstitious lot, excepting present company. Self-limiting mythology is best discarded if one means to ascend to the fullest of human potential."" She looks away for a moment, making a dismissive flick with her flingers.",,
ZGRstartPitch4b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch4b,,"""It is true, however, that the Abyss is hostile to our hyperspace technology. That is precisely why the secrets it holds may be all the more profitably disruptive.""

She turns to look you full-on, once more. ""I want you to go there. I have data... there is something to find. Very old. Very dangerous. Very valuable. Bring me scans, samples. You will be paid handsomely for tangible specimens.""","zgr_makePitch5:""You haven't said exactly what I'm looking for. Salvage?""",
ZGRstartPitch4OMKI,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch4
$global.foundOneslaught score:2","Highlight ""Threat""
SetTextHighlightColors bad
FireAll ZGRstartPitch8opts","""You know the Perseus-Orion Abyss. You went there, and there you found the Onslaught Mk.I... and the 'Threat'.""

She looks at you anew, more present somehow.

""I very much desire to have a look at the Mk.I.""",,
ZGRstartPitch4OMKIelek,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch4
$global.foundOneslaught score:2
$global.gaDHO_missionCompleted","Highlight ""Threat""
SetTextHighlightColors bad
FireAll ZGRstartPitch8opts","""You know the Perseus-Orion Abyss. You know of the 'Threat'."" She looks away. ""A typically non-descriptive name passed to us from some primitive government committee, I'm sure.""

""You found Academician Cornelius Elek's enigma, the Onslaught Mk.I... among other things.""

She looks at you anew, more present somehow.

""This is what I want.""",,
ZGRstartPitch5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch5,,"""Not exactly,"" she says, self-satisifed. ""Something more valuable.""","zgr_makePitch6a:""Is this about remnants of the AI War fleets?""
zgr_makePitch6b:""Is it aliens?""
zgr_makePitch6c:""Yes, but you haven't said what.""",
ZGRstartPitch6a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch6a,"$option = zgr_makePitch7 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Those old things?"" She gives her head an abbreviated shake. 

""No, we have people for that. Although,"" she fixes you with a look, ""they've made quite a mess of it, haven't they? The wasted possibilities... but no, we're looking for something older... different.""",,
ZGRstartPitch6b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch6b,"$option = zgr_makePitch7 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""No, nothing like that."" She emits a joyless laugh, like a machine, then pauses suddenly.

""Although if you did happen to find alien technology... provide me with exclusive access and I would ensure you credits enough to purchase your own solar system. Or,"" she waves a hand in an unconscious arc, ""Build yourself a new one out of dross, if that's what you enjoy.""",,
ZGRstartPitch6c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch6c,"$option = zgr_makePitch7 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""There's no need. Our strategic indicators forecast a reasonably likely chance of your survival if your outlook is unbiased by speculation, so take heart."" She trails off.",,
ZGRstartPitch7,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch7,,"Sensing the insufficiency of her pep-talk, she begins anew: ""What it is, is old. Early Domain. Pre-Persean Frontier, but we have reason to believe some part of it is out... here. Whether it followed us or we followed it. Whatever it is, wherever there is.""",zgr_makePitch8:Continue,
ZGRstartPitch8,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch8,FireAll ZGRstartPitch8opts,"""Not exactly,"" she says, self-satisfied. ""Something more valuable.""",,
