$saidPitchKnow = true 0","""Crews talk, TriPads listen. There is little I cannot know if I so wish,"" she says, injecting a tone of boredom into her words.

""Accept it. Now let's speak of business.""",,
ZGRmakePitch9elek,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9elek,"$askedElekHowKnow = true
RemoveOption zgr_makePitch9elek
$saidPitchElek = true","""Old records,"" she says curtly.

""The Galatia Academy doesn't know what it has, much less how to make good use of it. Their lack of self-motivation is self-evident.""",,
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy,$offeredToSellOneslaught = true,"She laughs with a buzz like a malfunctioning agrav plate.

""Oh, no. That'd be far too provocative to..."" She gives a little flick of the hand, indicating enemies too irrelevant to bother acknowledging in speech.

The Hegemony, maybe.

""However,"" she fixes upon you. ""I would gladly pay for the opportunity to have my people take a close look at it. And take a few samples, very small, nothing damaging.""","zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy2:""You can't detect them, can you. That's what you want.""",
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy2,,"She blinks. ""Detect them?""

Her voice is emotionless.","zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy3:""The Threat. They're all but invisible to you.""",
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy3,,"Her face arranges itself into a shape suggesting dismissive amusement.

""What an interesting theory, captain. Whatever my motives, will you agree to my proposal? A simple look, a few scans. A few samples.""","zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4mil:""One million credits.""
zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4later:""Let's discuss this later.""",
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy4mil,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4mil,FireAll ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy4milCheck,"A long pause. Her eyes flicker, accessing. Calculating.

""This is possible."" She speaks with an emotion suddenly present - quiet displeasure, presumably at your maneuvering.

""You ask for much, captain.""","zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4mil2:""Tri-Tachyon's Director of Special Acquisitions can afford a mere million credits. I accept.""
zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4later:""Let's discuss this later.""",
