$global.gaveZGRoneslaughtAccess = true
$didAsale = true 0","""Done,"" she says, her voice as empty as the Abyss.

Almost instantly, your TriPad pings with several alerts - credits transfer, but also notification from your tactical officer concerning an approaching Tri-Tachyon portside-tender, swarming with engineering drones, and your comms, forwarding certain docking requests directly to the Onslaught Mk.I.

""Take a moment to ensure your affairs are in order, captain,"" Glamor-Rotanev says.

You'd think she enjoys overwhelming your officers with the speed of her response.",zgr_makePitch9OMKIscan0:Make the arrangements,
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIbuy4later,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIbuy4later
$doingPitch","Highlight  ""100,000""","""Fine,"" she says, the spite cold in her voice.

""You've seen them. The Threat. Ancient, automated warfleets deep in the Abyss. And you lived."" She is quite collected, suddenly, as she speaks.

""Would you part with recordings of your encounter with the Threat? I offer 100,000 credits for immediate transfer.""","zgr_makePitch9threat2:""I accept.""
zgr_makePitch9No:""Perhaps another time.""",
ZGRmakePitch9OMKIscan0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9OMKIscan0,"AddTextSmall ""Allowed Tri-Tachyon to scan and sample Onslaught Mk.I"" highlight","Director Glamor-Rotanev takes a moment to turn and appear to look out over her spectacular view of the Xanadu Geodivision.

You're certain she's watching her teams as they board the Onslaught Mk.I through what are no doubt top-of-the-line cybernetic implants and neural integrations.

And, doubtless, watching your comms. Because just as you are finished, she turns back, resettling her facial muscles with a twitch.",zgr_makePitch9OMKIscan1:Continue,
