ZGRstartPitch9a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9a,"$option = zgr_makePitch10 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""A threat, presumably. The hostile connotation lives in the name."" A quick, bloodless smile. ""You'll prepare yourself for anything, I'm sure.""",,
ZGRstartPitch9b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9b,"$option = zgr_makePitch10 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""We assume it'll engage in some sort of hostile action against you or your $shipOrFleet,"" she says indifferently. ""Only this won't be pirate, Pather, or tariff patrol.""

""Nor,"" she fixes you with a cool look, ""Some remnant AI warfleet. Those, those we know about.""

""Disappointing conversationalists,"" she mutters. ""Superintelligence with no mind for business. Simply unbelievable...""",,
ZGRmakePitch9both,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9both,"Highlight  ""150,000""","She blinks. Her eyes seem suddenly present for the first time. And she stares for several seconds, motionless.

""You're telling the truth,"" she says, outwardly cool.

""Would you part with recordings of your encounters with both of these... forces? I offer 150,000 credits for immediate transfer.""","zgr_makePitch9both2:""I accept.""
zgr_makePitch9No:""Perhaps another time.""",
