$global.foundOneslaught score:2",,"""Perhaps,"" she says, repeating you rather frostily.

""And disappointing. It would be useful to compare your data to our baseline. I must emphasize my interest - my financial interest - in procuring more information about the Threat.""","zgr_makePitch11:""You said 'compare'. Was there another expedition before me?""",
ZGRstartPitch9lie,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch9lie,,"She blinks and her eyes seem suddenly present for the first time. And they narrow slightly.

""Of course not,"" she says. ""But when you do, I'm sure you'll quickly realize why no one else in the Sector is prepared to deal seriously with this... Threat. It is in your interest to work with me.""","zgr_makePitch11:""You say 'when'. Was there another expedition before me?""",
ZGRstartPitch9liez,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch9lie
$global.foundZGRabyssMercs",,"She blinks and her eyes seem suddenly present for the first time. And they narrow slightly.

""Of course not,"" she says. ""But when you do, I'm sure you'll quickly realize why no one else in the Sector is prepared to deal seriously with this... Threat. It is in your interest to work with me.""","zgr_makePitch11:""You say 'when'. Was there another expedition that succeeded before me?""",
ZGRstartPitch10,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch10,,"""I insist that you spare no expense in outfitting your expedition. Bring more fuel and supplies than you anticipate needing so that you don't embarrass yourself like the- well, never mind them. You're a winner, and we place our bets on winners.""","zgr_makePitch11:""Like the who? Was there another expedition before me?""",
ZGRstartPitch10z,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == zgr_makePitch10
$global.foundZGRabyssMercs",,"""I insist that you spare no expense in outfitting your expedition. Bring more fuel and supplies than you anticipate needing so that you don't embarrass yourself like the- well, never mind them. You're a winner, and we place our bets on winners.""","zgr_makePitch11:""Like the who? Was there another expedition that succeeded before me?""",
ZGRstartPitch11,DialogOptionSelected,$option == zgr_makePitch11,,"""'Was there another...' she says, repeating your words.

""Dozens! Some returned with nothing, others not at all. I won't conceal the fact from you. Maybe you'll find them, though don't feel compelled to render assistance on behalf of the Tri-Tachyon Corporation. These were independent contractors who accepted and assumed the risk. Then failed.""

""If anything,"" she says quietly, ""we have grounds to sue them if they ever manage to get back to the Core Worlds.""",zgr_makePitch12:Continue,
