GRBHbarStart2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_start2,,"As you enter, an impeccably dressed young-appearing man lounging at the bar stands and approaches with an easy, open expression. His eyes literally twinkle - subtle cybernetics - as he greets you.

""Captain $playerName, I cannot express how happy I am to connect."" His handshake lingers a moment too long.","grbh_startRespA:""And what's your business?""
grbh_startRespB:""Always pleased to meet a fan. Did you want a holo with me?""
grbh_startRespC:""Excuse me, I have important business to attend to.""
grbh_startRespD:""Excuse me, I have important drinking to attend to.""",
GRBHstartRespA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_startRespA,"$option = grbh_startResp2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","His perfect eyebrows lift. ""Just this,"" he says.",,
GRBHstartRespB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_startRespB,"$grbh_didLaugh = true 0
$option = grbh_startResp2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He laughs beautifully, perfect teeth flashing.",,
GRBHstartRespC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_startRespC,"$option = grbh_startResp2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Naturally,"" he says, perfect teeth flashing. ""I won't delay you a millisec- here.""",,
GRBHstartRespD,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_startRespD,"$option = grbh_startResp2 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Naturally,"" he says, perfect teeth flashing. ""I won't delay you a millisec- here.""",,
GRBHstartResp2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_startResp2,,"It takes a moment for you to realize that you are holding a card. Placed through some sleight-of-hand, no doubt.",grbh_examine:Examine it,
GRBHexamine,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_examine,"AddTextSmall ""  Director of Special Acquisitions Zunya Glamor-Rotanev""
AddTextSmall ""  Suite 1000, Skyarco II Executive Annex""
AddTextSmall ""  Xanadu Geodivision""
AddTextSmall ""  Eochu Bres, Hybrasil system""
AddTextSmall ""  Persean Sector""","The subtle, off-white material has a luxurious heft. An embossed Tri-Tachyon crest is just visible through the barely translucent polyply stock.

This is an affectation of the business class dating all the way back to Terran prehistory called a 'business-card', a sort of analog commlink ID data-packet. It reads:","grbh_examine2A:""Thanks. I think.""
grbh_examine2B:""I take it you're not Director Glamor-Rotanev?""
grbh_examine2C:""What's this for?""",
GRBHexamineA,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_examine2A,"AddTextSmall ""Received invitation to speak with VP Glamor-Rotanev on Hybrasil"" highlight","He laughs beautifully.

""Most welcome. You're holding the opportunity of a lifetime,"" he says with a wink. ""I recommend you have a chat with Director Glamor-Rotanev. At your earliest convenience, of course.""",grbh_outro:Continue,
GRBHexamineB,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_examine2B,"AddTextSmall ""Received invitation to speak with VP Glamor-Rotanev on Hybrasil"" highlight","He laughs beautifully.

""Oh, oh no,"" he says, almost bashful. ""You're holding the opportunity of a lifetime. I recommend you have a chat with Director Glamor-Rotanev. At your earliest convenience, of course.""",grbh_outro:Continue,
GRBHexamineC,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_examine2C,"AddTextSmall ""Received invitation to speak with VP Glamor-Rotanev on Hybrasil"" highlight","He laughs beautifully.

""You're holding the opportunity of a lifetime,"" he says with a wink. ""I recommend you have a chat with Director Glamor-Rotanev. At your earliest convenience, of course.""",grbh_outro:Continue,
