GRBHoutro1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == grbh_outro,"$player.receivedGlamorRotanevInvite = true
SetPersonHidden glamor_rotanev false","He puts his hands together with a soft clap, and does something not quite like a bow.

""My task here is concluded. Enjoy yourself. Tonight's tab shall be on Mz. Glamor-Rotanev.""

He turns, and exits the bar, leaving you with the 'business-card'.",grbh_outro2:Pocket the card and look back to the bar,
