Commission hasOtherCommission
Commission commissionFactionIsAtWarWith tritachyon",FireAll PopulateOptions,"$HeOrShe gives you a skeptical look, then speaks. ""Here's the problem, champ. You've got a commission with $theOtherCommissionFaction. And they're at war with the Tri-Tachyon Corporation.""

""You want to get out of fighting and back to doing business?"" $HeOrShe spreads $hisOrHer hands. ""Resign the commission, that's my advice.""

""And by the way, talking to you isn't going to do wonders for my reputation on the inside. I hope your encryption is good.""",,
