$global.didTTrepBribe++","$HeOrShe nods. You can see $heOrShe has that grim look one gets when they have to make a lot of uncomfortable comms calls.

""Now I've got work to do, starting with comming some local contacts. Be on your best behavior, $playerName, and we can make this work.""",cutCommLink:Cut the comm link,
