!$faction.isHostile",,"Deputy Star Marshal Hyder appears, her face impassive. ""Contact identified, maintain course,"" she speaks to another bridge officer before turning to comms.

""Independent fleet, hear me: stay clear of our operational volume and you will not be fired upon.""

""Hyder out.""

