!$faction.isHostile",,"Deputy Star Marshal Hyder appears, her face impassive. ""Independent fleet,"" she says, not acknowledging your previous contact, ""Hear me: stay clear of our operational volume and you will not be fired upon.""

""Hyder out.""

The comms snap off before you have a chance to speak.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
