$player.fleetPoints < 75
!$faction.isHostile",,"Guard High Deputy Executor Caden doesn't even bother to open to comms; instead, a blank-faced Sindrian Diktat officer appears, and speaks.

""Minor independent fleet: maintain distance and you will not be fired upon. Glory to the Sindrian Diktat!"" 

And with that, the comms-line snaps off.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
defaultCadenGreetHostile,OpenCommLink,"$id == caden score:1000
$faction.isHostile",,"Guard High Deputy Executor Caden appears, face red, eyes staring with blank hatred.

""You shall be extinguished by the might of the Lion's Guard!"" he shouts. ""Glory to the Sindrian Diktat, eternal victory to the Supreme Executor!""

The comms snap off without waiting for your reply.",cutCommLinkNoText:Continue,
defaultCadenGreetPostSDTU,OpenCommLink,"$id == caden score:1000
$global.sdtu_missionCompleted
!$faction.isHostile",,"The image of Guard High Deputy Executor Caden appears. He is not even looking at the comms-feed.

""Independent fleet: maintain distance and you will not be fired upon. Hear and obey,"" Caden declares, taking a breath.

""Final victory to the Supreme Executor!"" he shouts.",cutCommLink:Cut the comm link,
