sdtuRamPrepareHub,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_ramPrepareHub,FireAll SDTURamPrepOptions,"You inspect the shuttle that will take you to the surface of Volturn. Your tech officer, armorer, personal guards, and pilot attend.",,
