sdtuRamSafehouse9checkRevA3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_ramSafehouseRevenge3,FireBest SDTURamMacarioWeaponCheck,"""Then it seems that I owe you a death,"" Macario says, nodding reasonably. ""That I can provide.""",,
