AddTextSmall ""'Traitor' officer transferred to Sindrian Diktat INTSEC custody"" highlight","""You're giving up so easily."" he says, looking hurt. Then he leans forward. ""Do as you will, captain, but do not disappoint me. You're too smart for that, aren't you?""

He leans back again, and flicks his fingers. ""Well, do transfer the prisoner. We like to tidy up loose ends around here. Now, about Hyder.""",,
