$player.helpedUmbraARC",,"""An agent. Here?"" A look of concern grows on her face.

""I can't say I'm surprised. If you have definitive intel about a Diktat spy on Umbra, then tell me. We'll assemble a revolutionary tribunal to sort this out.""","sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent2:Explain the true situation
