sdtuUmbraAskAgentQM3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent2,,"You explain that to get into Dolos Macario's trust, such as it is, you need to 'capture' an agent who Horacio Caden thinks is working for the Lion's Guard but has actually been working for the resistance. 

As an asset, they're already useless because Macario knows about their betrayal of the Sindrian Diktat. Their last act as an operative can be to help you 'prove' your dedication to the Spider's schemes.

It will be risky, but it should be possible for this agent to slip out of a death sentence by taking advantage of inter-service rivalry in the Sindrian Diktat.

Imoinu is silent, with a look of grave concern, as you explain.","sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent3:""They're burned, Imoinu. This way still gets a win for the ARC and the United Front.""",
sdtuUmbraAskAgentQM4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent3,"$global.sdtu_umbraAgentCoop = true
SetTooltip  sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent4 ""Maybe you can ensure the agent lives through this...""
SetTooltip sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent4lie ""Why risk the mission for one double agent?""","She looks down, and sighs. Taking a moment to process.

Then looks back up. Her expression is resolute.

""You're right. We can make this work.""","sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent4:""And they'll come to no harm.""
sdtu_umbraImoinuAgent4lie:""And they'll definitely come to no harm."" (lie)",
