It's a complex story, but you begin to see your suggested truth sink in to $personName.

""You mean to tell me they've been working against the uprising the whole time,"" she says, her outrage growing. ""You've helped us before, captain... and now this.""","sdtu_umbraTrickVIPimoinuB2:""And I need this agent. To get into Macario's favor, infiltrate his schemes.""",
sdtuUmbraTrickVIPimoinuB2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_umbraTrickVIPimoinuB2,,"She doesn't look pleased with the idea.

""We usually deal with traitors internally,"" she says. ""And quickly.""

""But considering your past contributions to the uprising, I think the revolutionary tribunal could be persuaded of the efficacy of giving you custody of the traitor.""

Her chin raises, ""For the United Front.""","sdtu_umbraTrickVIPending2:""For the United Front!""",
