sdtuUmbraTrickVIPOptionZsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_umbraTrickVIPhelped,,"""I will,"" $heOrShe says, then mutes the feed for a moment, turning to a secondary display.

You watch one side of a short conversation play out, and $heOrShe turns back to you, $hisOrHer expression much friendlier.

""I'm sorry for that, captain. Imoinu swears you're a friend of the United Front of the Askonian Resistance who has made valuable material contributions to the cause."" $HeOrShe nods respectfully, ""Then let me say that I'm proud to call you a comrade.""","sdtu_umbraTrickVIPending1:""Glad to hear it. Now about this agent...""",
