""Then I would suggest that waiting around will not be a productive use of time.""",,
sdtuMercReact1whoWork,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_mercReact1whoWork,RemoveOption sdtu_mercReact1whoWork,"""Ah,"" $heOrShe frowns. ""My mission parameters require that I not reveal the identity of my employer. Enormous penalty clause there.""",,
