""Independent $shipOrFleet,"" the merc says in a perfunctory monotone, ""I have been contracted to destroy any ship or fleet,"" $heOrShe pauses politely so you may understand that you are just such a ship or fleet, ""-which interferes with the debris field you just plundered. This communication is made not as a negotiation, but simply a matter of professional courtesy.""

$HeOrShe produces a perfectly bland customer-service smile then hits the comms cut-off.",cutCommLink:Cut the comm link,
