""Independent $shipOrFleet,"" the merc says in a perfunctory monotone, ""I have been contracted to destroy any ship or fleet which interferes with the debris field you just salvaged. This communication is not a negotiation, but rather-"" 

The merc pauses, lifting a finger to $hisOrHer ear as if being told something on a private channel.

""You are $playerName,"" $heOrShe says, looking at you anew. ""Commissioned auxiliary of the Hegemony.""","sdtu_mercGotDebrisHeg2:""I am.""
