sdtuMercGreetingGotDebrisHeg2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == sdtu_mercGotDebrisHeg2,,"""My apologies, captain. I have specific orders not to interfere with your activities, and,"" $heOrShe double-checks a datapad, ""It seems I am to, um, render assistance insofar as it does not compromise my mission.""

""You've put me in an awkward spot,"" the merc rubs $hisOrHer brow.  ""But I suppose I must simply let you go. Bright burns?""","cutCommLink:""Burn bright.""",
