MakeOtherFleetNonHostile sdtu true","""My apologies, captain. I have specific orders not to interfere with your activities, and,"" $heOrShe double-checks a datapad, ""It seems I am to, um, render assistance insofar as it does not compromise my mission.""

""Ah, there was one more thing,"" the merc rubs $hisOrHer brow. ""Oh yes. You should visit the Ragnar Complex, in the Valhalla system. Great opportunities for someone like... you."" $HeOrShe pauses, eyes fixed and unblinking to ensure that you got the message.

That accomplished, $heOrShe transitions to a thin smile, as if this business was concluded to everyone's satisfaction. ""Bright burns,"" $heOrShe says.","sdtu_mercSeeRao:""Explain your meaning- why Ragnar Complex?""
cutCommLink:""Burn bright.""",
