ImoinuUmbraMacarioHubSelG,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuUmbra_macarioHubSelG,AdjustRepActivePerson INHOSPITABLE -1,"""A Luddic, huh."" She has an odd expression, a crease in her brow. Like there's some deep-seated disgust that she's trying to hide.

""Well. Blessings to you, I guess,"" she says awkwardly. ""I don't know whether to believe you or not. You should probably connect with Standfast and the VSDC. Anyway...""",imoinuUmbra_sayAndrada4:Continue,
ImoinuUmbraMacarioHubSelH,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuUmbra_macarioHubSelH,"$player.ethosLiar++
AdjustRepActivePerson INHOSPITABLE -3","""Finlay Siyavong? Ha!""

You can hear the aristocrat in her laugh. It is bitter, and a potential for sharp cruelty hides there.

""I've met him, you fool. You're not Finlay Siyavong. You're a liar.""",imoinuUmbra_sayAndrada4b:Continue,
ImoinuKatoUmbraSayAndrada4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuUmbra_sayAndrada4,FireAll PopulateOptions,"""If what you say is true about Andrada, then it's probably good news. Probably. But practically speaking it doesn't change the situation. Holos can be faked. It's the entire basis of the Diktat propaganda machine.""

She shrugs. ""Besides, the Sindrian Diktat lives on, run by Andrada's underlings. The worlds of Askonia are still held under the boot of the oppressor. The fight must go on.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraSayAndrada4b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuUmbra_sayAndrada4b,FireAll PopulateOptions,"""And even if you weren't lying about Andrada, practically speaking it doesn't change the situation. Holos can be faked. It's the entire basis of the Diktat propaganda machine.""

She shrugs. ""The Sindrian Diktat lives on, run by Andrada's underlings in his name. The worlds of Askonia are still held under the boot of the oppressor. The fight must go on.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraAskWhat2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_askWhatUmbra,"$saidGensKato = true
FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts","""Yeah, what of it?""

She sticks her chin up, striking what is intended to be a defiant expression.

""I'm here to fight the brutal oppressions and liberate the Askonian System!""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraOptObject,ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts,!$askedIfFamObjects,,,"imoinuKato_sayObject:""Doesn't your family, your gens, object?""",
