FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraDardanOpts","""He is."" She looks taken aback, but quickly recovers her composure.

""You met him? He's still on Mazalot suppressing the Luddics for the gens, I suppose.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraDardanOptA,ImoinuKantoUmbraDardanOpts,$global.angeredDardanKato,,,"ImoinuKanto_dardanOptAsel:""He is. He became... rather angry at me.""",
