ImoinuKatoUmbraDardanOptAsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ImoinuKanto_dardanOptAsel,"AdjustRepActivePerson COOPERATIVE 1
FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts","""You don't say!""

She laughs. You can hear the echo of long-running sibling conflict.

""Of course he's angry. He's there on behalf of the gens to hammer the Luddic faithful into compliant citizens of the League! The only tools he can imagine are force and fear because he thinks the Luddics are irrational sub-humans. Like stupid, simple animals.""

She shakes her head, ""He can't help but fail.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraDardanOptBsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ImoinuKanto_dardanOptBsel,FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts,"""Dardan, helpful?"" She scoffs. ""Doesn't sound like him.""

""He's there on behalf of the gens to hammer the Luddic faithful into compliant citizens of the League! The only tools he can imagine are force and fear because he thinks the Luddics are irrational sub-humans. Like stupid, simple animals.""

She shakes her head, ""He can't help but fail.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraDardanOptCsel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == ImoinuKanto_dardanOptCsel,FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts,"""You don't say!""

She laughs. You can hear the echo of long-running sibling conflict.

""Of course he's unhappy. He's there on behalf of the gens to hammer the Luddic faithful into compliant citizens of the League! The only tools he can imagine are force and fear because he thinks the Luddics are irrational sub-humans. Like stupid, simple animals.""

She shakes her head, ""He can't help but fail.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraObject1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_sayObject,"$askedIfFamObjects = true
FireAll ImoinuKantoUmbraOpts","""Of course they object,"" she says. ""They're part of an aristocratic elite whose position is predicated on the extractive exploitation of the masses.""

 A hint of a smile appears. ""And I've chosen to fight everything they stand for.""",,
ImoinuKantoUmbraSaluteLiar,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == imoinuKato_saySalute
$player.sdtu_liedToImoinuAboutAgent","$judged = true
AdjustRepActivePerson INHOSPITABLE -1","""A pathetic attempt to ingratiate yourself after your previous blunder. Your ruse wouldn't work on a child."" Her eyes narrow.

""Tell me, are you another freelancer hired by my grandmother to come admonish me? Tell her she's wasted her credits.""","imoinuKato_sayMother:""I truly have no idea what you're talking about.""
imoinuKato_sayMotherB:""Are you telling me I could have been paid for this?""",
ImoinuKatoUmbraSalute1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_saySalute,"$judged = true
$expressedSupport = true
AdjustRepActivePerson COOPERATIVE 3","""It is,"" she nods. ""And I'm glad you can see that, despite the... difficulties.""","imoinuKato_saySalute2a:""Difficulties?""
imoinuKato_saySalute2b:""You mean, being stuck on a pirate-infested icecube with no fleet.""",
ImoinuKatoUmbraSalute2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_saySalute2b,"$option = imoinuKato_saySalute2a 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","She opens her mouth, then pauses, and closes it.

""Yes. That's... fair.""",,
ImoinuKatoUmbraSalute2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_saySalute2a,,"""The ARC navy is... it's mostly opportunistic pirates. A few have good ideology, but most..."" She sighs. ""It's not easy.""

""The United Front is united more by bickering and infighting than solidarity. The Charterists are eternally fundraising, keeping all the credits for running their tours and parties instead of fighting. The Volturnian Self Defense Covenant puts up a real fight, but they're held back from true revolutionary consciousness by the reactionary elements of Luddic ideology. So all they can do is bleed out into that ocean of theirs...""","imoinu_goKazeron:""Why not go back to Kazeron and find a way to support the fight from inside the League?""
imoinu_goVolturn:""What if you go to Volturn. Help the, um, Volturn Covenant?""",
ImoinuUmbraGoKazeron,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinu_goKazeron,FireAll ImoinuUmbraGoOpts,"""No..."" She shakes her head.

""On Kazeron, the gens are too dominant. The moment I stepped off the shuttle they'd have some doctor declare me insane and lock me up in an estate dome on the dark side of Draugr so I stop 'embarrassing our gens'.""",,
ImoinuUmbraGoVolturn,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinu_goVolturn,FireAll ImoinuUmbraGoOpts,"""Yeah, maybe."" She sounds entirely unenthusiastic.

""The Luddics either get upset or preachy if you try to explain proper revolutionary consciousness to them. Don't get me wrong, they've got good people, but...""

She shakes her head. ""I'd go crazy. Or they would.""

""Don't get me wrong though, the ARC has a network on Volturn too, of course. We're not as strong as the VSDC, but we're fighting too! The problem is supplies, funding...""",,
ImoinuKantoUmbraDoomed1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == imoinuKato_sayDoomed,"$judged = true
AdjustRepActivePerson INHOSPITABLE -1","""I see now."" Her eyes narrow.

""Tell me, how much did my grandmother pay you to come admonish me? You can tell her she's wasted her credits. Again.""","imoinuKato_sayMother:""Your grandmother hired a freelancer to talk you out of... this?""
imoinuKato_sayMotherB:""Are you telling me I could have been paid for this?""",
