$wasOffended = true","Her eyes narrow.

""'A doomed cause'? And you claim to be a deep-cover agent who is part of the ARC.""

""I think you're a liar,"" she says.

""A hired killer for execs and admirals, a profiteer selling drugs to the masses with one hand and harvesting black market organs with the other.""","imoinuKato_sayDoomedArcLie2:""Hold on, now...""",
