!$market.printedForgeDesc","$market.printedForgeDesc = true 0
FireBest MarketPostOpen","Long-abandoned factory rings thrum with activity and glimmer with new construction. Fresh ship hulls are assembled, sharp ribs laid with armored plates and fit with weapons of war. Kanta has installed a pristine nanoforge here, and her family is making use of it.",,
kpFusionLamp,KPFindGifts,"PlayerHasCargo orbital_fusion_lamp
$kpNumGifts < 5
$kpNumGifts++",,,kpFusionLamp:An Orbital Fusion Lamp,
kpFusionLampSel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == kpFusionLamp,"AddRemoveAnyItem SPECIAL orbital_fusion_lamp -1
KantaCMD installFusionLamp","""What,"" Cydonia's lip curls into a sneer, ""would the mighty warlord do with-"" 

There's a heavy clank, all turn to find that Kanta is standing, trailing trophies and tubes. ""WE ACCEPT,"" her vocoder blasts, the voice inhuman. ""Vacuum AND fire shall greet those prisoners I wish to dispose.""

The pirates of the court cheer to this, stomping their feet and slamming weapon-stocks into the deck plates.",kpLeaveProt:Continue,
