$willGiveNanoforge = true 0
FireBest PLCheckArgumentsEnough","A strained grimace appears on Reynard Hannan's face, showing new wrinkles where they aren't meant to appear.

""The... rumors, unfortunately, are true. An ugly business, the details of which we need not revisit."" His impressive jawline clenches tightly for a moment.

""For your part in quietly returning the forge of Kazeron to its former glory, I would personally ensure that the League Council fully appreciates your... patriotism.""",,
