PKHackStoryStart2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pk_hackStoryStart2,FireAll PKHackStoryOptions,"You couldn't quite say how you heard the words. It was as if they were spoken without a voice. Your senior officers all take a step back from the empty holo-display, eyes wide; shocked into silence.

Your comms officer exchanges a look with you - yes, they heard it too; no, they don't know what it is. They tear their eyes away from the nothing in the holo-display and start pulling telemetry into a buffer through their datapad interface.",,
