pk_turnInPatherSel,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pk_turnInPather,,"$PersonName's hands go together and $heOrShe closes $hisOrHer eyes, mumbling what sounds like thanks to Providence.

""I confess, captain, I did not expect you to return,"" $heOrShe says.","pk_givePKPather:Make arrangements to turn it over
pk_uselessPather:""Isn't it useless without the codes?""
pk_whatPather:""I want you to promise you're not going to use this on people.""
cutCommLink:""Um. Never mind."" (cut comm link)",
