PKGiveToArroyo,PopulateOptions,"$isPerson
$id == arroyo
!$player.turnedInPlanetkiller
PlayerHasCargo planetkiller",,,"pk_turnInArroyo1:""Pssst, do you want a planetkiller?""",
pk_turnInArroyoSel1again,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == pk_turnInArroyo1
$madePKofferOnce
!$cameToYouSecondWithPK",,"""This again."" He gives you a cold look, ""I hope you haven't been peddling this forbidden Domain-era weapon of mass destruction responsible for billions of deaths to anyone else before coming crawling back to me.""

He's ice-cold.

""Right?""","pk_turnInArroyo3a:""Absolutely.""
pk_turnInArroyo3b:""Well...""",
