$madePKofferOnce
$cameToYouSecondWithPK",FireAll DialogOptions,"""No,"" he says. ""And we're not having this conversation about you selling me a weapon of mass destruction.""",,
pk_turnInArroyoSel1againJoke,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == pk_turnInArroyo1
$madePKjoke ",,"""You already made that joke,"" he says. ""It wasn't funny the first time.""","pk_turnInArroyo2:""I'm serious this time. Planetkillers are a rare commodity. I thought of you; you're rich.""
pk_turnInArroyo1joke:""Just trying to brighten your day.""",
pk_turnInArroyoSel1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pk_turnInArroyo1,,"Arroyo is, naturally, taken aback at your claim.

""You serious?"" He looks at you, assessing.","pk_turnInArroyo2:""Deadly serious. Planetkillers are a rare commodity. I thought of you because you're rich.""
pk_turnInArroyo1joke:""No, just a little joke.""",
