$player.commissionFactionId == luddic_church",SetOptionColor pkHandInHesperus_start highlight,,20:pkHandInHesperus_start:Open a coded comms channel to discuss the planetkiller weapon with the Knights of Ludd,
pkHandInHesperus2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pkHandInHesperus_start,,"As a commissioned militant of the Church of Galactic Redemption, you have been given a set of codes allowing you to more easily coordinate with both fellow militants of the Church and the Knights of Ludd.

Using this access to link in to the Knights' comms network earns your comms officer a rebuke from a Knight-novice who appears to be practically a teenager.",pkHandIn_hesp3:Take over the comms and emphasize the importance of your mission,
pkHandInHesperus3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pkHandIn_hesp3,,"The Knight-novice is easily cowed by your authority - and, it appears, the content of your admonishment triggers some kind of oversight. 

The image flickers, and a grizzled Knight-captain appears. Without greeting, he says ""He wishes to speak with you. Pray bide a moment.""

The connection flickers to static, then to a simple holding pattern. The technology of the Knights of Ludd is crude but reliable",pkHandIn_hesp4:Wait to speak with whoever 'he' is,
pkHandInHesperus4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pkHandIn_hesp4,"BeginConversation oak
$player.metGideonOak = true
SetPersonHidden oak false","After nearly two minutes, the connection flickers into life once again.

According to your comm-link metadata it is the Excubitor Orbis of Hesperus who has appeared before you, 

""I am Gideon Oak,"" he says, his stern gaze fixed on you.

Then he waits, patient as stone.","pkHandIn_hesp5:""I have a planetkiller weapon to give into the custody of the Knights of Ludd.""
cutCommLink:Cut the comm link",
pkHandInHesperus5,DialogOptionSelected,$option == pkHandIn_hesp5,,"He silently considers you, and your words. 

The moment draws uncomfortably long before he, evidently, decides that he believes you. 

""Know that this must be kept from the Hegemony,"" he says slowly. ""They claim unholy inheritance of the old Domain and would be loathe to see us destroy a piece of it.""","pkHandIn_hesp6:""I understand. I will transfer the planetkiller now.""
cutCommLink:Cut the comm link",
