!$hasMarket
!$global.leftCrewOnSentinel
!$global.discoveredSentinel
Highlight  ""transmits a weak transponder signal""","ShowDefaultVisual
FireAll PKSentinelOptions","The bitterly cold surface of $fullName rolls beneath you, the poles locked in endless winter. Only lucky arrangements of weather produce marginal habitability in small regions.

And indeed, there is a weak radio signal detectable in the midst of just such a conjunction. It transmits a weak transponder signal in Hegemony-standard protocol; an old code, but it checks out.

A sensor sweep reveals a tiny settlement with signs of primitive industry and agriculture.","
",
