$showedHegCommission score:2",,"Skiron's eyes go wide, though she manages to control her voice. ""Ah,"" she says. ""I truly cannot speak more of... that. The Protocols.""

""But if,"" she looks almost pleading, attempting to divert her mind around the demands of the all-important Protocols, ""-If a loyal citizen of the Hegemony, commissioned or otherwise, recovered a weapon of mass destruction, then they should return it to Hegemony authorities for safekeeping with all haste and secrecy."" ",pk_sentinelFoundPKHegCom2:Continue,
