$player.ethosCocky++","You share a few flattering quips and a story about some prominent local officials, earning quiet, cheers, or laughter at the appropriate moments.

You shift the monologue toward a light-hearted review of each of the Luddic shrines you visited, earning tense laughter, but you manage to turn what at first appeared to be subversive implications into a heartfelt conclusion which results in earnest applause from spacer and Faithful alike.

Some of the stories might even be true. Or not. What's important is the connections you're making - or pretending you already made - with the local power-players.",barHRE_transitionOut:Continue,
