$faction.isHostile",$ignorePlayerCommRequests = true 7,"The $post gives you a strange look, then glances at a secondary display. Then, looking slightly alarmed, back at you.

""Wait, are you-"" $HisOrHer eyes dart to the display. ""You're $playerName! Get yourself off of my comm-link.""

$HeOrShe mashes at the cut-off button.",,# don't actually flip the first-time flag 'cause player didn't get the essential game info out of this
