#SalvageGenFromSeed
#FireBest ShowSalvageEntityDetails
#FireBest SalvageCheckHostile","An abandoned orbital habitat, thought to be cold and dead for tens of cycles at least, possibly hundreds.

You visited here and your salvors found a tiny bubble of life sustaining itself off the backup of a backup powered by a fission battery. You found it to be a precious thing, a miracle of life, and declared that there would be no salvage.

Knowing now what exactly to look for, your sensors officers confirms that a tiny green window still glows on the inside hub of this orbital habitat, despite all odds.",defaultLeave:Leave,
