# Onslaught Mk.I interaction,,,,,,"# aka the ""Oneslaught"" :D -dgb"
mk1_wreckDetailsFirstTime,ShowSalvageEntityDetails,"$customType == wreck
$onslaughtMkI score:1000
!$encountered","ShowDefaultVisual
$encountered = true","The vessel, heavily battered and with a minimal power signature, drifts through space. The silhouette is instantly recognizable but somehow crudely foreign.",,
mk1_wreckDetails,ShowSalvageEntityDetails,"$customType == wreck
$onslaughtMkI score:1000",ShowDefaultVisual,"The ancient war machine drifts, it's hull battered and scarred by aeons-old war. Power signs are minimal ",,
