AddTextSmall ""T H R E A T  D E T E C T E D"" bad
SalvageSpecialInteraction","""Got a long-range hit..."" Sensors reports. ""Something is approaching our orbit. Without maneuvers we have one shift? Two? Half a day, max. What are your orders, $playerSirOrMadam?""",,
