$gaDHO_stage == VISIT_ELEK
!$global.gaDHO_rejectedOffer",,,3:gaDHO_visitElekStart2:Ask where you could find the office of Cornelius Elek,
gaDHOvisitElekStart2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekStart2,SetPersonHidden elek false,"A strange expression crosses the junior agent's face at your question, but it is instantly replaced by a return to bland pleasantness.

""Of course, captain. I presume you have an appointment? Academician Elek can be... busy.""","gaDHO_visitElekStart3:""He sent me a personal invitation.""",
gaDHOvisitElekStart2b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekStart2
$global.gaDHO_foundArrayFirst",SetPersonHidden elek false,"A strange expression crosses the junior agent's face at your question, but it is instantly replaced by a return to bland pleasantness.

""Of course, captain. I presume you have an appointment? Academician Elek can be... busy.""","gaDHO_visitElekStart3:""I found his... experiment in the Fringe. I'm returning it to him.""",
gaDHOvisitElekStart3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekStart3,$gaDHO_askedForPay = false,"""Of course, $playerSirOrMadam,"" the agent says. ""If you'll come right this way.""

You are led through the station's primary transport hub and are soon deposited in an airy plaza halfway around the ring of the station. Your junior agent leads you through crowds of students and past a few tight-lipped academicians who scurry by, clutching datapads.

The junior agent fills the air with the sort of patter they must have saved for first-cycle students, pointing out landmarks and remarking upon departments and figures of interest to niche fields of study.",gaDHO_visitElekStart4:Continue,
gaDHOvisitElekStart4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekStart4,,"You arrive in a quiet hall off the main concourse, only a couple decks above the station rim. An open volume ringed by railings provides a dizzying view of the clouds of Pontus 'below' you.

""Third door on the right, $playerSirOrMadam."" The junior agent makes a tight smile then disappears.",gaDHO_visitElek:Enter,
gaDHOvisitElek,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElek,"BeginConversation elek
$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","A man in academician's robes is buried in a holodisplay. Several moons appear to orbit his head.

""What have I told you hooligans about office hours?"" he shouts out. ""They don't start until-"" 

He finally looks and realizes you aren't one of his students. 

""Ah."" He adopts a look of stern prognostication, cradling his hands together as glowing orbs circle above. ""I suppose greetings are in order. I am Academician Cornelius Elek, senior vice-chair of the Planetology Department of the Galatia Academy.""

""And you are?""",,
gaDHOvisitElekIntroMet,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro
$player.metElek",$gaDHO_askedForPay = false,,"gaDHO_visitElekIntro2:""I'm $playerName. We've spoken before. I returned your datacore.""",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro,"$player.metElek = true
$gaDHO_askedForPay = false",,"gaDHO_visitElekIntro2:""I'm $playerName. You invited me to see you.""",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro2,,"Elek stares at you, the spark of recognition failing to ignite.

""I'm afraid I don't recall,"" he says. ""What, may I ask, is the purpose of your visit?""","gaDHO_visitElekIntro3:""You sent a message about doing a job.""
gaDHO_visitElekIntro3c:""You sent a message about 'an old mystery'. I'd like to help solve it.""
gaDHO_visitElekIntro3b:""You sent me a message. I was interested in the 'vast fortune'.""",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro3b,"$player.ethosMercenary++
$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro3c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro3c,"$player.ethosKnowledge++
$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro3,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro3,,"""Oh yes, of course. You should have simply said so.""

He rushes out of his holodisplay to pick up a datapad, then places himself behind a large desk, waving you toward a chair. Unfortunately it is occupied by a battered datacore, the sort used in long-range probes.

""Now then,"" he taps at his datapad, failing to notice your obstacle.

""The mystery concerns a very old dataset which has been in the Galatia Academy archives for somewhat more than two hundred cycles. I stumbled upon it in the course of my studies - well, in fact, I was discussing the old archives with... a friend, a wealthy patron of the sciences. A comment they made reminded me of its existence.""",gaDHO_visitElekIntro4:Remain standing,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro4,,"""As it happens, this dataset is a recording of telemetry from a Domain-era sensor array out on what we now call the Fringe. It was somewhat more civilized back when this data was captured, though not perhaps by much.""

Elek chuckles softly at his wit.

""As for the dataset, we only really have a complete sourcing header. Our copy is mostly corrupted due to anomalous  degradation during hyperwave transmission and then over 200 cycles of low-priority storage.""

He shakes his head with deep disappointment at the mistakes made by someone else.","gaDHO_visitElekIntro5c:""This chair has a datacore in it.""
gaDHO_visitElekIntro5b:Cough pointedly and look toward the chair
gaDHO_visitElekIntro6:Remain standing",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro5b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro5b,"$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro6 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",He either doesn't notice or doesn't acknowledge your signal.,,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro5c,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro5c,"$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro6 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He snaps out of his reverie and looks at the chair.

""So it does,"" he says. ""Please don't touch it.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro6,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro6,,"""In any event,"" Elek cradles his hands, looking into an imagined middle-distance. ""This patron and, ah, friend offered to fund a project to recover an intact copy of the data.""

""From the source."" He smiles, quite pleased with himself. ""An expedition shall be made to the original sensor array! Your name came up, captain.""","gaDHO_visitElekIntro7:""Find the sensor array, extract the data. Sounds simple.""",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro7,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro7,,"""When put like that, yes."" He stands, placing his hands together behind his back, and begins pacing.

""I shall provide you with a scientific hardware package my students have prepared. It is far from simple, I assure you of that! Have your technicians attach it to the sensor array and it will carry out the necessary operations.""

""That's not all, however."" He pauses to look at you with a sly smile.","gaDHO_visitElekIntro8:""Oh?""
gaDHO_visitElekIntro8b:""I haven't agreed to anything yet, Elek.""",
gaDHOvisitElekIntro8b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro8b,"$option = gaDHO_visitElekIntro8 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Mm? That's 'Academician Elek', if you please. And of course you haven't agreed, I haven't explained the task fully. Now where was I...""",,
gaDHOvisitElekIntro8,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekIntro8,FireAll gaDHOvisitElekHub,"""I propose that once you acquire the data and my algorithm extracts the targeting coordinates, you then travel to the indicated location which lies at the heart of all of this effort. Explore what is to be explored, find what is to be found. You will bring back no mere long-range scan, but a thorough investigation!""

""Think of the science, think of the glory! And,"" he winks, ""You must be thinking of that 'vast fortune'. I do believe that Director Gla... that my 'friend' will be more than delighted by this fait accompli.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekHubOptC,gaDHOvisitElekHub,!$askedWhatLookingFor,,,"gaDHO_visitElekHubSelC:""Why is this data so important? What did this sensor array find?""",
gaDHOvisitElekHubOptA,gaDHOvisitElekHub,!$askedVastFortune,,,"gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA:""In your message, you mentioned a reward. The words 'vast fortune' were used.""",
gaDHOvisitElekHubOptA2,gaDHOvisitElekHub,"$askedVastFortune
!$askedVastFortune2",,,"gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA2:""I didn't get a clear answer about this reward. How much is it?""",
gaDHOvisitElekHubOptB,gaDHOvisitElekHub,"!$askedWhoFriend
