gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA4b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA4b,$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedTriTachyonAsPatron = true,"""Um, I'm sure, that uh,"" he stammers, looking annoyed.

""I'm sure my patron will cover all expenses,"" he declares finally. ""We are, after all, dealing with Tri-""

His mouth shuts and he looks intently at you. Hoping that you didn't hear the obvious. ","gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA5a:""Tri-Tachyon is backing your project?""
gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA5b:""Glad to hear it. I expect more than 100,000 credits, plus hazard.""",
gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA5a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA5a,,"""I, um. Don't be absurd! I could have been starting to say any number of words.""

He doesn't look confident.","gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA6a:""So it is Tri-Tachyon. They can afford at least 200,000 credits, plus hazard.""
gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA6b:""I won't work for Tri-Tachyon.""",
gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA5b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA5b,"$global.gaDHO_playerAgreedTo100k = true
FireAll gaDHOvisitElekHub","""Fine."" He sighs, rolling his eyes. ""I'm sure it'll be... no problem.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA6a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA6a,"$global.gaDHO_playerAgreedTo200k = true
FireAll gaDHOvisitElekHub","He rolls his eyes and lets out a long sigh.

""Fine, fine. I'm... sure it won't be a problem. Probably.""

""That's a lot of credits."" He looks at you accusingly. ""It should be spent on primary research, not gilding rocket ships, but."" He holds up a hand, as if to contain the outburst he presumes will come. ""I will hold my tongue. If the expedition is as much of a success as I believe it will be, the dear price shall be worth it.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA6b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA6b,"Highlight ""200,000""
$saidNoToTT = true 0
$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedZGRasPatron = true
$global.gaDHO_playerAgreedTo200k = true
FireAll gaDHOvisitElekHub","""Whyever not? Say what you will about business ethics, they're unmatched in their commitment to advancing unrestricted basic research. And Director Glamor-Rotanev has a particular understanding of the importance of...""

He stops, and licks his lips, seeming to realize that he's giving even more away.

""Let's agree on 200,000 credits, yes?"" He looks at you accusingly. ""It should be spent on primary research, not gilding rocket ships, but."" He holds up a hand, as if to contain the outburst he presumes will come. ""I shall hold my tongue, and so will you. If the expedition is as much of a success as I believe it will be, the dear price shall be worth it and I'm certain that... that my patron will pay.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekHubSelA4bKnow,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekHubSelA4b
$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedZGRasPatron",,"""Um, I'm sure, that uh,"" he stammers, looking annoyed.

""I'm sure my patron will cover all expenses,"" he declares finally. ""We are, after all, dealing with Tri-""

He pauses, recovering his composure. ""We are, as I mentioned, dealing with a patron who can mobilize great wealth to fund the sciences.""","gaDHO_visitElekHubSelZGRa:""Glad to hear it. I expect more than 100,000 credits, plus hazard.""
