#ShowDefaultVisual","""Very well. I'll simply find an adventurer who is interested in the advancement of human knowledge, to say nothing of wealth and glory.""

""Good day."" He hits the cut-off, and you're left with the logo of the Galatia Academy Planetology Department.",0:cutCommLink:Cut the commlink,
