Call $global.gaDHO_ref updateStage","This Academician Elek of the Galatia Academy could not have possibly known his sensor data would lead to... this. Could he?

You might be justified to ask him with an urgency proportional to the magnitude of the situation you now find yourself in.

Only if you manage to survive this 'Threat' and make it back to the Core Worlds, of course.",gaDHO_mk1continue8interruptOut:Continue,# didn't talk to Elek ever
