gaDHOendingHeBelieves2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingHeBelieves2,,"Elek begins shuffling through your data, accessing his larger holodisplay with his datapad. Images, charts, holoclips start appearing around him. You watch his face turn from exasperated skepticism to simply fearful.

