gaDHOendingLastWordA,gaDHOendingLastWord,$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedZGRasPatron score:2,,"It's clear Elek is in too deep and wants out.

Someone 200 cycles ago knew where to look. And so too did Director Glamor-Rotanev of Tri-Tachyon.",,
gaDHOendingLastWordB,gaDHOendingLastWord,$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedTriTachyonAsPatron,,"It's clear Elek is in too deep and wants out.

Someone 200 cycles ago knew where to look and so too did someone at Tri-Tachyon. Whoever they are.",,
gaDHOendingLastWordC,gaDHOendingLastWord,"$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedZGRasPatron score:2
$player.metZGR",,"It's clear Elek is in too deep and wants out.

Someone 200 cycles ago knew where to look. And so too did Zunya Glamor-Rotanev.",,
gaDHOendingLastWordD,gaDHOendingLastWord,$global.gaDHO_elekMentionedPatron,,"It's clear Elek is in too deep and wants out.

