gaDHOendingLastWordE,gaDHOendingLastWord,,,"It's clear Elek is in too deep and wants out.

Someone 200 cycles ago knew where to look, too, and you know for what.",,
gaDHOendingWrapUp,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUp,FireAll gaDHOendingWrapUpOpts,"Elek gives you a skeptical glare then begins shuffling through your data, accessing his larger holodisplay with his datapad. Images, charts, holoclips start appearing around him.

The Onslaught Mk.I, salvors exploring its bizarre corridors. The sensor modifications, 'Threat Detected'. The words burned into your memory.

He stares for a long moment with an unsure expression.

Then he quite consciously resettles his composure, and speaks. ""Tired, sophomoric japery. Nothing more.""",,
gaDHOendingWrapUpOptsB,gaDHOendingWrapUpOpts,PlayerFleetHasShipWithBaseHull onslaught_mk1,,,"gaDHO_endingWrapUp2b:""Look at my $shipOrFleet. The Onslaught Mk.I is in orbit.""",
gaDHOendingWrapUpOptsA,gaDHOendingWrapUpOpts,,,,"gaDHO_endingWrapUp2a:""I've been entirely honest with you, Elek.""",
gaDHOendingWrapUp2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUp2b,"$option = gaDHO_endingWrapUp3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","He says nothing, motionless for several seconds, then taps at his datapad. His expression is grim as he sets his datapad deliberately onto his desk. Is it your imagination, or are his hands trembling?

""A holofeed hack, nothing more,"" he insists. ""It's trivial to fake, with resources and, and t-time. It's nothing at all.""

""I'm... we're done here, captain."" Elek's eyes wander around his office, as if searching for escape. ""G-good day, $playerSirOrMadam.""",,
gaDHOendingWrapUp2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUp2a,"$option = gaDHO_endingWrapUp3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Will you be so 'honest' with COMSEC when they come smashing down your airlock? Will you?"" His eyes are fiery.

He holds the fierce look for just a moment longer, then visibly deflates. ""It'll be... fine. My patron... it was all fakery, of course. A misunderstanding...""

""I'll... we're done here, captain."" Elek's eyes wander around his office, as if searching for escape. ""G-good day, $playerSirOrMadam.""",,
gaDHOendingWrapUp3a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUp3
!$global.gaDHO_gotReward
$gaDHO_askedForPay",,,"gaDHO_endingHeBelievesPay2:""Hold on- we're not done 'til I get paid.""
gaDHO_endingWrapUpNoPay:""I will forgo payment. Advancement of knowledge is wealth enough.""",
gaDHOendingWrapUpNoPay,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUpNoPay,"$player.ethosKnowledge++
$option = gaDHO_endingHeBelievesOut 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Oh!"" From his surprise, you'd swear he hadn't even thought of paying you.

""I... yes. Good. We can put this all... behind us. My patron... it's going to be fine."" Elek manages a sickly smile. ",,
gaDHOendingWrapUp3b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_endingWrapUp3,"$global.gaDHO_completed = true
