ShowDefaultVisual
$global.gaDHO_playerMadeElekMad = true","It is unsurprising that an ivory torus academician like Elek would lack an appreciation for your need for compensation to reward undertaking a hazardous mission, but so it goes. He is unlikely to reveal the motivation behind his project to analyze the particular sensor array which was looking at the location of the Onslaught Mk.I.

Elek can't have acted alone. Someone knew where to look.",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltTransferData,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltTransferData,"AddTextSmall ""Transmitted exploration data to Academician Elek"" highlight
$gaDHO_transferredData = true","""Yes, good. It's working!"" Elek watches the progress on his datapad with greedy anticipation.

""...Finally, my data.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt:""What is it? What were you looking for?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltTransferDataB,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltTransferData
$madeRewardDemand
!$global.gaDHO_turnedDownPayment
!$global.gaDHO_gotReward","AddTextSmall ""Transmitted exploration data to Academician Elek"" highlight
$gaDHO_transferredData = true","""Yes, good. It's working!"" Elek watches the progress on his datapad with greedy anticipation.

""...Finally, my data.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltPaymentPlease:""Now the payment, please.""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltTransferDataB2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltPaymentPlease,"AddCredits 50000
$global.gaDHO_gotReward = true","""Yes, yes, but a moment,"" he says testily.

A couple taps on the datapad - harder than strictly necessary - and your own TriPad pings greedily.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt:""So what is it? What were you looking for?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltIntro4,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltIntro4,,"""Indeed it would,"" he says. ""For that's where it was looking when it picked up something unusual a little over 200 cycles ago.""

""Would you be so good as to transfer the data you collected? It is very valuable."" He picks up his datapad and taps at it, then looks at you pointedly. ""Um. Valuable to science, that is. Abstract knowledge, not much use to the likes of... to freelancers like yourself, I should say.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltTransferData:Transfer the data recovered from the sensor array
gaDHO_visitElekAltAboutThatPayment:""Valuable, you say? Yes, we should discuss payment.""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWhatIsItReroute,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt
$didExplanation","$option = gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsItAgain 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected",,,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWhatIsIt,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt,$global.gaDHO_elekMentionedPatron = true,"""Ah,"" he tears his eyes from the datapad.

""It's a mystery surrounding a very old dataset which has been in the Galatia Academy archives for a very long time. I stumbled upon it in the course of my studies - I was discussing the breadth of the archives with... a friend, a wealthy patron of the sciences, in fact. A comment they made reminded me of this half-corrupted enigma...""

Elek has transitioned fully into lecturing mode. He cradles his hands, occasionally pointing at abstract concepts or or waving them when hitting a particularly important detail.",gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt2:Continue,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWhatIsIt2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt2,"$didExplanation = true
$option = gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt3 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""...And that dataset consisted of telemetry from a Domain-era sensor array out on what we now call the Fringe. It was somewhat more civilized back when the data was captured, though not perhaps by much.""

Elek chuckles softly at his wit.

""As for the data, only the sourcing header is intact. Our copy is mostly corrupted due to anomalous  degradation during hyperwave transmission followed by 200 cycles of low-priority storage.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWhatIsIt3a,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt3
$gaDHO_transferredData",FireAll gaDHOvisitElekAltAskHub,"""But your copy,"" he smiles, ""is complete! Um,"" he taps at his datapad for a moment. ""Mostly, anyway. Significantly more than the old one. This is a fabulous find!""",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWhatIsIt3b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsIt3
!$gaDHO_transferredData",FireAll gaDHOvisitElekAltAskHub,"""But if I'm right,"" he smiles, ""your copy of the data is uncorrupted! Um, theoretically, anyway."" He taps at his datapad for a moment, opening a datastream.

""If you would be so kind?""",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltAskHubOptA,gaDHOvisitElekAltAskHub,"$didExplanation
$gaDHO_transferredData",,,"gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsItAgain:""So what is at those coordinates in the Abyss?",
