FireAll gaDHOvisitElekAltAboutPayCheck","""Payment?"" Elek narrows his eyes. ""I cannot comprehend your mercenary impulse in the face of such a discovery.""

He sighs, then softens his tone. ""But, yes, the logic of our economic arrangements dictate that scientific service ought be compensated.""

A datapad appears in his hands and he taps something on, a little harder than strictly necessary. ""I shall pay you 50,000 credits for recovering the data. Rather generous, I think.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltPayment50k:""I accept your offer.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltPayment100k:""More like 100k, due to hazard. I made it, unlike your freelancer.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltNoPayment:""I will forgo payment. Advancement of knowledge is wealth enough.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltNoPaymentLie:""I will forgo payment. Advancement of knowledge is wealth enough."" (lie)",
