gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup0,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWhatIsItAgain,,"""Well."" He pauses to make a thoughtful expression.

""That's a complex question to answer. The data,"" he manipulates his datapad, pulling up charts and diagrams in his large holodisplay, ""It provides the opportunity for many interpretations, often contradictory...""

He proceeds like this with little sign of stopping. It's soon clear to you that he doesn't know.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup1:""My people say it's pointing at a rock in the Abyss. Something happened there.""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup1,,"""-Yes, of course."" You see a flash of annoyance as his lecture is interrupted, but Elek manages to adjust to a new line of discourse.

""A rogue planet, a singular celestial body bereft of a stellar primary - or any other, for that matter. Cold, dark, and alone; bereft of parent star, flung into the sparse wastes between the arms of our galaxy.""

""There are many such bodies although, unfortunately, we only rarely have the opportunity to study them closely these days...""

He begins speaking at length on the study of rogue planets.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup2:""If you don't know what, then why? Why this array data? Why these coordinates?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup2,,"""I didn't say I- it's a, presumably, unexplored-"" Elek is caught off-balance again. ""The point is...""

He sighs, surrendering a small battle.

""It was... my friend, the patron of the sciences. Given their, ah, extreme wealth and interest in acting as a sponsor of pure discovery, they had the notion to fund an expedition to solve my little mystery. I thought it was a capital notion! All was arranged. Then, of course... and you found... well."" 

He goes quiet, finally.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup3:""Who is your patron? If they're so wealthy, I'm sure I've heard of them.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup3z:""Are you sure your patron is only interested in pure discovery?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup3z,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup3z,$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedTriTachyonAsPatron = true,"""Most certainly!"" he sputters, ""She assured me, at length, and despite her position in Tri-""

His mouth shuts and he looks intently at you. Hoping that you didn't hear the obvious.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2a:""I shall say nothing, of course.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2b:""Tri-Tachyon is backing your project?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup3a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup3,,"""Mm,"" he frowns, carefully recomposing an expression of lofty erudition.

""They have asked me not to reveal their identity. I believe, if anything, the humility they show in not taking public credit for their contributions to this great academy - and my department in particular - are a sign of dedication to pure scientific advancement. Truly, it is a noble undertaking.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup4a:""Are you sure you can't tell me?"" ",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup4a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup4a,"$option = gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapUp1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Alas."" He shakes his head, ""It would be unthinkable.""",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapup3b,DialogOptionSelected,"$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup3
$global.gaDHO_turnedDownPayment",,"""Mm,"" he frowns, carefully maintaining a thoughtful expression.

""They have asked me not to reveal their identity. I believe, if anything, the humility they show in not taking public credit for their contributions to this great academy - and my department in particular - are a sign of dedication to pure scientific advancement. Truly, it is a noble undertaking.""

He lets only a moment pass. ""Not unlike your own refusal to accept payment - a brave, unexpected act.""","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapUp0:""I feel they are a kindred spirit. Indeed, are not we three all?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapupTT1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapup4b,$global.gaDHO_elekRevealedTriTachyonAsPatron = true,"He chuckles softly to himself, looking pleased. ""I'm not sure the Director would quite agree, she is..."" Elek looks upward, as if to the stars, putting forward a thoughtful expression. ""She is a woman of great vision, far greater than I would have expected from a lofty position in such an ostensibly profit-driven enterprise.""

""By revealing what I have to you, captain, I am trusting in your discretion,"" he says with a solemn nod. ""I dare not say more, for Tri-""

His mouth shuts and he looks intently at you. Hoping that you didn't hear the obvious.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2a:""I shall say nothing, of course.""
gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2b:""Tri-Tachyon is backing your project?""",
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapupTT2a,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2a,"$player.gaDHO_promisedElekNotToRevealPatron = true
$option = gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapUp1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Good. That's... very good of you, captain."" An extra wrinkle remains on his forehead.",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapupTT2b,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2b,,"""I, um. Don't be absurd! I could have been starting to say any number of words.""

He doesn't look confident.","gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2c:""I shall say nothing, of course."" (lie)
gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapupTT2a:""I shall say nothing, of course.""",
