$option = gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapUp1 0
FireBest DialogOptionSelected","""Indeed,"" he gives a tight smile, not taking the bait.",,
gaDHOvisitElekAltWrapUp1,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltWrapUp1,,"""Regardless,"" he sweeps his arm, ""You have the opportunity of a lifetime before you - with your capabilities, you can travel to those coordinates deep in the Abyss and discover its secrets.""

""Just... bring me back a record of what you find."" Elek's eyes are fixed on you now, greedily.

""Recordings, telemetry, deep scans. A series of high-energy events happened there over 200 cycles ago, and these sort of phenomena simply don't occur on their own on these lone planetoids.""",gaDHO_visitElekAltEnd:Continue,
gaDHOvisitElekAltEnd,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltEnd,"$global.gaDHO_gotCoordinates = true
Call $global.gaDHO_ref updateStage","His gaze wanders off toward abstraction.

""Spontaneous eruption of a hyperspace dark-matter agglomeration upon interaction with a gravity well at sufficient velocity? A simple collision between celestial bodies? It would be an astoundingly rare event - one in a billion cycles...""

Academician Elek begins to lose himself in hypothetical scenarios, mapping them into his holodisplay and comparing simulated interactions with the dataset you provided.

His vision is bound to the walls of his ivory torus - while yours may soon look upon that which lies at the heart of this mystery, in the darkness beyond the dark.",gaDHO_visitElekAltEnd2:Leave him to his musing,
gaDHOvisitElekAltEnd2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_visitElekAltEnd2,"EndConversation
ShowDefaultVisual",You're not sure Elek even noticed you leave.,,
"# gaDHO talk to Academician Cornelius Elek during the mission
NOT $global.gaDHO_foundArrayFirst",,,,,,
