Call $global.gaDHO_ref updateData
$gaDHO_stage == GO_TO_LOCATION","ShowPersonVisual
FireAll PopulateOptions","""Ah, greetings $playerName!"" Elek looks the happiest you've ever seen him.

""I am most eager to learn of your discoveries in the Abyss- perhaps you could summarize them to me while your mission data is transferred."" He taps at a datapad, ""I've opened a stream.""

He awaits your reply, smiling.","gaDHO_elekGoToLocation2:""I haven't actually gone to the rogue planet yet.""",
gaDHOtalkElekGoToLocation2,DialogOptionSelected,$option == gaDHO_elekGoToLocation2,$ignorePlayerCommRequests = true 1,"""What?"" He's still smiling, but his joy is fading. ""Why not? Did you need to pick up more fuel and supplies? Surely the Galatia system doesn't have the best prices...""

The smile has faded by now.

""Regardless, there's no need to check in with me. Go, get moving! I await your results with the utmost anticipation. And, in the meantime, I'm a very busy man. Good day.""

He turns as he cuts the comms.",cutCommLink:Cut the comm link,
