Base Ship Blueprint,ship_bp,single_bp,,,10000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/blueprint_shiphull.png,ui_chip_pickup,ui_ship_bp_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.ShipBlueprintItemPlugin,,Enables heavy industry to construct ship hulls described by this blueprint.,300
