Base Industry Blueprint,industry_bp,,,,20000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/blueprint_industry.png,ui_chip_pickup,ui_industry_bp_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.IndustryBlueprintItemPlugin,,Contains the technological specifications needed to construct a planet-side industry or structure.,400
