# other items,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
Janus Device,janus,"mission_item, codex_unlockable",,,100000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/janus_device.png,ui_cargo_special_ultratech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_ultratech_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.JanusDevicePlugin,,"This is the first generation Janus Device created by Elissa Zal based on the theories developed by Scylla Coureuse, among others.

While integrated with a hyperdrive this device allows a hyperwave pulse tuned to the unique resonant signatures of two Gates to be transmitted into a Gate aperture. After a tremendous energy input which requires a great quantity of fuel to generate, a temporary link between those Gates is created. One ship or fleet may then transit the Gate network.",0
Planetkiller,planetkiller,"mission_item, codex_unlockable",Domain Restricted,,1000000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/planetkiller.png,ui_cargo_special_military_pickup,ui_cargo_special_military_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.BaseSpecialItemPlugin,,"A specialized warhead capable of sundering a world. Operating principles are only dimly understood and are thought to involve utilizing the world's spin and some form of resonance.

This one is safed and requires authorization codes, possibly long-lost, to become anything more than a complicated, but completely inert piece of machinery.",10
Topographic Data,topographic_data,codex_unlockable,,,50000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/hyperspace_data.png,ui_chip_pickup,ui_modspec_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.BaseSpecialItemPlugin,,"This secure TriPad contains a recent database which holds detailed scans and analyses of the hyperspace topography in the Persean Sector, organized according to traditional guidelines set by the Domain Explorarium. Data such as this is an essential element to successful expeditions outside the core worlds.",500
Wormhole Anchor,wormhole_anchor,codex_unlockable,Domain Restricted,,150000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/wormhole_anchor.png,ui_cargo_special_industrial_pickup,ui_cargo_special_industrial_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.WormholeAnchorPlugin,,"Unfamiliar to the contemporary Persean Sector, this technology saw use by the Domain Explorarium during an era of greatness long past. Can be used to create a wormhole terminus at a stable location.

Initial activation requires antimatter in the form of starship fuel. Requires at least one other active and synchronized terminus to use.",1
Wormhole Scanner,wormhole_scanner,"mission_item, codex_unlockable",Domain Restricted,,100000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/wormhole_scanner.png,ui_cargo_special_ultratech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_ultratech_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.WormholeScannerPlugin,,"A Domain-era artifact which allows a fleet to navigate a natural wormhole, following its many twists, turns, and shifts through higher dimensions. A fleet entering a wormhole without a scanner would never be seen again, at least not as a coherent collection of baryonic matter.

The operating principles can only be dimly guessed at given the present state-of-the-art in the Persean Sector.",2
Fragment Fabricator,fragment_fabricator,"threat, codex_unlockable",Threat,,20000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/fragment_fabricator.png,ui_cargo_special_industrial_pickup,ui_cargo_special_industrial_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.BaseSpecialItemPlugin,,"Unfamiliar technology which nonetheless shares design principles with ancient Domain engineering standards. Various self-modifying adapters accept energy and forge-stock input. There is no command interface. Attempts to interfere with workings provoke aggressive cannibalizing self-repair mechanisms; a major attempt to dismantle the unit would risk self-destruction.

This is clearly a fabricator, because when the inputs are fed, it produces Fragment units, each of which is formed of a unique arrangement of fractal components but which is functionally similar, with slight allowance for scale. Simple on an individual level, the fragments exhibit sophisticated emergent behavior in groups.",400
Threat Processing Unit,threat_processing_unit,"threat, codex_unlockable",Threat,,15000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/threat_processing_unit.png,ui_cargo_special_industrial_pickup,ui_cargo_special_industrial_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.BaseSpecialItemPlugin,,"A basic, modular computational unit. These seem to be employed in large numbers to support the various functions of Threat vessels. Not fully understood, but clearly well below the threshold for being considered an artificial intelligence of any level.",401
Shrouded Substrate,shrouded_substrate,"monster, codex_unlockable",Shrouded Dweller,,5000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/shrouded_substrate.png,ui_cargo_special_biotech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_bio_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.ShroudedSubstratePlugin,,"Anomalous exotic matter held in semi-stable stasis using makeshift containment units. It is recommended to employ hazardous material handling protocols class 6, 7, 9, and 13. Cursory investigation suggests applications in energy projection.",450
Shrouded Thunderhead,shrouded_thunderhead,"monster, codex_unlockable",Shrouded Dweller,,30000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/shrouded_thunderhead.png,ui_cargo_special_biotech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_bio_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.ShroudedHullmodItemPlugin,shrouded_thunderhead,"""This self-sustaining action produces massive energy differentials which are periodically discharged toward its, um, target. I'd never have said a storm could be evil, but now...""

- intercepted audio log, speaker unknown",451
Shrouded Mantle,shrouded_mantle,"monster, codex_unlockable",Shrouded Dweller,,50000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/shrouded_mantle.png,ui_cargo_special_biotech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_bio_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.ShroudedHullmodItemPlugin,shrouded_mantle,"""We can't store energy forever in this theoretical, pretend-plasma. It'll have to go somewhere.""

""-Invert the polarity of the flux converters and flicker the drive field. Boom, a gentle bump to local time-space. By which I mean the ship itself.""

""If it works.""",452
Shrouded Lens,shrouded_lens,"monster, codex_unlockable",Shrouded Dweller,,30000,1000,1,,graphics/icons/cargo/shrouded_lens.png,ui_cargo_special_biotech_pickup,ui_cargo_special_bio_drop,com.fs.starfarer.api.campaign.impl.items.ShroudedHullmodItemPlugin,shrouded_lens,"""Spin it up during combat maneuvers, adjusting the frequency of the 'probes' adapted from drive-field stabilizers. It would create hyperspace fractures which would cause terrible damage to n-space structures. Starships, for instance.""",453{
