Insulated Engine Assembly,insulatedengine,0,,,"engines, defensive, req_spaceport, merc, standard","Engines, Logistics, Defenses, Requires Dock",2500,,,,3,6,9,15,data.hullmods.InsulatedEngines,"Increases the durability of the ship's engines by %s, and the ship's hull integrity by %s.

