Shared Flux Sink,shared_flux_sink,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.SharedFluxSink,"Handles %s of the flux dissipation of all attached modules. If modules are lost during battle, the extra flux dissipation is redistributed among the remaining modules. Up to %s of this extra dissipation applies to hard flux.",Flux/hard flux dissipation bonus as modules are lost.,,graphics/hullmods/shared_flux_sink.png
