B-Deck,bdeck,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.BDeck,"Once per combat, when the fighter replacement rate reaches %s, the fighter launch bays are switched over to operate from a ""B-Deck"".

Standby fighters are launched to rapidly bring the wings back up to full strength, and the fighter replacement rate is set to %s.",Launches fresh wing once per combat and replenishes the replacement rate.,,graphics/hullmods/bdeck.png
