Shielded Cargo Holds,shielded_holds,2,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.ShieldedCargoHolds,"Commonly found on ships that can't always rely on shields to protect their cargo from cosmic radiation. Only a few tweaks are needed to have the shielding confound long-range cargo scans, reducing the probability of contraband being detected.",Improves chance to avoid detection of contraband.,,graphics/hullmods/shielded_cargo_hold.png
Salvage Gantry,repair_gantry,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.RepairGantry,"Increases the resources gained from salvaging abandoned stations, derelicts, floating hulks, and other such by %s/%s/%s/%s, depending on hull size. Only affects the recovery of common resources such as fuel and supplies, and not rare items like blueprints. In addition, %s of the bonus applies to post-battle salvage.",Increases resources gained from salvage.,,graphics/hullmods/repair_gantry.png
Phase Field,phasefield,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.PhaseField,"The ship is able to run a low-grade phase field for extended periods of time, reducing its effective sensor profile by %s.",Reduces fleetwide sensor profile.,,graphics/hullmods/phase_field.png
Flux Shunt,fluxshunt,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.FluxShunt,Allows the ship to dissipate hard flux at %s of the normal rate while shields are on.,Allows dissipation of hard flux while shields are up.,,graphics/hullmods/flux_shunt.png
