Design Compromises,design_compromises,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.DesignCompromises,"The ship's performance suffers from competing design priorities, with multiple bleeding-edge projects integrated too late in the design cycle.

The ship's flux dissipation and capacity, even the nominal base values, are reduced by %s.

The range of ballistic weapons is reduced by %s, the rate of fire of missile weapons is reduced by %s, and the flux generation of energy weapons is increased by %s.

On the plus side, extra nanoforge capacity can be brought online more easily, allowing the installation of a %s despite the ship already having a fighter bay, increasing the number of operational fighter bays to %s.","Reduces missile and ballistic weapon range, and flux dissipation / capacity.",,graphics/hullmods/design_compromises.png
