Monofilament Tow Cable,tow_cable,,,,hide_in_codex,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.campaign.TowCable,"Improves the maximum burn level of the slowest ship in the fleet by 1. Multiple tugs can not be used to speed up the same ship by more than 1.

