High Volition Attractor,high_frequency_attractor,,,,codex_require_related,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.combat.BaseHullMod,An experimental modification allowing high-frequency motes to be warped in by the rift core on board the ship.,Launches more powerful high-frequency motes.,,graphics/hullmods/high_volition_attractor.png
Ablative Armor,ablative_armor,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.AblativeArmor,"An ancient design intended to stop micro-meteorites through sheer volume of material in place, before the advent of ""spaced"" armor.

Reduces the effective armor strength for the damage reduction calculation to %s of its actual value. However, ships of this design tend to carry extremely heavy armor.",Reduces damage reduction by armor.,,graphics/hullmods/ablative_armor.png
Distributed Fire Control,distributed_fire_control,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.DistributedFireControl,"Much of the damage that takes weapons offline is to external control runs and power conduits. This ship's weapons are engineered to operate more independently, reducing their exposure to damage by %s and reducing the EMP damage taken by the ship overall by %s.",Increases weapon durability and reduces EMP damage taken.,,graphics/hullmods/distributed_fire_control2.png
Converted Cargo Bay,converted_bay,1,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.ConvertedCargoBay,"This ship's cargo hold has been converted to house a pair of fighter bays. The improvised manufactory that produces fighter chassis is unreliable, and most components have minor defects. Fighter speed reduced by %s, and damage taken increased by %s.",Pair of improvised fighter bays.,,graphics/hullmods/converted_hangar.png
Special Modifications,andrada_mods,,,,"dmod, codex_require_related",,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.AndradaMods,"During an inspection of an early prototype, the Supreme Executor was heard to comment unfavorably on exposed conduits running along the passageways, and the danger these must pose to the brave and loyal crew under combat conditions. 

The new chief designer, a loyal officer appointed by the Supreme Executor himself, instructed the forge-programmers to make accommodations for the installation of special blast-proof insulated paneling produced by Sindria itself.

If the passages are a bit narrower, conduits prone to overheating, and flush-set panels somewhat unwieldy to access, the official readiness reports include no criticism of the changes. Everyone agrees in both public and - as the Internal Security Ministry can attest - in private, that the stark grandeur of the Lion's Guard fleet is breathtaking.

Crew casualties in combat are increased by %s. The base flux dissipation rate is reduced by %s, and the repair rate for disabled weapons and engines is reduced by %s.",Reduces the ship's performance.,,graphics/hullmods/special_modifications.png
Vast Bulk,vastbulk,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.VastBulk,"The main body of this structure is vast and is, for practical purposes, capable of absorbing any amount of damage from conventional weapons without being destroyed.",,,graphics/hullmods/vast_bulk.png
Axial Rotation,axialrotation,,,,,,,,TRUE,,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.AxialRotation,This structure constantly rotates around its axis.,,,graphics/hullmods/axial_rotation.png
Anchor Rotation,anchorrotation,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.AnchorRotation,This structure rotates around its anchor attachment point. For station modules only.,,,graphics/hullmods/axial_rotation.png
Reduced Explosion,reduced_explosion,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.ReducedExplosion,Reduced explosion radius and damage.,,,graphics/hullmods/reduced_explosion.png
Always Detaches,always_detaches,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.AlwaysDetaches,Always detaches from parent structure when destroyed.,,,graphics/hullmods/detach_always.png
Never Detaches,never_detaches,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.NeverDetaches,Never detaches from parent structure when destroyed.,,,graphics/hullmods/detach_never.png
No Weapon Flux,no_weapon_flux,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.NoWeaponFlux,Weapon fire costs no flux. Used on fighters for fine-grained control of effective shield hitpoints.,,,
Do Not Fire Through,do_not_fire_through,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,data.hullmods.DoNotFireThrough,"Weapons on other modules of a station will avoid firing through this module, even though the shots would go over it and not hit.",,,
Shard Spawner,shard_spawner,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.ShardSpawner,Spawns shard ships when ship is disabled/destroyed.,,,
Do Not Back Off,do_not_back_off,,,,,,,,TRUE,TRUE,0,0,0,0,com.fs.starfarer.api.impl.hullmods.DoNotBackOff,Sets DO_NOT_BACK_OFF AIFlag,,,
